window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2501,"title":"Chapter 2501 - Zuo Qingluan Realizes Something Is Wrong","paragraphs":["Emperor Wu didn’t know what to say.","In the delivery room.","Zuo Qingluan knew where to find the undead insect which she had put inside the mother.","To avoid any suspicion, she couldn’t find the source of the problem too fast.","Concubine Oriole looked expectantly at Zuo Qingluan. “Miss Qingluan, please help me... You’re my only hope now. I don’t trust Feng Wu...” Concubine Oriole whimpered.","She wanted to cry and shout, but she was too exhausted to raise her voice.","Zuo Qingluan smirked.","Help her?","That had never been part of her plan.","If Concubine Oriole was kept alive, other people might find evidence on her that could lead back to Zuo Qingluan. Therefore, the lady had to die.","But Concubine Oriole didn’t know that. She looked at Zuo Qingluan and relaxed a little.","Then, Zuo Qingluan realized that something was wrong.","Her undead insect was supposed to be at the entrance of the mother’s womb. Zuo Qingluan could use the insect in her own body to control the one inside Concubine Oriole and guide it out of her womb. That way, she wouldn’t leave any evidence behind.","It was a perfect plan, but...","She couldn’t sense the other undead insect anymore.","It was dead!","Zuo Qingluan was shocked.","How could that happen?","That undead insect was a top-level one!","She had been feeding it her blood every day. It shouldn’t have died so easily!","Come out...","Zuo Qingluan tried to lure out the undead insect.","But no matter how hard she tried, nothing happened.","Soon –","“It hurts...” Concubine Oriole’s voice grew weaker and weaker.","Zuo Qingluan turned to Master Chu. “A natural birth is out of the question. Our only option is to cut Concubine Oriole’s belly open and take out the baby!”","Master Chu said, “But that will kill the mother!”","Looking at Concubine Oriole, who was slipping into unconsciousness, Zuo Qingluan said coldly, “It’s either her or the baby. Which one is it going to be?”","Master Chu said, “It’s not our call. Concubine Oriole should be the one making that choice. She alone has the right to decide who lives.”","He remained level-headed.","Zuo Qingluan smirked. “The empress dowager gave me the order before I came in: If only one of them can live, choose the baby. I’m simply following her order.”","She then took out a dagger and aimed it at Concubine Oriole’s belly.","She needed to move fast.","That was because the undead insect turned into blood after it died, and the baby was absorbing it now. If she waited any longer, the baby would die.","“Your blade isn’t disinfected!” Master Chu stared at her. “Miss Feng Wu says that all blades need to be disinfected. A dirty blade will get the patient killed!”","Zuo Qingluan glared at him. “She’s going to die, anyway. Master Chu, move aside.”"]},{"number":2502,"title":"Chapter 2502 - Zuo Qingluan’s Failure (1)","paragraphs":["Master Chu insisted, “Disinfect the blade first!”","Zuo Qingluan wanted to kill the stubborn old man.","This was the first time she was showing off her skills in front of the empress dowager. She didn’t care about Concubine Oriole, but she would be so humiliated if she couldn’t save the baby.","Left with no other choice, Zuo Qingluan had to heat the blade first before she cut open Concubine Oriole’s belly.","The baby was indeed a boy.","But his skin was a light purple, and he wasn’t making a sound.","Master Chu was busy treating Concubine Oriole, when Zuo Qingluan said coldly, “Don’t bother. The little prince is our priority.","Concubine Oriole wasn’t completely unconscious. She heard what Zuo Qingluan said.","She looked up at Zuo Qingluan and couldn’t believe how coldblooded she was.","But she couldn’t even lift a finger.","Zuo Qingluan was treating the baby.","Her face had darkened a little.","The baby had absorbed some of the blood of the undead insect.","And he was poisoned.","The undead insect was from Firmament Palace and could be traced back to her.","Zuo Qingluan studied the baby.","She wondered if she should save him.","If he was alive, he would become evidence of her crime.","But if she didn’t save him, the others would think that she wasn’t good enough. Would the empress dowager ever trust her again?","She decided to keep him alive and neutralize the poison later.","The midwife was so nervous that she almost burst into tears.","The baby was silent. She was worried that if the baby died, she would be punished as well.","Zuo Qingluan smacked the baby on his butt.","The baby cried.","The midwife let out a breath of relief.","Zuo Qingluan then headed out.","Master Chu said, “What about Concubine Oriole? Aren’t you going to do something?”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t even look back. “She’s bound to die. There’s no need to do anything.” Master Chu couldn’t believe his ears.","Concubine Oriole didn’t want to die.","She finally had a son, and her new life had just begun.","“I don’t want to die...”","Zuo Qingluan left the room with the baby.","The empress dowager was pleased to see that it was a boy.","But that didn’t mean that she was fond of the baby.","Jun Linyuan was the only grandson she loved. As for the other princes and princesses, they were as good as strangers to her.","“How about Concubine Oriole?” Emperor Wu asked.","Zuo Qingluan shook her head. “Concubine Oriole volunteered to have her belly cut open to save the baby. Your Majesty, if you go inside now, you can still say goodbye to her.”","How coldblooded! Emperor Wu glared at Zuo Qingluan.","How could she say such a thing in such a calm voice?","The empress dowager frowned. “You mean you can’t save Concubine Oriole.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “I’m sorry, Your Majesties.”","Concubine Oriole had an influential family as well.","Her brother worked in Northern Feng General’s army.","Since Concubine Oriole was on Empress Dugu’s side, so was her brother."]},{"number":2503,"title":"Chapter 2503 - Zuo Qingluan’s Failure (2)","paragraphs":["Northern Feng General had never seen eye to eye with Empress Dugu, and having Zhang Ying, Concubine Oriole’s brother, in his army was quite the pain in the neck.","Because of that, Feng Xun didn’t like Concubine Oriole at all.","Of course, Feng Wu didn’t know that.","Master Chu suddenly rushed out of the bedchamber and said to Emperor Wu, “Your Majesty, there’s still hope! We just need to get Miss Feng Wu back!”","Emperor Wu asked, “Are you sure?”","Master Chu said, “Yes. Her Majesty was in critical condition several times, and Miss Feng Wu managed to turn things around every single time. I’m sure that she’ll be able to do something!”","The empress dowager was about to object, but what Master Chu said rendered her speechless.","Emperor Wu looked at the crying baby.","The baby had just been born, and he still had a whole life in front of him. If Concubine Oriole died, Emperor Wu would feel guilty for the rest of his life over the death of the baby’s mother...","That was what Jun Linyuan had gone through; Emperor Wu wondered if that was why his son had turned out the way he was.","At that thought, he glanced at Gao, who took the hint and left the room.","Concubine Oriole was slipping in and out of consciousness. She had lost all hope.","“I’m going to die...","“I’m going to die...","“I don’t want to die! Brother, help me!”","But Zuo Qingluan had been so certain that she would die.","Concubine Oriole regretted her decision. Feng Wu had said that she could keep both her and her son alive, but she chose Zuo Qingluan instead. In the end, Concubine Oriole was abandoned.","She wondered if things would have been different if she had chosen Feng Wu.","Gao soon came back.","He was on his own.","Zuo Qingluan smiled. She didn’t believe that Feng Wu would return.","Why should she come back if she couldn’t save anyone? The empress dowager snorted. “I’ve never met such an arrogant girl before!”","ve never","She decided that Feng Wu wasn’t good enough to be her maid, let alone her grandson’s wife. Gao had a small bottle in his hands, and he hurried toward the delivery room.","“Isn’t the girl coming?” Emperor Wu frowned. He understood that she was upset. She had just been told off, but he didn’t like it when she put on airs.","Gao nodded. “Your Majesty, I found Miss Feng Wu in the kitchen, and she was pouring this medicine into the bottle when I found her.","“She said that if Concubine Oriole drinks this, she might still have a chance.”","Emperor Wu said, “Hurry up, then!”","Concubine Oriole didn’t like the idea. “Feng Wu doesn’t like me. She wants me dead...”","Emperor Wu scolded her. “If she meant you harm, she didn’t need to come here at all! She could have just let you die on your own! Do you know how hard it is to get her help?!”","Concubine Oriole was already very weak, and she gave in when Emperor Wu scolded her. She took the bottle and drank the medicine.","Gao said, “Miss Feng Wu said that she wouldn’t come here. As for Concubine Oriole’s belly, Master Chu can sew it up with the method she taught him.”"]},{"number":2504,"title":"Chapter 2504 - Zuo Qingluan’s Failure (3)","paragraphs":["Master Chu asked excitedly, “What are the chances of saving her?”","Concubine Oriole stared at Gao.","Gao imitated Feng Wu and said indifferently, “If Concubine Oriole cooperates, there’s an 80% chance that she’ll live.”","80%?! Concubine Oriole was thrilled.","But she wasn’t convinced because Zuo Qingluan had said that she was going to die...","Emperor Wu had always trusted Feng Wu, so he urged Concubine Oriole, “Just drink it!”","Gao then helped Concubine Oriole take the medicine while Master Chu sutured her stomach.","The door to the delivery room was open.","Everyone outside heard the conversation.","All eyes were on Zuo Qingluan, since she had been so certain that there was no point trying to save Concubine Oriole.","She had given up on Concubine Oriole!","The empress dowager looked at Zuo Qingluan suspiciously. “Is Feng Wu really a better physician than you are?”","At her age, she needed a physician that could treat her effectively around the clock.","Because of that, the empress dowager felt that she tolerated Feng Wu enough. If she could find someone better, however...","Of course, she would choose that person over Feng Wu.","Zuo Qingluan smiled and said, “Concubine Oriole is beyond saving.” Empress Dugu chimed in, “Your Majesty, Concubine Oriole is like a sister to me, and Qingluan is my niece. If there was a way to save Concubine Oriole, I’m sure Qingluan would have done everything she could.","“However, Concubine Oriole’s condition is simply too dire. Even Firmament Palace can’t save her. Childbirth is so challenging for women.”","The empress dowager looked less displeased, but she still said, “But Feng Wu said she could treat Oriole.”","Empress Dugu said, “If she could, she wouldn’t have left so quickly. Your Majesty, talk is cheap.”","The empress dowager agreed with her.","Empress Dugu went on, “If Feng Wu really is that good, she would have cured Bao Er already...”","Because Jun Linyuan cared about Bao Er, the empress dowager liked the girl as well. She nodded when Empress Dugu mentioned her. “Speaking of Bao Er...” Empress Dugu glanced at Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan nodded.","She had felt humiliated when she tried to enrage Jun Linyuan with the news that Feng Wu had stolen the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, and she wanted to get back at Feng Wu.","Although Feng Xun and the crown prince had forgiven Feng Wu, what about the empress dowager? What would she think?","Therefore, Zuo Qingluan had shared that information with Mrs. Zuo before she came to the palace.","wa","Mrs. Zuo was so excited that she immediately told Empress Dugu. Empress Dugu was equally excited, and they began to talk about Bao Er. After getting Zuo Qingluan’s permission, Empress Dugu was about to tell the empress dowager what Feng Wu had done.","But before she could say anything, she heard Emperor Wu’s excited voice.","“Oriole, you’re awake! How do you feel? Master Chu, come here! She looks much better now!”","Emperor Wu seldom sounded so excited. Empress Dugu’s stomach lurched."]},{"number":2505,"title":"Chapter 2505 - Zuo Qingluan’s Failure (4)","paragraphs":["Empress Dugu involuntarily looked at Zuo Qingluan. Zuo Qingluan shook her head to tell the empress to stay calm.","Empress Dugu trusted Zuo Qingluan, so she stopped fidgeting.","But soon, they heard Master Chu’s voice. “Concubine Oriole’s pulse is getting stronger, and the toxin is leaving her system. Your Majesty, Concubine Oriole is getting better.”","“That’s great!” Emperor Wu was excited. “Feng Wu is as impressive as she’s said to be! I did the right thing to trust her! This is great news!”","Concubine Oriole was equally excited. She sat up and wept. “Your Majesty, am I going to live?”","Emperor Wu held her shoulders and nodded. “I told you that Xiao Wu would save you! She didn’t even need to come here. Her medicine alone has cured you!”","Thinking back to what had happened, Concubine Oriole burst into tears. “Your Majesty, I really thought I was going to die! Zuo Qingluan said so herself, and she told Master Chu not to help me!” Her accusation was very effective.","She wrapped her arms around Emperor Wu’s waist and cried at the top of her lungs.","Outside, Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","Her face was scarlet red with rage.","She had to clench her fists to stop herself from losing control.","That woman...","How dare she accuse me like that?!","While she was thinking that, the empress dowager was already walking toward the delivery room.","She stopped at the door and asked, “Is Concubine Oriole alright now?”","Emperor Wu said, “Yes, her condition has stabilized and her pulse is strong. If everything goes as planned, she’ll live.”","The empress dowager nodded.","If she were given the choice, she didn’t want Concubine Oriole to die. After all, this was the empress dowager’s palace, and she didn’t want to have a dead person here.","However...","She turned around and glared at Zuo Qingluan.","“Did you tell Concubine Oriole that she was beyond saving?”","Zuo Qingluan was furious.","She had never been questioned like this before.","The empress dowager stared at her. “Answer","me!”","How dare this old hag talk to me like this?! Zuo Qingluan was furious.","She looked at her hands.","One strike and she could ruin the empress dowager’s face. This old woman has no right to scold me!","The empress dowager said, “For a moment, I really thought that you were a better physician than Feng Wu. But you were just bragging.”","Gosh.","That was harsh.","It was worse than slapping Zuo Qingluan.","How humiliating...","Zuo Qingluan was so embarrassed.","Empress Dugu glanced at Zuo Qingluan. She knew that the proud girl wouldn’t take the criticism well.","Zuo Qingluan wanted to scream.","She recalled how Feng Wu had reacted a moment ago.","When the empress dowager scolded Feng Wu, she promptly left without any hesitation. The empress dowager had been furious. However, Emperor Wu still liked Feng Wu, and there was nothing the empress dowager could do.","Zuo Qingluan realized that she envied Feng Wu."]},{"number":2506,"title":"Chapter 2506 - Zuo Qingluan Panics","paragraphs":["The empress dowager ignored Zuo Qingluan’s embarrassment and kept staring at her.","Zuo Qingluan was so furious that she wanted to scratch the old lady’s eyes out. But she calmed down in the end and told herself, “Zuo Qingluan, you have the True Phoenix Blood, and you’re going to marry Jun Linyuan. You’ll be the winner in the end!”","The thought finally made Zuo Qingluan control her temper.","She said indifferently, “Concubine Oriole’s condition is quite complicated, and she can’t be cured so easily. Plenty of medicine can create the illusion of the patient becoming better before their condition worsens again.”","An illusion?!","The empress dowager had almost given up on Zuo Qingluan, but she was shocked when she heard Zuo Qingluan’s diagnosis. Zuo Qingluan said, “That’s right. The patient will look fine for a short period of time, but they’ll quickly weaken and die.” That was the only possibility Zuo Qingluan could think of.","Because that was what she would make happen. Hence, she reached that conclusion.","The empress dowager asked suspiciously, “Are you sure?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “It’s very possible.”","NS","The empress dowager asked, “How are you going to prove it?”","Zuo Qingluan smiled. “That’s easy. Let me check Concubine Oriole’s pulse.”","She was so certain that even Emperor Wu believed her.","Concubine Oriole had been very cheerful, but her stomach lurched when she heard that.","She gave Emperor Wu a pleading look. The empress dowager said, “Check Concubine Oriole’s pulse, then.” At the end of the day, the empress dowager still cared about herself more.","If Zuo Qingluan really was a better physician, the empress dowager wouldn’t need to tolerate Feng Wu anymore.","The servants carried Concubine Oriole out of the delivery room.","Cining Palace was the empress dowager’s residence, and Concubine Oriole couldn’t stay here forever.","Concubine Oriole gave Zuo Qingluan her hand, but she was on guard.","She had grown to trust Feng Wu more than Zuo Qingluan.","When Zuo Qingluan checked Concubine Oriole’s pulse, she was so astonished that her fingers trembled a little.","What the heck?!","Although Concubine Oriole’s pulse was weaker than a healthy person’s, it was within the normal range.","The undead insect was supposed to turn into a potent toxin when it was destroyed, but Concubine Oriole showed no sign of having been poisoned.","How could this be?","Had someone neutralized the poison already? Was it Feng Wu?","“What did you give her? Show me the bottle,” Zuo Qingluan said to Master Chu.","Master Chu asked, “Miss Zuo, how is Concubine Oriole doing?”","Zuo Qingluan wanted to say that Concubine Oriole was going to die... But that would make her a liar!","She wanted to poison Concubine Oriole again, but to her frustration —","When she tried to put another undead insect inside Concubine Oriole, the insect wouldn’t go in.","Fearing that the insect would be spotted, Zuo Qingluan had to retrieve it.","Not only wouldn’t the undead insect go inside Concubine Oriole, it also seemed frightened.","What was it afraid of?","The first one had gone in just fine.","Zuo Qingluan panicked a little.","The undead insect was her secret weapon, and she had defeated many enemies with it. But","now..."]},{"number":2507,"title":"Chapter 2507 - Humiliated Again","paragraphs":["Naturally, Master Chu was on Feng Wu’s side. He asked Zuo Qingluan, “Miss Zuo, what do you think of Concubine Oriole’s condition?”","Before Zuo Qingluan could answer, Master Chu said, “Master Bai and I have examined Concubine Oriole already. She’s doing fine. What do you think?”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","Her face was livid.","She was furious that Concubine Oriole was doing very well.","Moreover, when she tried to poison Concubine Oriole again, the undead insect kept running away.","Master Chu wouldn’t let Zuo Qingluan off the hook.","Emperor Wu realized it as well and joined in. “Do you think there’s something wrong with Concubine Oriole?”","Zuo Qingluan shook her head.","Emperor Wu asked, “Do you think there’s something wrong with Feng Wu’s treatment, then?”","Zuo Qingluan was filled with rage, but she had no choice but to shake her head again. Emperor Wu said, “In that case, let go. You’re keeping Concubine Oriole from getting her","rest.”","With a wave of his hand, the servants carried Concubine Oriole back to her own palace.","What Zuo Qingluan failed to notice was Concubine Oriole glaring at her as if they were enemies.","Zuo Qingluan had tried to kill her!","Concubine Oriole had noticed it.","When Zuo Qingluan checked her pulse, she had tried to plant an insect in her!","It was tinier than a sesame seed, and Zuo Qingluan had hidden it in her nail. No one else had noticed.","But Concubine Oriole had almost died tonight, so she was more careful than everyone else.","Zuo Qingluan had given up on her, but she was saved by Feng Wu’s potion. After that, Concubine Oriole began to suspect Zuo Qingluan.","She tried to recall the moment she fell, and she seemed to remember a force coming from Zuo Qingluan’s direction. Now, Zuo Qingluan had tried to put an insect in her!","Concubine Oriole hated Zuo Qingluan to the bone, but Zuo Qingluan still knew nothing of it.","Or maybe she did know, but she simply didn’t care. To her, Concubine Oriole wasn’t worth her concern.","Concubine Oriole sat up in bed and told a maid, “Fetch me some paper!”","She was going to write to her brother to tell him that if something happened to her son, Zuo Qingluan was the culprit.","“Zuo Qingluan was helping Empress Dugu and tried to kill me!","“Empress Dugu, I’ve done everything for you! When His Majesty came to visit me, I persuaded him to go to your palace instead. However, you want to kill me!”","Concubine Oriole now hated both Zuo Qingluan and Empress Dugu.","Those two women would never have thought that the incident today would bring them so much trouble in the future...","1 SO","Zuo Qingluan was cornered by Emperor Wu. Emperor Wu said, “It was a life and death situation. If you can’t do it, just say so. There’s always someone better out there.”","He walked away after that, displeased by Zuo Qingluan’s dark face.","Empress Dugu panicked.","She knew that if she let Emperor Wu leave like that, he would never like Zuo Qingluan again. She had to think of something to distract him."]},{"number":2508,"title":"Chapter 2508 - The First Worshipper","paragraphs":["Empress Dugu said, “Your Majesty!” Emperor Wu was going to leave, but he stopped when he heard his wife’s call.","“Your Majesty, it’s not like that! We don’t know what Concubine Oriole’s condition will be like after this or if Feng Wu’s treatment will definitely work.”","“Are you hoping that Concubine Oriole won’t be cured?” Emperor Wu frowned.","“Of course not.” Empress Dugu shook her head and said loudly, “Your Majesty, I’m only saying that Qingluan may be as good a physician as Feng Wu...”","Emperor Wu smiled a little. “I can make my own decision.”","He thought, “I have eyes. I don’t need you to tell me who’s a better physician.”","He turned away from her. Empress Dugu panicked. She knew that the emperor was convinced that Feng Wu was better.","“Your Majesty! Qingluan was the first worshipper of the year, and Master Linghu called her a blessed child! Don’t you trust Master Linghu?” Empress Dugu asked. Hearing that, the empress dowager’s eyes lit up.","Empress Dugu had mentioned it before. Now that she brought it up again, the empress dowager was reminded of this piece of important information.","“That’s right. Master Linghu said so.”","Empress Dugu said, “Your Majesty, Master Linghu made her the first worshipper of the year. She would be the ideal wife for any family!”","The empress dowager nodded to herself.","She liked the idea of “the blessed child.” It would certainly benefit her grandson.","Empress Dugu was thrilled when she saw the empress dowager nod. It seemed that being the first worshipper was enough to cancel out the negative effect of not curing Concubine Oriole.","Nase.","But when she turned to Emperor Wu, she saw something unexpected.","He was sneering as if he knew something.","Empress Dugu’s stomach lurched.","Emperor Wu turned to Zuo Qingluan. “Why did I hear that Feng Wu was the first worshipper?”","Zuo Qingluan went pale.","Why was everyone talking about Feng Wu?","Why was every","as e","Couldn’t she just disappear?!","She took a deep breath and was about to answer, when Emperor Wu said, “I went to Wandering Temple today to pray for the baby. Miss Zuo, were you really the first worshipper at Wandering Temple this year?”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","Empress Dugu panicked.","Zuo Qingluan flushed and said indifferently, “My master is Master Linghu’s friend, and I had the honor to meet Master Linghu the other day. I think Master Linghu was only wishing me good luck when he called me a blessed child.”","She tried to talk her way out of the awkward situation.","But the empress dowager wouldn’t let her, because she felt that her chance had been taken away.","“Were you not the first worshipper?”","Zuo Qingluan shook her head. “My family was the first to worship at Guangyuan Temple.”","Guangyuan Temple was much bigger in size, but Wandering Temple was more famous because of Master Linghu. Hence, Guangyuan Temple was only the second largest temple in the empire.","The empress dowager glared at Zuo Qingluan."]},{"number":2509,"title":"Chapter 2509 - Immortal Spiritual Fruit","paragraphs":["The empress dowager wanted to call Zuo Qingluan a liar, but the girl had indeed been the first worshipper, only that it was at Guangyuan Temple.","And she had indeed met Master Linghu before, and the master had blessed her out of kindness.","Seeing that the crisis was almost over, Empress Dugu changed the subject.","She knew that the empress dowager was angry. And the old lady never forgave those who wronged her. She wouldn’t remember whoever had been kind to her, but if someone offended her in the slightest way, she would hold a grudge against them forever!","To distract her, there was only one way.","Empress Dugu knew that she had to make Feng Wu sound a hundred times worse than Zuo Qingluan. That way, the empress dowager would shift her hatred to Feng Wu.","Empress Dugu said, “Speaking of Miss Feng Wu, I heard something recently. I don’t know if it’s my place to say it...” Emperor Wu said, “Then don’t say it.” He knew that Empress Dugu wouldn’t say anything nice about Feng Wu.","Empress Dugu mumbled, “But it has something to do with Concubine Oriole and Princess Bao Er. I think I should share the information...”","“Cut to the chase!” The empress dowager was impatient.","Empress Dugu said, “A year ago, we received information about the Immortal Spiritual Fruit from Northern Border City, and His Royal Highness went there immediately.”","She stole a glance at the empress dowager.","As expected, the empress dowager listened carefully when Jun Linyuan was mentioned.","Empress Dugu knew what the old lady wanted to hear. “When His Royal Highness arrived at Northern Border City, Yu Mingye of the Dark Dynasty was there as well. His Royal Highness went through much peril to obtain the fruit.”","The empress dowager frowned. “However, someone stole that Immortal Spiritual Fruit from His Royal Highness,” said Empress Dugu.","“What?!” The empress dowager smacked the table.","“Who was it?!”","Empress Dugu said, “The thief was so cunning that even His Royal Highness was caught off guard. To make it worse, His Royal Highness couldn’t find that person afterward. The frustration upset him for a whole year...”","“Find that person and kill them!” the empress dowager growled.","Empress Dugu said, “That person is so crafty. If His Royal Highness is surrounded by such people...”","The empress dowager was furious. “How dare they get close to Junjun!”","Jun Linyuan was the only person the empress dowager cared for.","The boy had never failed at anything, and she couldn’t believe that someone could do such a thing to him. “Your Majesty, that person was in Northern Border City.","“That person lost the ability to cultivate, but the Immortal Spiritual Fruit enabled them to regain the ability.","“After that, they made such rapid progress that they’re already a Level 6 Spiritual Lord!","“And that person is so proud just because they have good medical skills.”","Northern Border City? Regaining cultivation ability? Good medical skills?","A name came to the empress dowager’s mind. “Feng Wu?!”"]},{"number":2510,"title":"Chapter 2510 - It Was Her","paragraphs":["When the empress dowager said Feng Wu’s name, Zuo Qingluan closed her eyes and let out a breath of relief.","Her plan had worked.","With everything that had happened, Zuo Qingluan had to admit that Feng Wu was a formidable enemy.","Feng Wu didn’t even need to come here in person.","She only sent Gao back with a bottle of potion. Not only did it neutralize the poison, it also stopped Zuo Qingluan’s undead insects.","I can’t let her win so easily.","“What will other people think of me?","Zuo Qingluan was determined to destroy Feng Wu.","“Feng Wu? It really was her?” The empress dowager went pale. “She stole Junjun’s Immortal Spiritual Fruit! She’s going to pay for","it!”","Granny Lan’s heart sank.","She was right!","The empress dowager smacked the table. “Go to the Feng clan and bring that girl here! I’m going to kill her!”","Zuo Qingluan and Empress Dugu exchanged pleased looks.","Feng Wu was doomed.","Emperor Wu didn’t know what to do. He had grown to like Feng Wu a lot and already saw her as his future daughter-in-law. But now...","Seeing how furious his mother was, Emperor Wu said, “Mother, that might not be what happened...”","Empress Dugu said, “Your Majesty, it’s the truth!”","Emperor Wu glared at her. “Shut up!”","Empress Dugu lowered her head.","The empress dowager glared at Emperor Wu. “Not another word!”","Emperor Wu didn’t know what to say.","The empress dowager said, “What did I tell you? That Feng Wu is trouble! Do you see her face? Her mother is just like that, and so is she!”","Emperor Wu tried to interrupt. “Mother, Lady Ling is...”","The empress dowager wouldn’t listen. “She’s been trying to get close to Junjun ever since he went to Northern Border City. She’s using him! She stole the Immortal Spiritual Fruit that would save Bao Er! Even if you don’t care about Bao Er, have you forgotten about your sister?!”","The mention of his sister rendered Emperor Wu speechless.","The empress dowager ranted, “Do you think the Immortal Spiritual Fruit was what Feng Wu really wanted? That was just the beginning!","“I don’t know what she did, but ever since Junjun came back from the north, he hasn’t been able to take his eyes off her!”","Emperor Wu said, “Not at first...”","“I have eyes, and I saw it! Junjun has been following her wherever she goes!” the empress dowager shouted.","Empress Dugu and Zuo Qingluan had been smiling, but hearing that, they suddenly felt depressed.","The empress dowager looked like she was about to explode. “I don’t care! Junjun can’t have that girl around him! She’s going to ruin him! Kill her!”","Emperor Wu couldn’t believe how unreasonable his mother was.","The empress dowager said, “Kill her, or don’t ever see me again!”"]},{"number":2511,"title":"Chapter 2511 - Zuo Qingluan Said So","paragraphs":["Emperor Wu didn’t know what to say.","He began to wonder if he had indulged his mother too much. She had become so arrogant and willful that he couldn’t remember what she was like before.","He knew that whenever he indulged his women too much, they became unreasonable.","Why was his mother giving him the same feeling? Or was he overthinking it?","“What are you waiting for? Kill her!” the empress dowager urged.","Zuo Qingluan and Empress Dugu looked at Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu cleared his throat and put his hands behind his back, as if he was waiting for someone.","He was.","When Empress Dugu mentioned the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, he knew that his mother would be furious.","He couldn’t do anything about his mother, but someone else could.","Gao had already sent a servant to fetch Jun Linyuan.","Emperor Wu thought, “It’s time to test how much Jun Linyuan cares for Feng Wu.”","It would take Jun Linyuan at least fifteen minutes to come to court from his residence after he received the message.","Only eight minutes had passed so far, so the servant should have just arrived at the crown prince’s residence.","Emperor Wu thought that he needed to stall for a few more minutes.","But he was wrong.","He heard footsteps outside.","“All hail His Royal Highness —”","Ssss —","Emperor Wu drew in his breath because Jun Linyuan had arrived much sooner than he had expected. Everyone turned in that direction.","Zuo Qingluan had a bad feeling when she heard the announcement.","She had only revealed the secret to the empress dowager because Jun Linyuan had forgiven Feng Wu. She wanted the empress dowager to hate Feng Wu so that she could put some pressure on Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan arrived with his usual demeanor.","His intimidating aura filled the room.","It was an aura which overpowered Emperor Wu’s.","And he was unapproachable.","Everyone in the room could sense his energy.","Feng Xun came in after Jun Linyuan.","He gave Zuo Qingluan a taunting look, and Zuo Qingluan had to pretend that she didn’t see it.","She had a feeling that she was going to be humiliated again.","She tried to convince herself that it wasn’t going to happen.","“Junjun -“","The empress dowager was excited to see Jun Linyuan. She grabbed his hand and said, “Junjun! My Baby Jun...” Baby Jun... Feng Xun wanted to laugh, but he forced himself to keep a straight face.","Boss Jun would kill him if he laughed.","Jun Linyuan frowned and said coldly, “Grandmother!”","He had talked to the empress dowager twice about the way she addressed him.","His tone reminded the empress dowager of their conversation, so she took his hand and said obsequiously, “Sure, sure, I won’t call you that. But you’ve been so careless! How could you let someone trick you like that? If Zuo Qingluan hadn’t told me, I would never have known so many things.”","Zuo Qingluan glared at the empress dowager.","How could she say that?!","To make herself seem a neutral party, Zuo Qingluan had told the whole thing to Empress Dugu, who had then told the empress dowager; why would the empress dowager blame everything on her? You’re ruining my reputation, you old hag!"]},{"number":2512,"title":"Chapter 2512 - 2 He’s Pleased","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan was so furious that she wanted to slap the empress dowager. But the empress dowager didn’t know that. She was holding Jun Linyuan’s hand and complaining. “Jun Linyuan, that Feng Wu is so evil! She’s been using you the whole time!”","Jun Linyuan wanted to retort, but the agitated empress dowager wouldn’t let him.","“Junjun, shall we kill her?” Kill her?!","Jun Linyuan’s eyes glinted coldly when he heard those words.","The empress dowager was chilled to the bone, and her stomach lurched.","She felt as if she was being dragged into an abyss.","She was horrified.","Jun Linyuan calmed down and said, “I know what she did.”","He knew?!","Everyone stared at Jun Linyuan in disbelief.","Why didn’t he kill Feng Wu, then?","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath.","She already knew that it was impossible to make Jun Linyuan get angry at Feng Wu. She only hoped that he wouldn’t blame her for telling the empress dowager.","The empress dowager stared at Jun Linyuan. “You knew? Then why didn’t you kill her? She stole Bao Er’s Immortal Spiritual Fruit!”","She couldn’t understand why the boy wouldn’t kill the person who deserved to die.","Jun Linyuan gave her a warning look and said coldly, “I’m not killing her.”","The empress dowager was disappointed. The boy had never given her that look before.","She said, “But she...”","Jun Linyuan waved her off. “She said she would treat Bao Er.”","The empress dowager asked, “What if she can’t cure Bao Er?”","All eyes were on Jun Linyuan. They all wondered the same thing. What if Feng Wu couldn’t cure Bao Er? Her condition was so severe that even Master Linghu couldn’t do much about it.","Zuo Qingluan, who had wanted to leave, also stopped and looked at Jun Linyuan.","What if Feng Wu couldn’t cure Bao Er? His Royal Highness would have to kill her then, right?","However...","The crown prince’s answer surprised everyone.","“If she can’t cure Bao Er, she’ll use herself as compensation.”","Teehee —","Feng Xun didn’t want to laugh, but he couldn’t help it.","He had never seen the crown prince lie like that.","But he was the only one laughing. The other people were all astonished.","Feng Wu would be the compensation...","How could that happen?!","That was preposterous!","Zuo Qingluan looked at Jun Linyuan and saw the pleased look on his face.","Why was he so pleased?","Zuo Qingluan was so shocked that her mind went blank.","No!","I won’t admit it!","I’ll never admit that His Royal Highness is in love with Feng Wu! Never!","Zuo Qingluan put a hand on her chest, and the dull pain made her want to cry.","His Royal Highness must be in love with Feng Wu’s good looks!","That’s right!","It’s only her looks that he’s into!","The empress dowager was almost as furious as Zuo Qingluan was."]},{"number":2513,"title":"Chapter 2513 - It’s Not Your Call","paragraphs":["Somehow, the empress dowager felt as if her dear grandson was being taken away from her. She grabbed Jun Linyuan’s hand and shook her head. “Junjun, we can’t have her! She’ll bring you so much trouble!”","She was certain that Feng Wu was using Jun Linyuan, and she couldn’t wait for Feng Wu to disappear. There was no way she would let Feng Wu anywhere near her grandson.","But the crown prince...","He looked at the empress dowager and made an announcement.","He said calmly, “It’s not your call.”","Someone chuckled.","This time, it was Emperor Wu.","He feared that his mother would hear her, so he quickly turned to the other side.","The empress dowager had been bullying him all this time, but now, she couldn’t do anything to Jun Linyuan.","The empress dowager was so shocked.","She didn’t know what to say. She stared at Jun Linyuan, but no words would come out of her mouth.","Jun Linyuan then turned around and glared at Zuo Qingluan.","“Don’t come to court anymore.” He stopped Zuo Qingluan from trying to win over the empress dowager.","Zuo Qingluan felt as if she had been slapped.","“I wasn’t the one who told the empress dowager...” She tried to explain. But she was talking to the crown prince.","He was Jun Linyuan.","He didn’t listen to excuses.","That was, apart from Feng Wu’s excuses. He looked at Zuo Qingluan as if she were a total stranger. Zuo Qingluan’s heart sank.","Jun Linyuan left before she could say another word.","He walked away, just like that.","As soon as he was gone, the air didn’t feel so frigid anymore.","Jun Wuxia was the first to react.","She glared at Zuo Qingluan. “Didn’t you say that my brother is madly in love with you? Does it look like he’s infatuated?!”","Empress Dugu wanted to smack Jun Wuxia.","Why would she say such a thing?!","However, Empress Dugu’s attitude toward Zuo Qingluan had also changed.","She thought highly of Zuo Qingluan because, apart from being the sacred lady of Firmament Palace and having the True Phoenix Blood, the crown prince was also supposed to be madly in love with her.","Such humiliation...","Zuo Qingluan swayed and fell to the floor.","She had fainted.","“Qingluan?!” Mrs. Zuo and Empress Dugu both rushed to her side.","All people sympathized with the weak.","If Zuo Qingluan had stormed off, no one would be impressed, but now that she had passed out, people felt sorry for her.","The empress dowager hated Feng Wu so much that she was almost out of her mind.","An enemy’s enemy was a friend. Therefore, she liked Zuo Qingluan very much now. “Master Chu, do something!” the empress dowager shouted at Master Chu.","Master Chu rubbed his nose. Poor Feng Wu. She wasn’t even here, but the empress dowager hated her so much.","The incident was kept a secret from many people, but Feng Wu wasn’t just anyone.","Feng Xun saw everything.","In Fallen Star Yard – “Xiao Wu, listen to me. It was hilarious!”"]},{"number":2514,"title":"Chapter 2514 - How Troublesome","paragraphs":["Feng Xun went all the way to Fallen Star Yard to tell Feng Wu what happened.","“Can you imagine? When the empress dowager said that it was Zuo Qingluan who told her, Zuo Qingluan looked like she wanted to kill someone.","“And when Boss Jun said that you were going to make yourself the compensation, the empress dowager and Zuo Qingluan looked like they had seen a ghost.","“Zuo Qingluan thought she could use that piece of information against you, but she failed.","“It was hilarious!”","Feng Wu rested her face on her hands and looked at Feng Xun curiously.","Feng Wu asked, “Did His Royal Highness really humiliate Zuo Qingluan in front of so many people?”","Feng Xun nodded. “Yes, he did. Boss Jun doesn’t care how the empress dowager feels, let alone Zuo Qingluan. The most ridiculous thing is that Princess Jun Wuxia asked Zuo Qingluan afterward, ‘Didn’t you say that my brother is madly in love with you? Does it look like he’s infatuated?’","“Zuo Qingluan was so furious that she passed out after that.”","Feng Xun was laughing, but Feng Wu felt troubled.","Why is Zuo Qingluan so stubborn? Other people would have admitted that Jun Linyuan is in love with me! I should have finished the eleventh trial by now!","But now, she was stuck.","Zuo Qingluan knew what was going on, but she just wouldn’t face the truth.","Because of that, Feng Wu couldn’t finish the trial. How annoying.","But there was something else even more troublesome.","That was Jun Linyuan’s attitude toward her. She couldn’t bring herself to think further, and tried to convince herself that they were fine being just friends.","Feng Xun shook his head.","Why was he even telling her all this? He had better things to do.","He wanted to show Feng Wu what Boss Jun had done for her. He hoped that those things would move her heart.","Feng Xun could see that the girl had hidden her feelings away.","Just then, they heard footsteps outside.","Chaoge had arrived.","“There.” She handed Feng Wu a letter.","“What’s that?” Feng Wu was perplexed.","“It’s the registration letter for Year 4.” Chaoge grinned at Feng Wu. “I’m in Year 4 as well, and we’ll be going together.” Feng Wu said, “When did you skip Year 3?” Chaoge said, “When you were obsessing over the crown prince.” Feng Wu said, “When did I ever do that?”","Chaoge said, “Fine, you didn’t. You were just competing with Zuo Qingluan. Therefore, I took the test on my own, and I passed. I can go to Year 4 with you!”","Feng Wu shook her head and picked up the letter.","She frowned. “Tomorrow? Do I have to go?”","Feng Xun nodded. “You do. Normally, the passageway to Year 4 only opens once a month. If you don’t go tomorrow, you’ll have to wait another month.”"]},{"number":2515,"title":"Chapter 2515 - Who Else?","paragraphs":["Feng Xun grinned at Feng Wu. “Of course, that restriction is only for ordinary people. If Boss Jun goes with you, that passageway is always","open.”","All the things privilege could do...","Feng Wu nodded. “I’ll go to Year 4. That is, the War Academy.”","In the Imperial College, each year was given a different name, and Year 4 was the War Academy.","Seeing that Feng Wu was going, Feng Xun became serious. “Of course, you can go to the War Academy, but once you’re there, just be a normal student. Don’t get involved in anything else.”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you mean by ‘anything else’?”","Feng Xun said sternly, “You’re not a student there yet, and there are things you can’t be told yet. Once you’re officially one of them, you’ll know. I can’t make an exception for you.”","Feng Wu’s heart sank a little. By the sound of it, things could get quite serious.","Feng Xun said, “Boss Jun and I have graduated from Year 4, and we can’t go back as students. Once you’re there, you’re on your own.”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Feng Xun said, “What I can tell you is that the students there are all very aggressive. They love fighting. If someone picks on you, you can go to Chen Ziyun for help. He’s the president of the Martial Arts Society.","“But don’t get too close to him. In fact, don’t go to him unless it’s really necessary!”","Feng Wu was intrigued. Who was this Chen Ziyun, and why would he have such an effect on Feng Xun?","“And don’t take part in their wars,” said Feng Xun. “No matter how persuasive they are, don’t get involved!”","“Wars?” Feng Wu was perplexed. “What wars?”","Feng Xun said sternly, “I can’t tell you more. I’m already telling you too much. Just keep in mind: Don’t join them!”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","She was more concerned about her tasks. The eleventh trial still wasn’t finished, and there was also the bonus task regarding Bao Er.","She knew that things wouldn’t always turn out the way she wanted.","Sometimes it was up to fate.","“Remember to ask around about the Immortal Spiritual Fruit for me,” she reminded Feng Xun.","Feng Xun nodded.","Feng Wu wasn’t going to stay in Year 4 for too long. The 12 Trials of Love and Bao Er were the top priority. She would graduate from the War Academy in a month.","Because she wouldn’t be home for a month, she made sure that everything was covered.","She felt quite safe now that two elders had become her friends and that the white fairy was guarding Fallen Star Yard.","The next day, Feng Wu and Chaoge went to the assembly hall of the War Academy.","The location surprised both of them.","Because it was a gambling house.","It was Lucky House, the biggest gambling house in the empire.","They followed the winding corridor and arrived at a courtyard.","Two people were already waiting there. Feng Wu recognized them right away. They weren’t exactly friends.","One was Gu Xingyuan, the third son of the Gu family.","The other one was Chu Junying, the girl who had a crush on Gu Xingyuan.","Feng Wu wondered why Gu Xingyuan was here since she didn’t think that he was capable enough."]},{"number":2516,"title":"Chapter 2516 - Enemies (1)","paragraphs":["And how did Chu Junying get in?","Hadn’t the Gu family been arrested for treason? Why was Gu Xingyuan still a free man? Feng Wu wondered if she had missed something","She glanced at them again. Level 6 Spiritual Lords?!","Both Gu Xingyuan and Chu Junying had become Level 6 Spiritual Lords!","A teacher was already there to greet them. Feng Wu heard Gu Xingyuan address him as Mr. Han.","Mr. Han was kind to Gu Xingyuan, but the look he gave Feng Wu wasn’t very friendly.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Gu Xingyuan’s eyes were filled with hatred when he looked at Feng Wu.","But he soon looked away.","Feng Wu knew that he was only temporarily hiding his hatred, which had to be gnawing at his heart now.","She didn’t dwell on it. She was a Level 9 Spiritual Lord and far more advanced than he was.","“Mr. Han, is everyone here? Can we leave now?” Gu Xingyuan asked calmly, as if he didn’t see Feng Wu. Mr. Han shook his head.","Were more people coming?","Just then, there were footsteps outside —","Everyone turned around.","“Miss Qingluan?!”","Chu Junying cried out in surprise.","She had met Zuo Qingluan before and was a big fan. Finding Zuo Qingluan here was a very big surprise.","Gu Xingyuan was equally amazed. Mr. Han had remained nonchalant until Zuo Qingluan showed up. He quickly walked up to her and greeted her respectfully. “Miss Qingluan, you’re finally here. Please.”","He then blocked Feng Wu’s way. A portal opened.","In Feng Wu’s eyes, it looked a lot like an elevator.","Chaoge was displeased when Mr. Han got in the way. Zuo Qingluan had been trying to undermine Feng Wu recently, but Feng Wu had managed to defuse all the crises. Duan Chaoge despised Zuo Qingluan for what she had done. However, the sacred lady still had a lot of fans.","“We got here first! We should go in before her!” Chaoge was indignant that Xiao Wu had to make way for this fake fairy.","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t be bothered to look at Chaoge or Feng Wu.","It was as if her recent failures never existed. She was back to being the arrogant sacred lady.","Chaoge was furious.","What was that attitude?!","Mr. Han glanced at Chaoge and said, “Who gave you permission to speak?”","Duan Chaoge stared in shocked silence.","Mr. Han then bowed and made an inviting gesture to Zuo Qingluan. He said obsequiously, “This way please, Miss Qingluan.”","Zuo Qingluan then walked through the portal.","Chaoge stomped her foot.","Feng Wu glanced at her. “Calm down.”","Chaoge said, “Who does she think she is? Did you see how she looked at you? I’m so —”.","The portal was about to close.","Mr. Han asked impatiently, “Are you going in or not?”"]},{"number":2517,"title":"Chapter 2517 - Enemies (2)","paragraphs":["Chaoge said, “We’re n-“","But Feng Wu dragged her through the portal.","Chaoge glared at her, wondering why they had to put up with these people.","Feng Wu glanced at her.","Chaoge needed to grow up. Right now, she would explode at the slightest provocation, which wasn’t a good thing.","She had to control her temper. Otherwise, it would become her downfall one day.","In the tiny space inside the portal —","Gu Xingyuan glared at Feng Wu. If looks could kill, she would already be dead. Feng Wu was the reason he had lost his whole clan. Chu Junying was Gu Xingyun’s girlfriend, and she worshipped Zuo Qingluan, so she hated Feng Wu even more.","Everyone knew of the grudge between Zuo Qingluan and Feng Wu.","It was obvious that Mr. Han was biased toward Zuo Qingluan.","If Feng Wu started a fight here, she would be at a disadvantage.","Of course, she was smarter than that. Leading Chaoge to a corner, she sat down and started cultivating with her eyes closed. After she closed her eyes, Zuo Qingluan gave her a resentful glance before looking away.","Jun Wuxia had seen through her lie the night before. She was scolded by the empress dowager and Emperor Wu before Jun Wuxia scorned her. In the end, she had to pretend to pass out to get away from the palace. After going back home, she really wished she could pass out.","She didn’t know how to face other people.","With Feng Wu still alive, Zuo Qingluan didn’t feel that she could stay in the imperial capital anymore.","Although only a handful of people knew what had happened, Zuo Qingluan still feared that Feng Wu would spread the news.","She had really thought about killing Feng Wu.","She had almost reached the Feng clan when she realized that it was a bad idea.","She couldn’t kill Feng Wu yet, not like this. When she heard that Feng Wu was going to the War Academy, she had an idea. She knew how she could get rid of Feng Wu forever without having to do it herself!","That was why Zuo Qingluan was here.","She wanted to see who would be more popular in the War Academy.","She wanted to get back at Feng Wu.","Ding –","Zuo Qingluan was still lost in thought when the other end of the portal opened.","They were in the wild.","It was in the middle of a forest.","“This is the Thousand Night Forest,” said Mr. Han. He stayed close behind Zuo Qingluan and explained, “The War Academy is right here in this forest. The safety zone is the area in a range of 10km around the academy. Beyond that, there are all sorts of fierce animals.”","Feng Xun had explained to Feng Wu before she came here that all students of the War Academy would earn points from killing wild beasts, and their ranking on the billboard would depend on their score.","Only people who ranked high on the billboard could apply to graduate.","A team was coming back from their hunting trip. There were four boys and one girl.","The boys greeted Mr. Han when they saw him. Mr. Han was in charge of opening the portal, and they all needed to go to him every month if they wanted to go home. Therefore, no one could afford to offend him."]},{"number":2518,"title":"Chapter 2518 - The Prettiest Girl","paragraphs":["One of the boys couldn’t help but notice Zuo Qingluan.","What a pretty girl!","“Mr. Han, who do we have here? I don’t think Shan Jingfei will be the prettiest girl in our year anymore.”","“Ling Hao, this is Miss Zuo Qingluan, the sacred lady of Firmament Palace.” Mr. Han liked Ling Hao, so he gave the student a reminder, fearing that he might offend the sacred lady unknowingly.","Zuo Qingluan, the sacred lady? Ling Hao recalled the name and cried out, “As in the one with the True Phoenix Blood?!”","Mr. Han nodded.","“Holy crap! She’s so famous!” Ling Hao smiled obsequiously, “Miss Qingluan, I’m —”.","However, Zuo Qingluan walked right past him before he could finish his sentence.","She ignored him completely.","Mr. Han left with Zuo Qingluan as if he was her servant.","Ling Hao had already stuck out his hand, and he was embarrassed.","“Hahaha -“","Ling Hao’s team consisted of five people.","However, the other four weren’t as outgoing as Ling Hao, so they didn’t try to approach her.","But they didn’t expect Zuo Qingluan to be so arrogant.","Seeing the look on Ling Hao’s face, his friends burst out laughing.","Because it came from a girl, the teammates didn’t think much of it.","Ling Hao cleared his throat and scratched his head awkwardly. “All pretty girls are proud. It’s normal.”","Zuo Qingluan was indeed a pretty girl. As soon as she showed up, the boys in the academy went crazy.","But —","Just when they thought that Zuo Qingluan was going to be the prettiest girl in the academy, Ling Hao spotted Feng Wu.","And when he saw her...","He felt his blood freeze!","He couldn’t look away.","What a beautiful girl!","She had translucent skin and exquisite features. He had never seen anyone like her before!","Zuo Qingluan might be the prettiest girl in the academy, but this girl was on a whole other level!","No one could compete with her! Miss Qingluan was pretty in an ordinary way, but this girl almost seemed to belong to another world!","“Who are you?” Ling Hao could barely form a coherent sentence.","When he saw Zuo Qingluan, he had tried to shake her hand, but now, he was almost too scared to talk to this girl.","Feng Wu beamed at him. “I’m Feng Wu, and this is Duan Chaoge. We’re new here. You’re Ling Hao, right? I heard Mr. Han call you that.”","Ling Hao was amazed.","After seeing how arrogant Zuo Qingluan was, he thought that this girl would be ten times prouder. To his surprise, however, she was so easygoing."]},{"number":2519,"title":"Chapter 2519 - Amazing Girl","paragraphs":["Chapter 2519 Amazing Girl","Ling Hao’s friends were as shocked as he was.","She was pretty, gentle, and approachable. What an angel!","The War Academy had very few girls and even less pretty ones. Having Feng Wu here was a miracle!","Shao Xiao stared at Feng Wu and nudged Ling Hao with his elbow.","“Introduce us, you idiot!”","Ling Hao snorted.","When Zuo Qingluan ignored him, they laughed so hard. Now, they wanted his help!","Ling Hao was honored to know such a pretty girl, so he introduced his friends. “This is Shao Xiao, our team leader. He’s into girls.”","Shao Xiao grinned at Feng Wu while he stomped on Ling Hao’s foot. “Shut up!”","Ling Hao’s cheek twitched. That hurt!","He went on, “This is Wang Zhi, the second-in-command. He’s very smart and likes deducing things.","“I’m third.","“Fourth is Ye Han. She’s a great healer.","“And fifth is Cheng Fang. Look, he’s two meters tall and is almost a human shield.”","Feng Wu noticed that the four boys were very friendly, but Ye Han was practically hostile toward her.","She didn’t know what to say.","Were all women natural enemies?","But Feng Wu didn’t care. With how she looked, she was used to being targeted by other girls.","Just then, they heard a loud whistle.","“The academy is calling us to assemble.” Ling Hao found it strange. “They usually won’t interrupt our cultivation like this. What’s going on?”","“Let’s go back now,” Ye Han urged him. That way, she could get away from Feng Wu.","Ling Hao nodded. “Sure. Miss Feng Wu, you’re one of us now, and you need to go to that assembly as well. Come with us.”","Ye Han was infuriated.","But she couldn’t let the others see it and could only sulk on her own.","They still had 15 minutes left when they got back, so Ling Hao took Feng Wu and Chaoge to complete their registration.","“You’ll visit the place a lot in the future,” Ling Hao told them. “After our hunting trips, you have to come here to exchange the animals for points.","“Hey, Wang, wake up. You have guests!” Ling Hao seemed to get along with everyone. He walked up to the counter and tapped the counter top.","Wang had dozed off. He saw three people standing in front of him.","All four boys had offered to walk with Feng Wu, but Feng Wu found it too over the top and suggested that she could go on her own. However, the team insisted that one of them go with her.","After a round of paper, rock, and scissors, Ling Hao won.","“Since when were you so lucky? Who’s the pretty girl?” Wang yawned and glanced at Ling Hao.","Ling Hao chuckled. “She’s a new student. Please hurry up. After the registration, we need to go to the assembly. Did you hear the whistle?”","“I need your exam results for Year 3,” Wang said to Feng Wu.","Ling Hao looked away.","He decided that she was too pretty to be a serious cultivator and didn’t want to see her grades because they wouldn’t be any good. He didn’t want to embarrass her."]},{"number":2520,"title":"Chapter 2520 - First Day","paragraphs":["Ling Hao looked away so that he wouldn’t embarrass Feng Wu.","As a result, he didn’t see the look on Wang’s face when he saw Feng Wu’s grades.","People here in the War Academy were sealed off from the outside world by the forest.","They could go home once a month but could stay no more than two days. To accumulate as many points as possible, most students hardly ever went back home. Therefore, they were quite behind on the news outside.","Wang’s hand trembled a little when he saw Feng Wu’s grades.","He couldn’t believe that such grades existed.","He looked from the paper to Feng Wu in amazement, then looked back at the paper again.","Feng Wu was perplexed. “Is something wrong?”","Before Wang could answer, Ling Hao interjected. “Don’t be so strict. One point or two won’t make any difference. Just let her in. Here, I’ve brought you some nice wine!”","“Go away.” Wang waved him off. He looked Feng Wu up and down, amazed by how capable this pretty girl was.","He put the paper away and took out a booklet.","Ling Hao knew that it was time for Feng Wu to choose her room.","He immediately said, “Wang, are there any four-bed rooms left? The six-bed ones aren’t as convenient. Look at how pretty Miss Feng Wu is. Someone’s bound to get jealous.”","Wang rolled his eyes at Ling Hao.","With Feng Wu’s grades, she deserved a room all to herself!","However, Feng Wu took Chaoge’s hand and said, “I want to share a room with her.”","Chaoge handed over her report card.","Wang looked at her grades.","Ling Hao leaned over to take a look as well.","“You barely passed the exam. That was close. You could have been rejected. How lucky.” Ling Hao patted Chaoge’s shoulder in a brotherly manner. Chaoge said, “I made it from Year 1 to Year 4 within a year, and you call me lucky.”","“What?! From Year 1 to Year 4 in one year? You must be joking!” Ling Hao couldn’t believe it.","He grabbed the report card from Wang, and his eyes widened when he saw the content. “Gosh! You really skipped Year 2 and Year 3! Are you even human?!”","He had thought that Chaoge was a foil for Feng Wu, but as it turned out, she was a genius herself!","Chaoge was very proud.","If he’s so excited to see my grades, what will he do when he sees Xiao Wu’s?","Wang was impressed by Feng Wu’s grades, so he was patient enough to explain to them, “You’re allocated dormitories by your ranking on the billboard. Since you’re new, you don’t have much choice. Right now, there’s only one four-bed room available, and it already has two occupants.”","Feng Wu nodded. “That one’s fine.”","Wang quickly completed Feng Wu and Chaoge’s registration.","They each received a key.","Ling Hao looked at the form, and his eyes lit up. “You’re in the same dorm as Ye Han!”"]},{"number":2521,"title":"Chapter 2521 - Who Is Chief Zixuan’s Junior Sister?","paragraphs":["Ye Han? Feng Wu wanted to roll her eyes. Why did he think that was good news?","Just then –","The assembly bell rang out again.","“Let’s go!” Ling Hao urged them.","On their way, he told Feng Wu, “There are five classes in the War Academy, ranging from A to E. The new students are all in Class E, regardless of your previous grades.","“There you go.” He nudged Feng Wu and Chaoge in the right direction. “The new students won’t be doing anything during this meeting, so just stay put. After this, I’ll take you to your room.” Soon, Ling Hao and his teammates returned to Class B.","Chaoge was amazed. She said to Feng Wu, “Ling Hao and his friends are all in Class B.”","Feng Wu nodded. “We’ll be in Class B in no time.”","A girl walked past them at the moment. She glanced at their armbands and smirked. “Don’t flatter yourselves.”","Here in the War Academy, all students had an armband that contained their personal information. It also indicated what class they were in.","The armbands of Class E had one star, and those of Class A had five stars.","Right now, both Feng Wu and Chaoge only had one star.","The girl walking past them had two stars, indicating that she was from Class D.","“Wang Junwen, who are they?” asked a girl named Ding Yi.","Wang Junwen smirked. “Just some Class E newbies. They said they would be in Class B in no time. How stupid!”","Ding Yi looked at Feng Wu and was amazed by her beauty.","Meanwhile, she also couldn’t help but envy her, so she nodded at her friend.","They didn’t try to keep their voices down, so both Feng Wu and Chaoge heard them.","Feng Wu didn’t react, but Chaoge couldn’t stand what they said about her friend.","But Feng Wu stopped her before she could stand up.","“They can say whatever they want. The only thing we can control is our own actions. Don’t be reckless.”","Chaoge had no choice but to suppress her anger.","They soon found Class E.","Feng Wu did a quick headcount and saw that there were a thousand students in her class.","It was true that out of the four years, the War Academy had the greatest number of students.","According to Feng Xun, it was extremely difficult to graduate from Year 4.","Since Feng Wu and Chaoge were at the end of the line, no one noticed them.","At the same time.","A woman in a purple dress went up on stage. She was Chief Zixuan, the deputy chief of the year.","The War Academy had one chief and two deputies.","The chief was a mystery and hardly ever made a public appearance. Today was no exception.","Zixuan was one of the deputies.","The other was Gongsun Mu.","Chief Zixuan gave a little speech.","She announced that she was going to the Peace Grassland, and her Junior Sister would be working temporarily as the deputy chief. “Her Junior Sister?”","“Who’s that?”","“Chief Zixuan came from Firmament Palace. Does that mean...”","Chaoge’s eyes widened when she saw the person walking up to the stage."]},{"number":2522,"title":"Chapter 2522 - Deputy Chief Zuo","paragraphs":["Chapter 2522 Deputy Chief Zuo","“Isn’t that...” Chaoge stared at the person.","Ling Hao and his team members were also astonished.","That was the girl who had ignored them!","Zuo Qingluan!","It was Zuo Qingluan!","Ling Hao had thought that Zuo Qingluan was one of the new students, but he couldn’t have been any more wrong.","She wasn’t even a teacher. She was the new deputy chief!","What did that mean?","That was so scary!","Everyone looked at the teenage girl on the stage and was amazed by her ethereal beauty.","Their minds were blown.","“Who’s she?”","“Zuo Qingluan?”","“Who’s Zuo Qingluan?”","“OMG! I know who she is! She’s THAT Zuo Qingluan!”","“I know her name, but ... Wait! It’s her! The daughter of the Zuo family and the sacred lady of Firmament Palace! She has the True Phoenix Blood. But that’s not the most important thing! Rumor is that she’s His Royal Highness’s fiancee!”","“The crown prince’s fiancee?!”","Everyone grew excited when they heard the last part.","The crown prince!","Jun Linyuan had been a student of the War Academy once, but he was so outstanding that he became the top student almost right away.","Not only that, he also set a record when he graduated.","His final score was 100 times higher than the previous record-holder.","Yes, 100 times.","Whatever the previous record-holder had achieved, Jun Linyuan achieved 100 times that.","That was how incredible he was.","The even scarier thing was that he hadn’t even exerted his full strength.","What was his limit?","No one dared to speculate, because the answer would only make them lose more hope.","When Jun Linyuan’s admirers heard that Zuo Qingluan was his fiancee, their eyes lit up. “His Royal Highness’s fiancee?!” “She’s going to marry him!”","“That’s why Chief Zixuan is giving her the job! It’s because of His Royal Highness!”","“Of course! Everyone knows how His Royal Highness defeated Chief Zixuan with a single strike!”","Everyone was talking at the same time.","The news soon got around, spreading from Class A to Class E.","“That’s bullsh*t!” Chaoge was infuriated. “She’s His Royal Highness’s fiancee?! The crown prince’s fiancee is —”.","Feng Wu stomped on her foot before she could go on.","Chaoge was confused. Why couldn’t she tell the truth?","Feng Wu shook her head at Chaoge.","Chaoge gave in, but she pointed at Zuo Qingluan and said, “That’s a big fat lie! Karma will get her!”"]},{"number":2523,"title":"Chapter 2523 - Deputy Chief’s Disciple","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan looked down at the students.","None of them were worth her attention.","Except for one person.","When she finally spotted the person at the end of the queue, she smirked a little.","She was high up here, while Feng Wu was down there in the crowd.","She was the well-respected deputy chief, but Feng Wu was only a new student.","She felt that she could kill Feng Wu whenever she felt like it.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t try to hide her smirk.","Feng Wu met her gaze and didn’t look away.","Both girls saw the hostility in each other’s eyes.","Chief Zixuan smiled at Zuo Qingluan. “Qingluan, as the new chief, you’re given a privilege.”","Zuo Qingluan asked indifferently, “What’s that?”","Chief Zixuan said, “You can pick any student to be your disciple.”","Zuo Qingluan nodded. “And why is that?”","Chief Zixuan wanted to roll her eyes at Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan obviously knew the answer to that question. That was so pretentious.","Obviously, she wouldn’t say that out loud. Zuo Qingluan was the sacred lady of Firmament Palace and the future wife of the crown prince. Chief Zixuan didn’t want to offend her.","As a matter of fact —","Chief Zixuan was only going to the Peace Grassland because Zuo Qingluan had requested to replace her as the deputy chief. It was a request that Chief Zixuan couldn’t turn down.","Everyone knew that the Peace Grassland was very dangerous at the moment, and one could easily die there.","Chief Zixuan said, “You can appoint any student here to be your own disciple. In other words, from now on, they’ll carry out your orders here in the academy, and at the same time, they can enjoy the resources you provide them.”","Zuo Qingluan nodded and frowned a little. “I don’t think the students will like that idea.”","“Of course, they will!” Chief Zixuan exclaimed. “Everyone dreams of becoming your disciple. Right?”","The question was for the students.","“Yes!” the students shouted excitedly.","Yes, the students of the War Academy were very proud, but that also depended on the circumstances.","When a more powerful and talented person showed up and proved that he or she was beyond their reach, they would immediately revere that person.","as a","Zuo Qingluan made it obvious that she was a Spiritual King as soon as she went up to the stage, and the students were impressed.","A Spiritual King!","Zuo Qingluan asked, “Can I pick any one of them?”","Chief Zixuan nodded. “Of course! Anyone would jump at that opportunity!”","Gongshu Mu frowned a little. He found the two women from Firmament Palace too flamboyant.","Especially Zuo Qingluan. If she really was the crown prince’s fiancee, she should keep a low profile.","He decided that he needed some news from the outside world. Somehow, he felt that many things were going to happen in the academy.","Meanwhile, Zuo Qingluan –"]},{"number":2524,"title":"Chapter 2524 - Who Will Zuo Qingluan Choose?","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan looked down at the crowd.","Many people were thrilled.","There were 5,000 students in total from the five classes, and nearly everyone who came to the assembly was looking at Zuo Qingluan.","Less than 100 students of Class A were here today because most of them were away on assignments. They were all looking forward to the opportunity.","Apart from being the sacred lady of Firmament Palace and the current deputy chief of the academy, Zuo Qingluan also had an important friend.","The crown prince.","That was what Class A believed.","Yang Jianqing thought, “She’ll pick me, right? Of all the people here, I have the highest ranking.” Ji Rongsha thought, “This is my only chance to get close to His Royal Highness. If I can jump on Zuo Qingluan’s wagon, I’ll have a chance to become His Royal Highness’s concubine! Please pick me!” Her eyes sparkled.","And there were many more students who had similar thoughts.","If Class A was so excited, imagine what the other four classes were feeling.","Every chief could only have one disciple.","Class E.","Sun Jingyu gnashed her teeth. “She has the Zuo family and Firmament Palace behind her. Not only is she the deputy chief now, she’s also the crown prince’s fiancee. How can someone be so lucky?”","Sun Jingyu was the class president and had her own small group.","One of her friends asked, “JIngyu, do you want to become her disciple?”","Sun Jingyu rolled her eyes at the boy named Yuan Yu. “Don’t you? Can’t you see how excited Class A is? But there’s only one place, and it’ll never come to our class.”","Yuan Yu said, “Class A is graduating soon. Even the students who can’t graduate will go to the Peace Grassland. I don’t think they have much of a chance.”","Sun Jingyu said, “Even if that’s the case, there are three classes more advanced than us. We’ll be the last group she’ll consider!”","All the students of Class E sighed inwardly. What a pity!","Sun Jingyu said, “Don’t fidget. We’ll have plenty of opportunities when we get into Classes A and B, but for now, we’re just onlookers.”","The students were allocated to different classes according to their rankings.","Class A stood the closest to the stage.","Behind them was Class B.","Class E stood the furthest at the back.","The students stood in neat rows.","Zuo Qingluan walked off the stage. Class A was thrilled.","Yang Jianqing thought, “Pick me!”","Ji Rongsha thought, “Please pick me! It’ll change my life forever!”","But Zuo Qingluan walked right past Class A.","The students of Class A were astonished.","Yang Jianqing was speechless.","So was Ji Rongsha.","They were out.","Who was Zuo Qingluan going to choose?","Ji Rongsha clenched her fists and followed Zuo Qingluan with her eyes.","“She’s reached Class B!”"]},{"number":2525,"title":"Chapter 2525 - Condescending Attitude","paragraphs":["Chapter 2525 Condescending Attitude","Students of Class B were thrilled. “Chief Qingluan is here!”","Since she hadn’t chosen a disciple from Class A, she must be considering Class B!","Someone in Class B would have a chance to meet the crown prince in person!","Everyone in Class B stood ramrod straight, trying to show their best selves to Zuo Qingluan.","But to their surprise...","Zuo Qingluan walked past Class B as well.","Just like that...","All the students were dumbfounded.","Was Chief Qingluan going to choose someone from Class C?","But Zuo Qingluan ignored Class C as well.","Class D was thrilled now.","Holy crap!","Was it going to be someone from Class D?!","Wang Junwen and Ding Yi clenched their fists excitedly and wondered if it was going to be them.","Class E.","Yuan Yu said, “Jingyu, look! Chief Qingluan has reached Class D!”","Sun Jingyu shook her head. “Then it has to be someone in Class D. We still won’t have a chance.”","Yuan Yu said, “She didn’t stop there! She’s coming our way!”","Despite what she said, Sun Jingyu was having butterflies in her stomach.","She was right!","Zuo Qingluan was heading for Class E.","They were the only class left!","It had to be one of them!","Gosh!","OMG!","Chief Qingluan really was going to choose her disciple from Class E!","Who would she pick?","Who would be the lucky person?","Who?","Everyone here in the War Academy was an outstanding cultivator.","But Zuo Qingluan would outshine every single one of them because she was the crown prince’s fiancee!","No one knew where that news came from, but everyone was almost immediately convinced.","They believed that Zuo Qingluan was the only girl in the empire who was good enough for the crown prince.","“Jingyu, look! She’s coming our way!” Yuan Yu was thrilled.","Yuan Yu was a boy. Sun Jingyu also had a female lackey, and her name was Mu Qianqian.","She was so excited that she almost fainted. She grabbed Sun Jingyu’s hand. “Jingyu, it’s going to be you!”","Sun Jingyu feigned a humble tone. “Surely not... It’ll never be me.”","Mu Qianqian said, “Of course it’s going to be you. You’re the prettiest and most advanced student in our class! All teachers adore you! It’s definitely you!”","Deep down, Sun Jingyu thought the same.","Who else could it be?","There was no one better than her in this class!","But Zuo Qingluan stopped in front of Feng Wu.","She looked condescendingly at Feng Wu."]},{"number":2526,"title":"Chapter 2526 - No","paragraphs":["Chapter 2526 No","Zuo Qingluan spoke in a condescending tone. “You, then.”","Those words sounded like a thunderclap to everyone else.","Everyone stared at Feng Wu.","“Who’s that girl?”","“She’s so pretty! Why haven’t I seen her before?”","Students of other classes also turned around to look at Feng Wu.","Yang Jianqing, Ji Rongsha, Ling Hao, Wang Junwen, and Ding Yi were all looking at her.","Sun Jingyu couldn’t look away.","Her cheek twitched, and she wanted to kill Feng Wu with her gaze.","“Who’s she? Where did she come from?!” she shrilled.","Both Yuan Yu and Mu Qianqian shook their heads. They had no idea who the pretty girl was. No, calling her pretty was such an understatement!","“She’s Feng Wu, a new student,” Gu Xingyuan said behind them.","His two older brothers were here in the War Academy as well, and Gu Xingyi had taken him to see Sun Jingyu after the registration. With Sun Jingyu’s help, Gu Xingyuan was quickly accepted by the other members of the class.","Chu Junying was also there. She was with Gu Xingyuan all the time.","“What’s her background?” Sun Jingyu asked.","Gu Xingyuan recalled the incident during Zuo Qingluan’s birthday and the gift envelopes. He had a feeling that the crown prince was fond of Feng Wu instead of Zuo Qingluan, but...","He would lie to even his mother if it would make Feng Wu’s life harder.","So he smirked and said, “She’s a daughter of the Feng clan. You might have heard her story before. She and Zuo Qingluan used to be known as the two genius girls of the imperial capital, but she became too greedy and destroyed her cultivation ability. She also lost her True Phoenix Blood. As you can see, Zuo Qingluan is the deputy chief now, while she’s...”","One girl was the deputy chief, and the other was only a new student. What a stark contrast.","Gu Xingyuan didn’t try to lower his voice.","He wanted as many people to hear him as possible.","Soon, the entire Class E heard it.","And the news spread from Class E to Class A.","“So, it’s THAT Feng Wu!”","“Who’s she?”","“I know that name! Her clan has declined. She used to have the True Phoenix Blood, and she was His Royal Highness’s fiancee once, but that engagement was annulled.”","“It’s her! That was five years ago, right?”","“She used to be a genius as well! I didn’t know that she could cultivate again. However, she’s nothing compared with Zuo Qingluan!”","Immediately, all eyes were on Feng Wu.","Everyone wanted to know her answer.","Zuo Qingluan smirked at Feng Wu.","Even under all the gazes, Feng Wu remained unperturbed.","She looked at Zuo Qingluan as if she was as ordinary as everyone else.","Feng Wu shook her head. “No.”","No one could believe what they just heard!"]},{"number":2527,"title":"Chapter 2527 - Doubled? I Accept","paragraphs":["Gosh!","No?!","Someone said no to Zuo Qingluan!","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","It had never occurred to them that someone would turn down that honor.","It was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity!","Zuo Qingluan smiled. She knew that Feng Wu wouldn’t say yes.","That was why she had chosen Feng Wu.","She wanted Feng Wu to refuse her proposal in front of everyone so that Feng Wu would turn into a public enemy.","She was a deputy chief; what was Feng Wu? She was only a new student. It was obvious which side the students would take. Only idiots would choose Feng Wu’s side.","After that, everyone in the academy would become Feng Wu’s enemy. Her life would be miserable; just thinking about it excited Zuo Qingluan.","Of course, she didn’t let any of that show.","She frowned and looked indignant at being turned down.","She didn’t need to say anything because someone would speak up for her.","Chief Zixuan stepped out.","She glanced at Feng Wu and asked, “And you","are?!","“She’s Feng Wu.” Sun Jingyu had heard Gu Xingyuan’s introduction. She quickly stood behind Chief Zixuan and answered the question.","She needed to show where she stood.","It was obvious that she was going to be Feng Wu’s enemy.","“Why haven’t I heard that name before?” Chief Zixuan frowned.","Gu Xingyuan thought, “That’s a little fake. You were watching Feng Wu when she took the exam.”","However, he wasn’t going to say anything. The more miserable Feng Wu was, the happier he would be.","Sun Jingyu said, “She’s new. She only got here today.”","Chief Zixuan nodded and looked enlightened.","She asked Feng Wu, “May I ask why you said","no?”","Feng Wu said, “Do you need a reason?”","Chief Zixuan said, “Of course I do. Your refusal has injured Chief Qingluan’s dignity. You’re a mere student of Class E, and we don’t permit such behavior!”","Everyone agreed with that.","Feng Wu only glanced at her but didn’t reply.","Chief Zixuan was a little surprised by how stubborn she was.","If Feng Wu hadn’t lost the True Phoenix Blood, she would have been Zixuan’s junior sister. Life was unpredictable.","Chief Zixuan sighed inwardly, then turned to Feng Wu. “Refusing the deputy chief will make it much more difficult for you to graduate. The points you need to obtain will be doubled.”","“Doubled? I accept.” Feng Wu nodded.","Chief Zixuan smirked. “To graduate, you need to have enough points, and they’re very hard to obtain. That’s why it’s so difficult to graduate. You don’t know what you’re facing.”"]},{"number":2528,"title":"Chapter 2528 - Authority","paragraphs":["Feng Wu nodded.","Chief Zixuan turned to Zuo Qingluan. “To make up for your injured dignity, the points she needs to earn is doubled; we’ll call it even, then. You still have two more chances to pick a disciple.”","Two more chances? Zuo Qingluan smiled a little and asked Feng Wu again, “Will you be my disciple?”","What?","Everyone was surprised.","Seriously?!","Feng Wu again?","“Does she know what will happen when Feng Wu says no for a second time?”","Chief Zixuan hesitated. “Qingluan...”","Zuo Qingluan asked, “Am I not allowed to pick the same person?”","Chief Zixuan said, “You can, but...”","She looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “No.”","She sounded like she wasn’t bothered at all.","Gongsun Mu stepped out and reminded her, “Feng Wu, if you refuse her again, the points you need to graduate will be five times more than other students.”","Doubling the points would already make it impossible for her to graduate. What about five times?","The other students all stared at Feng Wu.","They believed that she would change her mind.","But Feng Wu only looked at Zuo Qingluan without saying another word.","She had made up her mind.","Gongsun Mu couldn’t help but remind Feng Wu, “You can’t possibly earn so many points.”","Feng Wu shook her head. “Thank you for your reminder, but I don’t care.”","Gongsun Mu shook his head. “Do you know what will happen if you can’t graduate?”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “What will happen?”","Gongsun Mu smiled bitterly. “You’re a student of the War Academy now, so you have the right to know a few things. If you can’t graduate, you’ll have to join the battle at Peace Grassland.”","Feng Wu had guessed as much. “Are you referring to the war with the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Gongsun Mu said, “That’s right.” It was getting even fiercer, and the empire was losing ground. Of course, Gongsun Mu omitted the last part.","Feng Wu said, “I’m alright with that.”","Gongsun Mu shook his head. Before he could say anything else, Chief Zixuan said, “So be it. Qingluan, you still have one more chance.”","All eyes were on Zuo Qingluan. Who would she choose now?","Surely, not Feng Wu again.","That was outrageous, because if Feng Wu said no a third time...","But Zuo Qingluan turned to Feng Wu again.","“I’ve been playing by the book all my life, but I want to do something willful today. Feng Wu, will you be my disciple?”","That was the third time she asked Feng Wu.","Zuo Qingluan did it!","At first, the students had hoped that being someone of their own age, Zuo Qingluan would be easy to get along with, but after the three questions, she had proven that she wasn’t!","She was using Feng Wu to assert her authority!","Poor Feng Wu."]},{"number":2529,"title":"Chapter 2529 - Politically Correct","paragraphs":["Gongsun Mu frowned at Zuo Qingluan before turning to Feng Wu. “If you turn her down again, you’ll need 10 times as many points.”","Not only would that make it impossible for Feng Wu to graduate, she would also have offended Zuo Qingluan for the third time.","Feng Wu would ruin her own future.","But if she said yes now, she might still have a chance.","Gongsun Mu wasn’t alone. Many students felt the same.","They all felt conflicted.","It was an indescribable feeling.","“I said, no.” Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. Did Zuo Qingluan think that she would tolerate her provocation forever?","No?!","Feng Wu said no!","Was she nuts?","Everyone sucked in their breaths and stared at Feng Wu.","Zuo Qingluan was greatly satisfied.","Feng Wu had humiliated her so many times.","And she almost hadn’t made it through court. Finally, it was her turn.","What she didn’t know was that although her plan had worked, the result had also created a loophole. Soon, she would pay dearly for what she had done today.","Of course, we’ll talk about that later.","The assembly was over.","The students left in twos and threes, all discussing what had just happened.","At first, they had expected to make friends with Zuo Qingluan, but now, all they had for her was reverence.","Zuo Qingluan had become the latest idol of the War Academy.","However –","Because of her aggressive behavior, her popularity had dropped a little from 100% to","95%.","Most of the 5% felt sorry for Feng Wu.","Chaoge jumped to her feet when everyone was gone.","“Xiao Wu, that was outrageous!”","She had tried to say those words all this time, but Feng Wu stopped her.","“Why wouldn’t you let me say anything? She’s obviously abusing her power! She’s getting back at you because His Royal Highness was nice to you! I’ll tell everyone that you’re His Royal Highness’s...”","“Duan Chaoge!” Feng Wu glared at her.","Chaoge would back off whenever Feng Wu became serious.","Feng Wu said, “I have my plan, and your willful behavior will only get in my way. Our enemy will use you to get to me. It has always been like that. Can’t you see it?”","Chaoge said, “I just can’t help it...”","Feng Wu said, “You must. Losing control of your temper will only become your downfall.” Chaoge said, “Alright...” Sun Jingyu and a few others walked in their direction.","Sun Jingyu felt entitled to give orders to new students of Class E.","She said to Feng Wu, “Do you know what new students must do?”","Feng Wu was bewildered.","Sun Jingyu smirked. “All new students clean the toilets for a month! Now go, both of you!”","The students around her all burst out laughing","Because Feng Wu had offended Chief Qingluan, it was now the politically correct thing to do to bully her."]},{"number":2530,"title":"Chapter 2530 - Ten Times More","paragraphs":["Feng Wu smiled. “A task for new students, you say?”","Sun Jingyu didn’t reply, but Mu Qianqian nodded. “That’s right. Get on with it!”","Feng Wu pointed at Gu Xingyuan and Chu Junying. “They’re new as well.”","Mu Qianqian frowned. “Just do as you’re told. You should be honored to be given such a","job!”","Feng Wu said, “What if I refuse?”","Mu Qianqian said, “Then we’ll deduct your points! You...”","Feng Wu began to walk away before Mu Qianqian could finish. “Be my guest.”","“You!” Mu Qianqian turned to Sun Jingyu for help. “Jingyu, did you see that? Who the hell does she think she is, His Royal Highness’s fiancee?!”","Sun Jingyu gave her a stern look, and she immediately stopped talking.","Ling Hao arrived at that moment.","He came alone, while the rest of his team waited for him some distance away.","“What’s this? Are you bullying the new students?!” Ling Hao asked angrily.","Sun Jingyu’s stomach lurched.","Ling Hao was from Class B, which was a lot more advanced than Class E. They didn’t dare to talk back to him.","The War Academy was a hierarchical place.","Sun Jingyu threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and walked away.","“Are you alright?” Ling Hao sounded concerned.","Feng Wu shrugged. “I’m fine.”","Sun Jingyu was a petty character, and Feng Wu knew she wouldn’t stay in Class E for much longer, so she wasn’t bothered.","Ling Hao sighed. “Why are you so stubborn? You could have become the deputy chief’s own disciple! Zuo Qingluan is young, but she’s a Spiritual King!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Chaoge said, “So what? Xiao Wu will be a Spiritual King soon!”","“Who are you kidding?” Ling Hao didn’t take her seriously. He told Feng Wu, “Fine, you don’t like her. I think I know why...”","Feng Wu was perplexed. Ling Hao said, “It’s because she’s His Royal Highness’s fiancee, isn’t it?”","Feng Wu said, “What?”","Ling Hao said, “I understand. All girls are in love with His Royal Highness, right? Zuo Qingluan is his fiancee, and it’s normal that you don’t like her...”","Feng Wu almost choked on her own spit.","She said, “I’m amazed!”","She was amazed by his wild imagination.","Ling Hao said, “Of course you are. I know what girls are like. You didn’t have to make it so obvious, though.”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I just can’t stand her.”","Ling Hao said, “Why?”","Feng Wu said, “I just can’t. It’s not like me.”","Ling Hao said, “How can you take it so lightly?” Feng Wu said, “Why can’t I?” Ling Hao said, “You’ll need ten times more points! Do you know what that means?!”","Feng Wu said, “It’s not that bad, is it?”","Ling Hao said, “Yes, it is! You have no idea how difficult it is to earn points!”"]},{"number":2531,"title":"Chapter 2531 - Ways to Earn Points","paragraphs":["Feng Wu asked, “How difficult is it?”","Ling Hao said, “Didn’t Wang give you an armband? All the points are saved there.","“You’re given 100 points when you register, but accommodation and food will both cost you points. You won’t be able to pay for anything if you don’t earn points.”","Feng Wu said, “Will I be expelled if I can’t","pay?”","Ling Hao stared at her. “Do you want to be expelled?”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t care, actually.”","The fairy said in her head, “You can’t be expelled!”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”.","The fairy said, “If you’re expelled, your master will never wake up!”","Feng Wu asked, “What? Why?!” The fairy disappeared.","Feng Wu was astonished! Was the fairy blackmailing her now?","Seeing that Feng Wu was in a daze, Ling Hao waved his hand in front of her face.","Feng Wu looked at him.","not","eve","Ling Hao said, “It’s more complicated than that. The punishment is more severe than just expulsion. Just earn as many points as possible and don’t go into debt!”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll do my best.”","Ling Hao was about to say something else, when Feng Wu cut him off. “How do I earn points?”","Ling Hao said, “There are a few ways. One is to complete tasks. You can get the requests from Wang, and you earn points when you complete them.","“Another way is through exams. We have an exam every month, and the top three students in each class are rewarded. Class E’s points are the lowest, but they’re enough for junior students like you.”","Junior students?","Feng Wu checked Ling Hao’s cultivation level and wanted to shake her head.","“You’re in the same room with Ye Han. I’ll get her to... Hey, where is she?” Ling Hao turned around and saw that Ye Han wasn’t with his team members.","Cheng Fang said awkwardly, “Ye Han said she didn’t feel well, so she went back...”","Everyone could see that Ye Han didn’t like Feng Wu.","Ling Hao was embarrassed.","Feng Wu shook her head. “We’ll settle in and go see Wang for our tasks. Don’t worry about us.”","She waved at him, then left with Chaoge.","Feng Wu was a Level 9 Spiritual Lord. People in the imperial capital thought that she was only at Level 6, and the students here probably took her for a Level 3 Spiritual Lord.","That was because most students in Class E were at Level 3; Chaoge was even at Level 2.","She barely made it into Year 4.","The living quarters were huge.","However, there were signs everywhere, and they soon found the girls’ dormitory.","They were stopped at an iron gate.","The moderator was a middle-aged woman. She looked condescendingly at Feng Wu and didn’t seem very friendly.","Feng Wu and Chaoge did everything by the book, so she wasn’t able to accuse them of anything when she examined their personal belongings."]},{"number":2532,"title":"Chapter 2532 - You Must Graduate","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","In the end, the moderator could only stare at Feng Wu in resignation.","She wondered how this pretty girl had messed with the wrong people.","Recalling the person who had hired her, the moderator shook her head and stared at Feng Wu. “The room is 90 points a month. Stick out your hand.”","The woman scanned her armband, and the points were deducted.","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Chaoge snapped, “90 points a month?! But we only have 100 points! We need to eat!”","The woman said grumpily, “That’s the rule. We deduct the points once a month. I don’t have the time to scan you every day!”","Chaoge was furious.","She believed that the woman was doing it on purpose.","The woman rolled her eyes at Chaoge. “If you can’t afford a four-person room, you can move to an eight-person one when they’re available. Poor people are so annoying!”","Chaoge felt humiliated. “I’m going to file a complaint!”","The woman said, “Go ahead! Do I need to show you the way?","Feng Wu stared at the woman, and the look in her eyes made the woman uneasy. The woman said, “What are you waiting for? Get moving!” Feng Wu smiled. “You never know who’ll be the winner in the end.”","The woman snorted.","Zuo Qingluan was going to be the future wife of the crown prince, and Feng Wu was only an ordinary girl. That was what the woman believed.","“Hear me out: You should be content with what you have. You’re just not built to become someone important. Accept it. You can go to your room now!” The woman then chased Feng Wu and Chaoge away from the office.","Chaoge was furious.","But after what Feng Wu told her, she had to control her temper.","Feng Wu asked, “You’re mad, aren’t you?","Chaoge said, “Yes.”","Feng Wu said, “Then let your frustration become your motivation!”","Chaoge nodded.","They had heard from Ling Hao that there was a cultivation room here. It was rich in the spiritual essence of all elements.","Chaoge’s cultivation ability had been fundamentally changed in the tomb, and she had taken up Unflower’s skills. As a result, she focused on the fire and wood elements now.","Although Fallen Star Yard had a formation for gathering spiritual essence, there wasn’t anything that was specifically for the elements she needed.","She was looking forvvard to earning some points so that she could go to that cultivation room. Both she and Feng Wu only had 10 points left, and they could barely afford any food.","Their keys said that they were in Room 2001.","They found the room.","The door opened.","Feng Wu looked inside and found that it was a spacious flat. There was a living room in the center, and each corner of the living room led to a bedroom. Luckily, each student had their own room. Otherwise, Feng Wu wouldn’t be able to stand it.","“You have to graduate. Otherwise, your master won’t wake up,” the fairy reminded her again.","It seemed that she was worried that Feng Wu would leave.","Feng Wu was perplexed. “But why?”","The fairy didn’t answer.."]},{"number":2533,"title":"Chapter 2533 - Until You Surrender","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Why did she have to graduate? Did it have something to do with her beautiful master?","“I can only give you a little hint,” the fairy spoke again. “It has something to do with the third broken star piece.”","She stopped talking after that.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","“Who are you? Who permitted you to come in?”","Someone shouted at Feng Wu and Chaoge.","The girl had a knife in her hand, and she looked like she was ready to start a fight at any moment.","Chaoge was already frustrated, and the girl’s tone upset her even more. She glared at the girl. “We opened the door with our own key! We’re going to live here as well! Do you have a problem with that?”","She tossed her key up and down as she spoke.","The girl was called Zi Ling, and she was also a student of Class E. She glared at Chaoge and Feng Wu but didn’t say anything. Stomping her foot, she went back to her room.","She slammed the door behind her.","Chaoge pointed at the door and turned to Feng Wu. “What’s wrong with the people here? Why are they so unfriendly?!”","Feng Wu only smiled.","Had it not been for Zuo Qingluan, they would have been very popular.","After Zuo Qingluan publicly announced her hostility toward Feng Wu, the entire War Academy would support her.","“Don’t mind her,” Feng Wu said indifferently.","“Don’t mind her?” Of course Chaoge minded that girl’s attitude. She couldn’t understand how Feng Wu could remain unaffected.","The best two rooms had been picked, leaving them with two inferior ones.","Chaoge opened one and found that it was filled with old junk.","“Did someone turn this place into a storage unit?!” Chaoge shouted at the two closed doors.","But no one answered.","Zi Ling smirked.","Because those two rooms had been empty for a while, Ye Han turned one of them into her storage room. Zi Ling had followed suit after that. Chaoge smirked. “If you won’t empty out the rooms, I’ll do it for you!”","She opened the doors.","Feng Wu had given her a storage bag, so she emptied both rooms with a wave of her hand.","She then went to Zi Ling and Ye Han’s rooms.","Whoosh","She dumped everything outside their rooms, blocking their doors.","Hearing the noise, Zi Ling opened the door.","The junk poured into her room.","“You!” Zi Ling came out and wanted to slap Chaoge.","But she wasn’t Chaoge’s match.."]},{"number":2534,"title":"Chapter 2534 - OMG","paragraphs":["Chapter 2534 OMG","Chaoge pinned Zi Ling’s hands behind her back.","“Let go of me! Ye Han, help!” Zi Ling cried out.","But Ye Han’s door never opened.","No one knew if Ye Han was in her room.","Probably not.","“You’ve both disrespected Miss Qingluan! You’re going to die!” Zi Ling threatened Chaoge. “Let go of me! I’ll kick your ass!”","Chaoge smirked. “Fine. Bring it on.”","Thump! Thump! Thump!","More blows were exchanged.","Zi Ling was covered with bruises and couldn’t even stand up.","She sincerely regretted her decision.","She couldn’t understand how a new student could beat her. She was an average student in Class E. That shouldn’t happen.","She wished that she hadn’t confronted the two girls.","Chaoge stepped on Zi Ling’s back. “Ready to surrender?”","Zi Ling wanted to say no.","Chaoge said, “I can do this all day!”","Zi Ling didn’t want to fight her anymore.","Chaoge smirked. “If you want some more fights, I can give you that chance!”","Zi Ling was so frightened that she almost burst into tears.","Why was the girl so fierce?","They fought from morning to evening, and Zi Ling felt like all her bones were broken.","“I surrender...” she said.","Chaoge let go of her. “You’ll be my minion from now on. You’ll have to do as Xiao Wu says. Understood?”","Zi Ling couldn’t understand it.","If she had become Chaoge’s minion, why should she follow Feng Wu’s orders?","Seeing the way Chaoge handled Zi Ling like a chicken, Feng Wu felt sorry for the girl. She handed Zi Ling some ointment. “For your wounds.”","Her face was bruised and swollen.","Zi Ling didn’t know how miserable she looked until she stood in front of a mirror.","She cried out.","Chaoge snapped. “Quiet! It’s just a little scratch!”","“A little scratch? Look at my face!” Zi Ling was almost in tears. “The whole class is going on a mission tomorrow. How am I supposed to go out like this?”","Chaoge scratched her ear. Zi Ling was so loud.","Zi Ling grabbed Chaoge’s arm and shook her. “Did you have to hit my face? My face!”","She really was crying now.","Chaoge felt a little guilty. “Are you really crying now?”","Zi Ling ignored her.","Chaoge said, “Didn’t Xiao Wu give you that ointment? That’s a Supreme Level medicine. Use it and you’ll be good as new.”","Zi Ling didn’t believe her because Supreme Level medicine could be very expensive. It shouldn’t be something that Chaoge could afford.","“See for yourself,” said Chaoge. “That’s not even her best work.”","Zi Ling thought, “You’re still lying to me! I won’t be taken for a fool!”","She threw away the bottle.","Thud!","The bottle cracked when it hit the floor, and the smell filled the air."]},{"number":2535,"title":"Chapter 2535 - How Generous (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2535 How Generous (1)","The bottle cracked when it hit the floor, and the smell filled the air.","What a wonderful smell!","Zi Ling ran over and picked up what was left of the bottle.","It really was a Supreme Level medicine.","“No, it can’t be... Medicines of that level are so expensive! Why would she give it to me for free?”","Chaoge rolled her eyes at Zi Ling. “That’s the last one. Throw it away if you want.”","Zi Ling felt conflicted, but if her wounds weren’t treated, she couldn’t go out tomorrow.","“Fine, I’ll use it.”","Zi Ling scooped up some of the ointment and applied it to her skin.","She smeared it on her face, her arms and her legs.","She didn’t know if she would recover in time.","The idea of meeting the whole class like this the following morning made her frustrated.","“I’ll never forgive you if I can’t recover by tomorrow!” Zi Ling stormed back to her room.","Early the next morning –","“Chaoge! Chaoge!” Zi Ling banged excitedly on Chaoge’s door.","Chaoge was still in bed, and she opened the door with a flick of her fingers.","“Chaoge!” Zi Ling ran into the room, opened the curtain to let the sunlight in, and grabbed Chaoge’s hand.","Chaoge didn’t like being woken up this way.","Zi Ling said, “Look! All my wounds and bruises are gone!” Chaoge said sleepily, “Alright.” Zi Ling said, “Look! My skin is so smooth! It has never been this good before!”","She had always felt inferior because of her darker skin tone, but after using the ointment, she was glowing.","It was incredible!","Chaoge nodded and wanted to go back to sleep.","Zi Ling wouldn’t let her. “Just look at me! I’m so fair now!”","Chaoge rolled her eyes at Zi Ling. “Why are you so surprised? You used the Supreme Level medicine! Say another word, and I’ll slap you! Let me sleep!”","Zi Ling didn’t dare say a word.","Despite having been told off, she was thrilled.","It really was a bottle of Supreme Level medicine!","Gosh!","How rich was Feng Wu?","Ah!","It suddenly occurred to her that she had only used less than half of what was in the bottle, and the rest was still on the floor.","Ahhh —","Zi Ling ran out to the living room.","The ointment was still there on the floor! Her eyes lit up.","Just then, someone walked in and stepped on","Zi Ling almost wept. “You!!!” She pointed at Ye Han. “How could you step on it?!”","She had stepped on the ointment.","Zi Ling had wanted to cover the rest of her body with the ointment.","Ye Han shook her head. “Why are you making such a big fuss? It’s only a pair of shoes.”"]},{"number":2536,"title":"Chapter 2536 - How Generous (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2536 How Generous (2)","Zi Ling thought, “Who cares about your shoes! My ointment!”","She ran so fast that she almost knocked Ye Han down.","The white ointment had turned black after Ye Han stepped on it.","Zi Ling glared at her.","Ye Han was confused. “What’s the matter with you? What’s with all this junk?”","Zi Ling looked at the ointment on the floor and hated Ye Han.","But most importantly...","Zi Ling knelt on the floor and scooped all the ointment into an empty bottle. She almost wanted to rub her face on the floor.","Ye Han stared at her and asked incredulously, “Are you nuts?!”","Zi Ling ignored her.","When Ye Han saw the pile of things outside her door, she was furious.","“What on earth is going on here?!”","Zi Ling was too focused on the medicine to answer her question.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Ye Han tried to open the door to her original storage room, but it wouldn’t open.","Frustrated, she banged on the door.","It was now Feng Wu’s room.","Feng Wu was cultivating and wouldn’t answer the door. “What are you doing?!” Chaoge opened her door and asked angrily. How dare this person bang on Xiao Wu’s door?","Ye Han was furious. She pointed at the pile of things behind her. “What the hell did you","do?”","Chaoge said impatiently, “I should be the one asking that question! Why did you put your things everywhere? If you don’t want them, I’ll throw them out!”","Ye Han said, “That’s my stuff!”","Chaoge said, “Is that so? Who gave you the permission to put your things wherever you want?”","Ye Han glared at her.","Chaoge said, “We each have one room only. What makes you think that you can occupy someone else’s room? You don’t get to question me!”","She was about the slam her door shut.","“Stop right there!” Ye Han said coldly.","Chaoge turned around to face her.","Ye Han said, “Clear out your room now! I need it for my things!”","Chaoge found the demand idiotic.","Ye Han said, “Do it now!”","She didn’t like Duan Chaoge, and she disliked Feng Wu even more.","She hadn’t liked Feng Wu ever since Ling Hao gave her a warm welcome, and it only became worse when Feng Wu became the center of attention at the morning assembly.","Chaoge rolled her eyes at Ye Han. “What if I say no?”","Ye Han smirked. “Are you sure?”","Chaoge said, “Positive.”","Ye Han said, “Fine! I’ll beat you until you say","yes!”","She charged at Chaoge.","After learning Unflower’s skills, Chaoge was a very capable cultivator now.","Ye Han was from Class B and should be more advanced than Chaoge.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","They started exchanging blows.","Ye Han narrowed her eyes. She didn’t expect the new student to be such a good fighter, but she didn’t think that Chaoge was her match."]},{"number":2537,"title":"Chapter 2537 - How Generous (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2537 How Generous (3)","Chaoge indeed wasn’t Ye Han’s match. She would fight back when she had the chance, but Ye Han could easily overwhelm her.","She was going to lose after thirty blows. Thump!","Ye Han struck at Chaoge.","Chaoge would be severely injured if Ye Yan’s blow hit her.","“Chaoge, watch out!” Zi Ling cried out.","Before she knew it, Zi Ling had sided with Chaoge and was worried about her.","But the next moment!","Thump!","Ye Han was kicked away with tremendous force!","How did that happen? Zi Ling watched as Ye Han flew away.","She then looked at Feng Wu, who was helping Chaoge to her feet.","Gosh!","Holy crap!","She couldn’t believe her eyes.","That was Feng Wu!","The new student!","The supposedly useless Feng Wu!","But she had just kicked Ye Han away so easily!","Ye Han was a student of Class B!","The second best class!","Zi Ling sucked in a breath.","She wasn’t the only one who was shocked.","Ye Han fell and slid a few meters over the floor before she stopped when she hit the wall.","Luckily, the War Academy used the best soundproofing material. No one outside heard the noise.","There was a burning pain in Ye Han’s back.","Being a Class B student, she thought she could easily crush the new students.","It had never occurred to her that she would be the one who was crushed.","No, it had to be a coincidence!","Ye Han struggled to her feet.","She glared at Feng Wu.","“Feng Wu, did you do this?” Ye Han was furious.","Feng Wu didn’t even look at her.","She ignored me!","Ye Han was humiliated.","“Who the hell do you think you are? You’ve offended Miss Qingluan! You’ll never graduate! just die!”","Ye Han charged at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was asking Chaoge, “Are you hurt?”","Chaoge said, “It’s just a scratch.”","Feng Wu gave her a bottle of Supreme Level ointment.","Another bottle?","Zi Ling was so excited that she trembled.","However, she was kind enough to warn Feng Wu. “Watch out!”","Ye Han was already by Feng Wu’s side.","No one saw how Feng Wu moved, but —","Thump!","Ye Han flew away just like before, and she landed in the same spot.","She smashed into the wall again.","Wow!","She spat out a mouthful of blood.","Zi Ling was amazed.","Gosh!","Feng Wu was...","Zi Ling had seen it clearly this time. It really was Feng Wu!","Feng Wu only moved when Ye Han was a leg away from her."]},{"number":2538,"title":"Chapter 2538 - How Generous (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2538 How Generous (4)","Ye Han couldn’t even withstand one kick.","A student from Class B was so easily defeated.","“Feng Wu, I’m going to kill you!” Ye Han spat out another mouthful of blood.","Zi Ling suddenly felt sorry for Ye Han.","But Ye Han wouldn’t admit her defeat. She struggled to her feet and charged at Feng Wu for the third time.","This time...","She was kicked away just like the first two times.","She kept trying until it was the tenth time.","This time, she couldn’t get up anymore.","She lay on the floor and stared at Feng Wu.","Her mouth and clothes were covered with blood, and the fact that Feng Wu was better than her filled her with despair.","She had been angry the first two times.","And the two times after that.","Then she became confused.","By the tenth time, she finally admitted her defeat.","Zi Ling felt sorry for Ye Han, but she was happy that it wasn’t her.","Luckily, she had surrendered in time. Otherwise, she would be the one crying on the floor now.","She walked up to Ye Han, knelt on the floor, and took out the last bit of ointment she had. “Sister Ye, this is...”","Ye Han pushed her away before she could finish.","With how severely injured she was, it was amazing that she could push Zi Ling so hard.","Although Zi Ling managed to steady herself, she dropped what was left of the ointment.","Thump!","The porcelain bowl fell on the ground.","“My ointment!” Zi Ling really was crying now.","Ye Han struggled to her feet and stared at Feng Wu coldly. She took a deep breath and jumped out the window.","She hadn’t killed herself, had she?","Chaoge rushed to the window and saw Ye Han stumble away.","“She’s so stubborn,” Chaoge mumbled.","Zi Ling was concerned. “Is Sister Ye going to be alright?” Feng Wu nodded. “It’s not as bad as it looks. Her internal organs will be fine as long as she doesn’t do anything reckless. Staying in bed for two weeks and using some Supreme Level medicine should do the trick.”","Zi Ling was baffled.","Some Supreme Level medicine? Not everyone had that! Most people would never encounter something like that in their lifetime!","Feng Wu watched as Chaoge bundled the things into Ye Han’s room and cleaned the living room. “Did you say that there was going to be a big event today?”","“That’s right!” Zi Ling showed Feng Wu to the door.","There was a schedule on the wall.","“We have a major assembly today!” Zi Ling said, “All students of Class E are going on a mission together, and we only have 15 minutes left! Let’s go!”","Feng Wu, Chaoge, and Zi Ling were all in Class E.","Zi Ling explained it to them on their way to the gathering"]},{"number":2539,"title":"Chapter 2539 - The Mission (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2539 The Mission (1)","“Missions like these are our best chance to earn points. Miss Feng Wu, can I team up with you?” Zi Ling asked excitedly.","Before, she would have stayed far away from Feng Wu, but things were different now. She had seen Feng Wu’s true power.","She had kicked Ye Han away so easily, and Ye Han was from Class B!","How terrifying would her real power be?","And Zi Ling knew that she could use that sort of help.","Follow Feng Wu, and she would win!","Feng Wu asked, “Earn points? How?”","Zi Ling’s eyes sparkled.","She said, “The 1,500 students of Class E will be divided into five-member teams. That’s 300 teams in total.","“The teams will be ranked by the points they get, and members of the top team will each earn 100 extra points. The best member of that team will get another 100 points.","“The second-best team will get 80 points.","“The third one will get 60 points.","“The fourth to the 100th will get 40 points.","“The 100th to the 200th, 20 points.","“The last 100 teams won’t receive any points.","“Absent students, students who ask for help, and those who take leave, will have their points deducted. “How many points do you have now?” Zi Ling asked.","Chaoge said, “Ten.”","Zi Ling’s eyes widened. “How is that possible? We each have 100 points to start with, don’t","we?”","Chaoge said, “Yes, but this room costs 90 points a month.”","Zi Ling stared at her.","The look gave Chaoge the creeps. “What?”","Zi Ling asked, “Why did you pay the rent for the whole month when you can pay by the week? Some students even pay every five or three days. How are you going to pay for your meals now?”","Chaoge was shocked. The moderator had lied to them!","Zi Ling said, “Apart from accommodation, taking classes will cost you points as well. Everyone has to save up, or they won’t be able to last for long in this place.”","Chaoge asked, “Do I have to pay to go to classes?”","Zi Ling said, “Of course! As long as you can afford it, you can go to whichever class you want.”","Duan Chaoge stared in shocked silence.","Zi Ling said, “A big event like this doesn’t happen every day, so we have to cherish this opportunity. Individual tasks are much more time-consuming","“If you only have ten points, you have to work hard this time. Otherwise, you won’t be able to attend any class.”","Feng Wu glanced at the moderator on their way out.","The woman raised her chin in an arrogant manner."]},{"number":2540,"title":"Chapter 2540 - The Mission (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2540 The Mission (2)","Just then, they saw someone coming their","way.","The person came from the villa section.","It was none other than Zuo Qingluan herself.","The moderator beamed at Zuo Qingluan when she saw her.","“Miss Qingluan!” She greeted the girl from afar and bowed.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t even glance at the woman as she walked past her.","The woman only raised her head after Zuo Qingluan was a few hundred meters away. She said, “She’s so young but so talented! And she’s the crown prince’s fiancee as well! Her future is so promising!”","She then sneered at Feng Wu and Chaoge.","Feng Wu couldn’t be bothered to respond.","Fearing that Feng Wu would be angry, Zi Ling dragged her and Chaoge away.","After a few hundred meters, Chaoge threw off her hand and asked, “Why did we run?”","Zi Ling whispered, “You don’t want to cross that woman.”","Read the next chapter on our vjpn0vel. c0m","Chaoge asked, “Why should I be afraid of her?!”","Zi Ling said, “Because her husband is one of the assistant tutors of Class E!”","Each class was led by a chief tutor and five assistant tutors.","Chaoge said, “Even the chief tutor can’t scare","me!”","Zi Ling rolled her eyes at Chaoge. “All tutors are capable cultivators, even the ones of Class E. They’re as good as Class A graduates, if not better. You were crushed by Ye Han, and you’ll surely be crushed by any of the tutors. Don’t do anything impulsive, okay?”","Chaoge only smirked.","Since Feng Wu had defeated Ye Han, Zi Ling felt that she was good enough to be a Class B student. Ye Han was one of the weaker students, however, so Zi Ling believed that Feng Wu should only be above average in Class B.","But that was impressive enough.","It would make her invincible in Class E.","Soon, they arrived at the designated location.","Almost all the students had arrived, and they had picked their teammates.","Someone called Zi Ling’s name.","“Zi Ling, join us! We have one spot left!” A teenager named Lu Xiao waved at her.","Next to him was a girl named Zhen Ya, who frowned at the suggestion.","Zi Ling glanced at Zhen Ya and shook her head. “That’s alright. I have a team already.”","Zhen Ya took Lu Xiao’s arm affectionately. “Lu Xiao, she has her own team. Let’s not trouble her.”","Lu Xiao frowned when he saw Feng Wu. It was obvious that Zi Ling’s teammate was the new student who had offended Chief Qingluan.","“Zi Ling, why are you with them? You’ll be a bottom team.” Lu Xiao tried to pull Zi Ling away.","Zhen Ya gave Zi Ling a warning look.","Zi Ling pretended not to notice it. She said grumpily, “It’s my choice. Go back to your team!”","She then dragged Feng Wu and Chaoge in the other direction.","“Team up with Feng Wu and you’ll lose!” Lu Xiao shouted after Zi Ling.","Zi Ling thought, “You have no idea how good Feng Wu is.”","Because of what Lu Xiao said, everyone looked in their direction.","“It’s Feng Wu!”","Everyone had almost forgotten about the once genius girl, but Zuo Qingluan had jogged their memories."]},{"number":2541,"title":"Chapter 2541 - The Mission (3)","paragraphs":["Since she had been targeted by Zuo Qingluan, Feng Wu would have a very difficult time here in War Academy.","Chaoge asked curiously, “What’s their problem? Why do I feel like that girl doesn’t like you?”","Zi Ling said, “Just ignore them!”","Chaoge and Feng Wu exchanged looks and decided that there had to be a story behind it.","By then, they only had three minutes left.","If no one else joined them, they would only have three people in their team.","With three team members only, they were bound to become the team with the lowest points. At least, that was what Zhen Ya believed.","“Who do we have here? What? Can’t you find any teammates?” Mu Qianqian asked in a taunting voice.","Sun Jingyu was by her side.","Feng Wu glanced at her and ignored the question.","Mu Qianqian felt as if she had just been slapped.","“Feng Wu!” she bellowed.","Chaoge glared at her. “Stop shouting at us! Who the hell do you think you are?”","Sun Jingyu cut them off. “Be quiet! Do you want to do this or not?! The five of us will form a team. That’s it!”","Updates by","Chaoge asked, “What if I say no?”","Sun Jingyu was very persistent. “You’re new students here, and you don’t know the rules. You’re so weak, and we’re going to fight Whiten Lion Elephants this time. If you’re killed, it’s my points that will be deducted, so shut up!”","Duan Chaoge stared in shocked silence.","She had never lost a quarrel until now.","She wanted to retort, but Sun Jingyu had the moral high ground.","Mu Qianqian smirked. “We’re doing you a favor, okay? Don’t be ridiculous!”","Chaoge said, “We don’t need your help!”","Mu Qianqian said, “The class president can decide which students go to which teams. Unless you’re not a student of Class E, you have to follow her orders. Guys, am I right?’","The students answered in unison, “Yes!”","Chaoge was speechless.","Feng Wu patted her shoulder. “It’s alright.”","She didn’t care who she teamed up with.","But it was very unlike Sun Jingyu to be so helpful toward some new students.","Lu Xiao said enviously, “With Jingyu’s help, that team may actually get quite a few points.”","Zhen Ya smirked. “Jingyu is good, but those three are all weaklings. Do you think Jingyu alone can change anything? That team is doomed.”","The other students were all amazed by how generous their class president was.","Chaoge was mad.","Feng Wu was too good to take part in such an event. That class president was a hypocrite who wanted to steal the spotlight!","Every team leader received a number.","Because Sun Jingyu was the class president, her team always got number one.","And Sun Jingyu had always been the most outstanding team player in Class E."]},{"number":2542,"title":"Chapter 2542 - The Mission (4)","paragraphs":["Everyone looked enviously at Feng Wu and Chaoge.","Feng Wu couldn’t be bothered to respond.","Chaoge was speechless.","Zi Ling was excited.","The class president was on her team!","“We’re going to be the best team!” she thought to herself.","An assistant tutor was already speaking on the platform.","Their mission was to hunt Whiten Lion Elephants.","The animals lived in the outer circle of Thousand Night Forest. They were giant beasts with the head of a lion and the body of an elephant. They had terrifying strength.","A student could earn a point when they obtained a crystal core from a Whiten Lion Elephant.","Feng Wu was in Team 001, and Lu Xiao was in Team 015.","“Jingyu, you’re not in our team this time. I’m so sad,” someone said mockingly as she walked past Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked up.","The girl beamed at her. “I’m Pei Si. Would you like to join my team?”","Updates by","Feng Wu frowned. There was something condescending about the girl’s tone, which she didn’t like.","“You don’t want to? Miss President is going to get you killed. See you later.”","Pei Si’s four friends chuckled and dashed off.","“That stupid girl! How dare she act like she’s better than us!” Mu Qianqian clenched her fists.","Feng Wu glanced at Zi Ling.","Zi Ling explained, “Class E has a ranking system. All the students are on it, and it’s updated each month. Jingyu is currently the top student, and Pei Si is second.”","She then lowered her voice. “Pei Si only joined the academy last year, but she’s been making rapid progress. Jingyu feels threatened because Pei Si is also outgoing and likes to make friends.”","Chaoge was glad to hear that.","Feng Wu knew what Sun Jingyu was doing. Someone higher up had probably given Sun Jingyu instructions, telling her to choose Feng Wu as a team member so as to plot against her later.","At that thought, she glanced at Sun Jingyu.","She recalled what the assistant tutor said earlier. “No one is allowed to rob other people of their crystal cores, retaliate against personal enemies, go deep into the woods, or...”","Zi Ling whispered, “Mr. Tan, the assistant tutor, is the moderator’s husband. As for what kind of person he is... You’ll see.”","“Let’s begin!”","After Mr. Tan made that announcement, the students dashed off in all directions.","“Let’s go!” Mu Qianqian said impatiently. “Do you think the Whiten Lion Elephants are going to come to you?”","Chaoge glared at her. “Be polite!”","Mu Qianqian said, “I? am ?polite!”","Their shouting was giving Sun Jingyu a headache, so she shouted, “Shut up, both of you!”","Mu Qianqian immediately stopped talking, and Chaoge didn’t persist either.","Sun Jingyu glared at Feng Wu. “Keep your friend on a leash!”","Feng Wu shrugged.","Sun Jingyu wanted to smack Feng Wu, but she had a mission, so she could only take a deep breath.","Everyone looked enviously at Feng Wu and Chaoge.","Feng Wu couldn’t be bothered to respond.","Chaoge was speechless.","Zi Ling was excited.","The class president was on her team!","“We’re going to be the best team!” she thought to herself.","An assistant tutor was already speaking on the platform.","Their mission was to hunt Whiten Lion Elephants.","The animals lived in the outer circle of Thousand Night Forest. They were giant beasts with the head of a lion and the body of an elephant. They had terrifying strength.","A student could earn a point when they obtained a crystal core from a Whiten Lion Elephant.","Feng Wu was in Team 001, and Lu Xiao was in Team 015.","“Jingyu, you’re not in our team this time. I’m so sad,” someone said mockingly as she walked past Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked up.","The girl beamed at her. “I’m Pei Si. Would you like to join my team?”","Feng Wu frowned. There was something condescending about the girl’s tone, which she didn’t like.","“You don’t want to? Miss President is going to get you killed. See you later.”","Pei Si’s four friends chuckled and dashed off.","“That stupid girl! How dare she act like she’s better than us!” Mu Qianqian clenched her fists.","Feng Wu glanced at Zi Ling.","Zi Ling explained, “Class E has a ranking system. All the students are on it, and it’s updated each month. Jingyu is currently the top student, and Pei Si is second.”","She then lowered her voice. “Pei Si only joined the academy last year, but she’s been making rapid progress. Jingyu feels threatened because Pei Si is also outgoing and likes to make friends.”","Chaoge was glad to hear that.","Feng Wu knew what Sun Jingyu was doing. Someone higher up had probably given Sun Jingyu instructions, telling her to choose Feng Wu as a team member so as to plot against her later.","At that thought, she glanced at Sun Jingyu.","She recalled what the assistant tutor said earlier. “No one is allowed to rob other people of their crystal cores, retaliate against personal enemies, go deep into the woods, or...”","Zi Ling whispered, “Mr. Tan, the assistant tutor, is the moderator’s husband. As for what kind of person he is... You’ll see.”","“Let’s begin!”","After Mr. Tan made that announcement, the students dashed off in all directions.","“Let’s go!” Mu Qianqian said impatiently. “Do you think the Whiten Lion Elephants are going to come to you?”","Chaoge glared at her. “Be polite!”","Mu Qianqian said, “I? am ?polite!”","Their shouting was giving Sun Jingyu a headache, so she shouted, “Shut up, both of you!”","Mu Qianqian immediately stopped talking, and Chaoge didn’t persist either.","Sun Jingyu glared at Feng Wu. “Keep your friend on a leash!”","Feng Wu shrugged.","Sun Jingyu wanted to smack Feng Wu, but she had a mission, so she could only take a deep breath."]},{"number":2543,"title":"Chapter 2543 - Take Action (1)","paragraphs":["Sun Jingyu snorted. “Enough with the nonsense! Follow me! I know where to find the Whiten Lion Elephants!”","While she took the lead, Mu Qianqian walked in the rear. Feng Wu wondered if they were making sure that no one followed them.","She looked forward to seeing what would happen next.","Sun Jingyu led them to the northeast.","At first, there were many students around, but as they walked deeper into the woods, there was hardly anyone around.","Zi Ling felt that something was wrong, so she asked, “Why haven’t we started hunting?”","She had seen several Whiten Lion Elephants running past them.","They didn’t need to carry the entire animal back. The crystal core alone was enough. It was so convenient, but they hadn’t started yet. Zi Ling was perplexed.","But she didn’t dare question Sun Jingyu either, so she asked the question in a tiny voice.","Mu Qianqian snapped, “Shut up! Who gave you permission to speak?!”","Zi Ling immediately fell silent.","A common Class E student like Zi Ling wouldn’t dare offend the more influential groups, and Mu Qianqian was a member of such a group.","Chaoge was displeased and glared at Mu Qianqian. “You shut up! Who the hell do you think you are?!”","“You!” Mu Qianqian was about to retort, when Sun Jingyu silenced her with a glance.","Updates by","Mu Qianqian took the hint. She smirked and ignored Chaoge.","Chaoge didn’t see the interaction. She patted Zi Ling on the shoulder and said, “They like bullying nice people. Be fiercer, and she won’t dare to treat you that way.”","Zi Ling didn’t know what to say. She wanted to do that, but she wasn’t capable enough.","Mu Qianqian threw a dirty look at Chaoge. “You just wait. I’ll make you cry later!”","They traveled a few more kilometers and were about to reach the middle of the woods.","Sun Jingyu stopped.","“Let’s wait here,” she said.","Mu Qianqian was thrilled. She clenched her fists and gave Feng Wu and Chaoge a taunting look.","“It’s so dangerous here!” Zi Ling stepped onto a rock and looked into the valley nearby. “There are so many Whiten Lion Elephants down there!”","Chaoge asked curiously, “Isn’t that a good thing?”","Sun Jingyu and Mu Qianqian were both amazed by her question.","“Gosh! There are so many of them!” Chaoge looked to the northeast and saw a large pack of Whiten Lion Elephants in the valley.","That place looked like their natural habitat.","That must be where all the Whiten Lion Elephants came from.","Just then, they heard a loud noise.","Boom!","That was...","“The Whiten Lion Elephants are coming!”","Zi Ling shouted, “It’s a pair of them!”","Chaoge said, “Just two? Why are you so afraid?”","Zi Ling was perplexed, but it then occurred to her.","“Chaoge is a good cultivator, at least better than I am.","“And there’s JIngyu as well...”"]},{"number":2544,"title":"Chapter 2544 - Take Action (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2544: Take Action (2)","Zi Ling didn’t see Sun Jingyu and Mu Qianqian when she turned around, and she panicked a little. “Where did they go?”","Chaoge said, “They can go wherever they want. We’re better off without them.”","They were still talking when two White Lion Elephants noticed them.","Feng Wu was about to make a move when Chaoge stopped her.","“Xiao Wu,” said Chaoge, “can you wait until I can’t hold them back anymore?”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","Chaoge had been making rapid progress lately, and she needed the practice before she made any more breakthroughs.","Feng Wu handed her Fire Dragon Rod to Chaoge.","It was the same weapon she had used to beat up the Gu brothers, but she preferred her sword, so she gave the rod to Chaoge.","“Wow! The Fire Dragon Rod!” Zi Ling was thrilled.","Feng Wu asked, “Do you know what it is?”","Zi Ling said, “Of course! It’s ranked the third most effective weapon in its category. It’s worth at least millions of gold coins!”","She stared at Feng Wu in disbelief and couldn’t imagine how rich the latter had to be.","Updates by","Zi Ling looked at Chaoge expectantly, wondering how excited the latter had to be.","To her surprise, Chaoge wasn’t excited. She only picked up the rod and shouted, “Xiao Wu, just wait and see!”","Whoosh —","She charged at the animals with the rod in her hand.","Chaoge had learned her moves from Unflower.","Unflower’s moves were as elegant as dancing flowers.","But Chaoge’s moves were much more forceful.","“Watch out!” Zi Ling saw the two Whiten Lion Elephants charge at Chaoge. ” Search n3wn0vel. on google”.Although Sun Jingyu and Mu Qianqian were headed Chaoge’s way, they didn’t show any intention to help her.","Grinding her teeth, Zi Ling grabbed her weapon and charged at the beasts.","She stopped one of the Whiten Lion Elephants so that Chaoge didn’t need to fight two at a time.","“How ridiculous.” Mu Qianqian smirked. “I didn’t know that she was so stupid.”","Sun Jingyu snorted. “She has a death wish, so let’s fulfill it for her.”","Mu Qianqian was glad when she saw Zi Ling’s reaction.","It made her feel that she had chosen the right side. Zi Ling, on the other hand, was stupid enough to side with the two new students.","A five-member team could only handle two Whiten Lion Elephants at a time, but now, those three people were all on their own.","Sun Jingyu and Mu Qianqian gloated at their predicament.","Thump!","Chaoge leaped high into the air and smashed down with the Fire Dragon Rod.","Both Sun Jingyu and Mu Qianqian were convinced that she was going to fail.","They believed that she was going to be trampled.","To their surprise, when Chaoge charged at the Whiten Lion Elephant from above, the animal stopped moving as if it was frozen.","That was the effect of the Fire Dragon Rod.","It could slow down all living creatures in its range.","The Whiten Lion Elephant had never felt like this before.","And Chaoge took advantage of that pause."]},{"number":2545,"title":"Chapter 2545 - Take Action (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2545: Take Action (3)","Thump!","The Fire Dragon Rod smashed onto the animal’s head.","Mu Qianqian’s eyes widened.","Because Duan Chaoge, the new student, killed a Whiten Lion Elephant with one strike.","Mu Qianqian could never do that all by herself.","But she didn’t want to admit that Chaoge was better than she was.","To her astonishment, Chaoge was already charging at the other Whiten Lion Elephant.","Meanwhile, Zi Ling was being chased around by the Whiten Lion Elephant.","Chaoge leaped into the air again. While the Whiten Lion Elephant was slowed down by the Fire Dragon Rod, she hit it on the head.","Poof!","Its head exploded, and the beast fell into a heap on the ground.","Mu Qianqian was astonished.","She involuntarily grabbed Sun Jingyu’s hand. “Jingyu, look...”","Chaoge’s reaction was beyond her imagination.","Updates by","Sun Jingyu smirked. “She only killed two beasts. It’s not a big deal.”","Zi Ling was amazed.","She knew that Chaoge was better than she was, but she never expected that with the help of the Fire Dragon Rod, Chaoge could do such amazing things.","She gave Chaoge a thumbs up. “Chaoge, you’re much better than any of the Class E students.”","Mu Qianqian was displeased.","Any of the Class E students? What was that supposed to mean?","Three more Whiten Lion Elephants arrived.","Mu Qianqian smirked. She didn’t believe that Chaoge could fight off all three fully-developed beasts.","Thump!","Chaoge charged at the Whiten Lion Elephants before they could make their move. She jumped up and struck one of them.","Instinct told her that if she chose the Whiten Lion Elephant that was at the front, the other two would immediately surround her.","But if she chose the one at the rear, the other two would need time to react.","Her instinct was correct.","The third Whiten Lion Elephant didn’t expect to become the first target, and its head cracked open before it had time to react.","By the time the other two Whiten Lion Elephants realized what had happened and came after Chaoge, Zi Ling had arrived with her sword, shouting, “Chaoge, just like before!”","She stalled one of the beasts for Chaoge, who would come to help her after she killed the other one.","After the first round, they worked even better together this time.","Thump!","Thump!","Chaoge killed the two Whiten Lion Elephants in less than a minute.","Zi Ling was thrilled. She ran toward Chaoge and shouted, “Chaoge, you’re amazing! You killed five Whiten Lion Elephants!”","Chaoge was perplexed. “Is that a lot?”","Zi Ling said, “It’s not a lot, but it’ll give you enough points. We hunt Whiten Lion Elephants quite often, so I know how many beasts each team can kill on average.","“There are 300 teams in total, and killing five Whiten Lion Elephants will put our team in the top 200.”","Zi Ling was an average student of Class E, and her team was usually ranked around 200."]},{"number":2546,"title":"Chapter 2546 - Take Action (4)","paragraphs":["Chaoge said, “So, we can earn points, right?”","Zi Ling said, “Yes. We’ll earn the minimum points when we’re ranked higher than 200. Chaoge, you’re so amazing! My previous teams had to fight a whole day and still couldn’t kill five beasts!”","Chaoge was perplexed. “But it’s so easy!”","So easy? Mu Qianqian wanted to smack Chaoge on the head.","Killing five White Lion Elephants could never be easy. She would never be able to do it on her own!","“She’s just showing off!” Mu Qianqian thought resentfully.","Zi Ling idolized Chaoge. “Chaoge, you did all that on your own, so you must be as capable as Mu Qianqian is. I can wait to see our final result!”","Mu Qianqian glared at Zi Ling.","As capable as I am? Are you blind? I’m clearly much better!","“What? Do you have a second opinion?” Chaoge glanced at her.","Mu Qianqian smirked and wouldn’t reply.","Chaoge said, “Let’s have a competition, then. See which of us can hunt more White Lion Elephants.”","Mu Qianqian still wouldn’t answer.","Chaoge said, “You don’t have the guts to compete with me, but you won’t admit that I’m better than you. I’ve never met anyone so pretentious.”","Updates by","Mu Qianqian stomped her foot in frustration. “You!”","Chaoge shook her head. “I what? Fight me, then. All you ever do is snort. Do you think you’re Zuo Qingluan?”","Mu Qianqian was infuriated.","She rolled up her sleeves. “Bring it on! You can’t intimidate me!”","Five White Lion Elephants were coming their way.","Chaoge glanced at Feng Wu. Somehow, she felt that someone was controlling the number of White Lion Elephants that could approach them. Could it be Xiao Wu?","Right now, Feng Wu was sitting on a rock with her eyes closed and her legs crossed. She was cultivating.","Mu Qianqian followed Chaoge’s gaze and saw Feng Wu on the rock. She smirked. “Why are you looking at her? Do you think she can help you with hunting the White Lion Elephants? She’s useless!”","Chaoge concluded that Mu Qianqian was an idiot.","Sun Jingyu felt the same way as Mu Qianqian and sneered at Feng Wu as well.","“We’re all here to hunt White Lion Elephants, but she’s been sitting there ever since she arrived! Who does she think she is? That’s just so arrogant!”","Sun Jingyu didn’t like Feng Wu at all.","If she knew how these White Lion Elephants were being controlled...","Chaoge charged at the White Lion Elephants before Mu Qianqian could make a move.","Mu Qianqian was scared.","Each of the White Lion Elephants was ten times bigger than she was. Normally, she couldn’t run away fast enough.","“Are you scared? What a coward! Let me teach you how to hunt!”","No, you won’t! ?Mu Qianqian was furious.","Agitated by Chaoge’s words, she grabbed her sword and charged out before Sun Jingyu could stop her.","Thump!","Chaoge ran away from the pack after she killed the first White Lion Elephant.","Mu Qianqian just happened to run into the circle at that moment.","Immediately, four White Lion Elephants surrounded her."]},{"number":2547,"title":"Chapter 2547 - More Action (1)","paragraphs":["Standing next to the four White Lion Elephants, Mu Qianqian looked as frail as a straw.","The dead White Lion Elephant’s blood had splashed everywhere. The smell agitated the four beasts, and they lost control.","When Mu Qianqian arrived, they attacked her without hesitation.","“Ahhh —”","Mu Qianqian shouted in agony.","She wanted to flee but was surrounded, and she wasn’t capable enough to defeat them either.","She was flustered and didn’t know what to do.","Chaoge took the chance to start knocking the beasts on the head with her Fire Dragon Rod.","Thump! Thump! Thump! Thump!","She killed all five White Lion Elephants in the end.","Mu Qianqian was so frightened that her face was ghastly pale. Her clothes were disheveled, and she kept waving her hands around like a crazy person.","“Hey! Stop!” Chaoge patted her on the shoulder.","Only then did Mu Qianqian calm down. She looked at Chaoge in bewilderment and was dumbfounded when she saw the dead White Lion Elephants around them.","“Did you do this?” She glared at Chaoge.","Updates by","Chaoge raised her chin. “Now you know how good I am.”","Mu Qianqian only yelled at her. “You stole my White Lion Elephants! You’re so disgusting! That’s cheating!”","Chaoge was perplexed.","She had saved Mu Qianqian, but the girl was accusing her of cheating.","“You’re unbelievable!” Chaoge started walking away from her.","Mu Qianqian ran after her. “Their attention was on me, which was why you could kill them all at once. You don’t get to claim all the rewards. You should give me at least two, no, three crystal cores! I’m better than you!”","Chaoge rolled her eyes at Mu Qianqian. “Talking to you is an insult to my intelligence.”","Mu Qianqian was going to chase Chaoge, but was stopped by Sun Jingyu’s stern look.","Recalling their plan, Mu Qianqian calmed down and snorted at Chaoge, who had turned her back on her.","I’ll live with your arrogance for now because you’ll be dead soon!","Mu Qianqian went to Sun Jingyu’s side and looked forward to what would happen next.","“We have ten crystal cores already!” Zi Ling took Chaoge’s hands in excitement. “We’ll be ranked in the top 150 teams at least.”","Chaoge asked, “Can we rank that high?”","Zi Ling said, “Yes, it’s relatively easy to be ranked between 100 and 200. It’ll get more and more difficult to move up the rankings after that.”","Mu Qianqian smirked. “I’ll report you for cheating!”","Chaoge found her claim idiotic. She told Feng Wu, “No matter what happens to her later, I won’t help her. Xiao Wu, you should do the same.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Why had she been cultivating since she arrived? It wasn’t just for show. She had noticed that the forest had the purest spiritual essence.","Since the White Lion Elephants had all gathered in this area, it meant that the spiritual essence was the densest here.","That was why they had chosen to live in this spot.","Feng Wu could feel her cultivation level rising as she sat there.","Her capability had reached Level 9 of the Spiritual Lord stage."]},{"number":2548,"title":"Chapter 2548 - More Action (2)","paragraphs":["Ordinary people couldn’t imagine how difficult it was to advance from a Level 9 Spiritual Lord to a Spiritual King.","Countless people had never been able to break that barrier.","Feng Wu wanted to become a Spiritual King as soon as possible because Zuo Qingluan was a Level 1 Spiritual King.","Now that she was about to catch up with Zuo Qingluan, she didn’t want to waste a single minute.","That was why she was so focused on her cultivation.","She hadn’t been able to find a way at first, but she had an epiphany when she saw the White Lion Elephant herd earlier. After circulating the spiritual essence through her energy channels, she felt everything clearing up.","If one were to quantify it, she was 3% into completing the task.","3% wasn’t much, but it was a start, and Feng Wu was happy with the progress.","When Sun Jingyu saw Feng Wu nodding at Chaoge after the latter suggested that they shouldn’t help Mu Qianqian, she was speechless. She found their reaction ridiculous.","How could that useless Feng Wu agree? She wasn’t even as good as Duan Chaoge!","Why did Sun Jingyu know that? Because she had been told that Feng Wu was even weaker than her maid, let alone Duan Chaoge.","The news had spread in the War Academy.","Most students didn’t care much because Feng Wu was in Class E. That was too low a level for them to be concerned with.","But all the students in Class E had heard the news.","Updates by","They believed that Feng Wu was useless.","Mu Qianqian believed that Feng Wu was bluffing as well.","But what they didn’t know was that Feng Wu was so capable that she could control all the White Lion Elephants.","“That’s so strange,” said Mu Qianqian. “The other White Lion Elephants should have run in our direction when they heard the sound of fighting. Where are they now?”","Sun Jingyu was perplexed as well.","The beasts were coming in threes or fives, as if to train Chaoge. Was someone controlling them? How strange!","“Here they are!” Mu Qianqian pointed at some White Lion Elephants in the distance. She was so excited that she took Sun Jingyu’s hand. “Look! They’re coming, right?!”","Sun Jingyu and Mu Qianqian had disappeared at first because they had gone to set up a trap.","“Yes, there they are.” Sun Jingyu grinned maliciously.","She couldn’t wait to see how Feng Wu would react when ten White Lion Elephants were charging at her. She wouldn’t be able to sit there and cultivate anymore!","Sun Jingyu had used a luring agent to attract the White Lion Elephants’ attention, and she had sprinkled the same potion around the rock that Feng Wu was sitting on.","That would lead the White Lion Elephants directly to Feng Wu.","Sun Jingyu didn’t dislike Feng Wu to the point of wanting to kill her, but her patron had paid her enough to persuade her otherwise.","Mu Qianqian grinned when she saw the beasts charging at Feng Wu.","But it baffled her when she saw that Feng Wu wasn’t nervous.","Why wasn’t Duan Chaoge nervous?","Even Zi Ling wasn’t nervous.","That was so strange.","Wait —"]},{"number":2549,"title":"Chapter 2549 - More Action (3)","paragraphs":["When the White Lion Elephants reached Feng Wu, they suddenly stopped and bowed to her, which amazed Mu Qianqian.","What was wrong with these beasts? Mu Qianqian and Sun Jingyu looked at each other and were both confused.","What confused them even more was that the White Lion Elephants turned around.","They were facing the opposite direction now.","Boom!","The White Lion Elephants glared at Sun Jingyu and Mu Qianqian.","Sun Jingyu was speechless.","So was Mu Qianqian.","Their hearts sank, and they had a bad feeling.","They were right!","The White Lion Elephants were charging at them now.","How was that even possible?!","Sun Jingyu couldn’t believe her eyes.","Anyone would find it incredible, but it couldn’t change the fact.","Updates by","The two of them couldn’t change the White Lion Elephants’ behavior.","Soon, they were surrounded by over 20 beasts.","Mu Qianqian almost lost her mind when she had to face five White Lion Elephants. Now, there were four times that.","She screamed and grabbed Sun Jingyu’s hand. “Jingyu, what’s going on? Help me! Do something!”","Sun Jingyu was dumbfounded.","She had used the potion so that the White Lion Elephants would attack Feng Wu. Why was this happening?","She wanted to run.","But where could she run to?","She couldn’t get away.","They were both surrounded by White Lion Elephants.","They had no choice but to fight.","But there were so many of them...","Sun Jingyu was filled with despair.","Thump!","A White Lion Elephant threw its trunk around Sun Jingyu’s waist and tossed her into the air.","Sun Jingyu rose and fell.","She managed to flip around in mid-air, and landed on the back of a White Lion Elephant.","She wrapped her arms around it. No matter how violently it struggled, she wouldn’t let go.","Mu Qianqian copied her move. She jumped onto a White Lion Elephant and wouldn’t let go of its head either.","She shouted at Chaoge. “Kill them now!”","Chaoge glanced at her. “Didn’t you say that I was cheating? You can have it all to yourself now.”","Mu Qianqian was almost in tears.","She had no choice but to beg Chaoge. “I shouldn’t have said that. Help us now! Jingyu will owe you a favor, and that doesn’t happen every day!”","How condescending.","Chaoge shrugged. “Why do you think we need it?”","She yawned as she spoke. “I’ve killed ten White Lion Elephants. I’m tired. I need to take a break.”","She then lay down on a big rock to take a nap.","Mu Qianqian was flustered. “Duan Chaoge, I’m begging you! Do something! Kill these beasts! I don’t want any crystal cores! You can have them all! Help!”","Things were getting out of hand.","Mu Qianqian and Sun Jingyu could be killed at any moment.","Sun Jingyu held a black object in her hand and hesitated.","It was an explosive ball that had cost her several hundred points. She had been saving it until now."]},{"number":2550,"title":"Chapter 2550 - More Action (4)","paragraphs":["She couldn’t delay any longer.","“Mu Qianqian, jump!”","Sun Jingyu gave the final warning.","Thump!","She then threw the ball at the beasts.","Boom!","All the White Lion Elephants were injured.","The more severely injured ones fell to the ground and screeched, and those with minor injuries angrily chased Sun Jingyu and Mu Qianqian.","Chaoge had to be a fool to miss such a great opportunity.","She told Zi Ling, “Get the crystal cores!”","Zi Ling finally knew what to do. “I’m coming!”","But she was kind enough to ask, “What about Jingyu...”","Chaoge snapped, “They’ve lured quite a few White Lion Elephants away. The two of us would never be able to handle all of the beasts at once. If I’m right, they’ll circle back soon. Do it now!”","Zi Ling didn’t believe that Sun Jingyu would bring the White Lion Elephants back here.","Updates by","But she couldn’t waste such a great chance.","Fifteen White Lion Elephants were lying on the ground.","Ten of them had been at the center of the explosion and had the most injuries. They were grumbling on the ground and couldn’t get up.","Chaoge raised her Fire Dragon Rod and killed each beast with a single blow to the head.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Zi Ling followed her and picked up the crystal cores.","They finished off all 15 injured White Lion Elephants in less than a minute.","Meanwhile, Sun Jingyu and Mu Qianqian were still running.","Ten beasts were chasing Sun Jingyu, and five were chasing Mu Qianqian.","These beasts were injured as well, but they had been further away from the explosion, and their wounds were all superficial.","Mu Qianqian ran very fast.","She was also injured. Normally, she would be crying and want to give up, but with her life on the line, she ran as fast as she could.","She had lost one shoe, but that didn’t slow her down.","However, she was getting tired, and the beasts were almost on her.","She knew that she couldn’t go on like this. If she didn’t do something, she would die.","She decided that she had to lure these White Lion Elephants back to where they came from and let Duan Chaoge kill them.","She took a U-turn and ran in the direction she had come from.","Chaoge was casually picking up the crystal cores when Mu Qianqian arrived.","Damn it!","Mu Qianqian thought, “The White Lion Elephants should be charging at Duan Chaoge and Feng Wu, but Sun Jingyu and I were surrounded instead. Not only that, Duan Chaoge also collected all the crystal cores! Sun Jingyu spent so many points on that explosive ball!”","That was so frustrating!","But she couldn’t lash out at Duan Chaoge. She still needed her help.","She ran to Duan Chaoge’s side and cried, “Chaoge, help me! I’m sorry! I shouldn’t have done all those things! Please help me! We’re on the same team...”","Zi Ling frowned at Mu Qianqian.","Because Mu Qianqian hung out with Sun Jingyu, she was very picky about whom she befriended.","She had always been arrogant toward all her classmates in Class E; Zi Ling had never seen her so flustered."]},{"number":2551,"title":"Chapter 2551 - Please (1)","paragraphs":["“Chaoge...” Zi Ling spoke in a pleading tone.","Chaoge smirked. “No, I’m not helping her. I’ll kill the White Lion Elephants when she’s dead.”","Zi Ling said, “But a team’s points will be canceled if a team member dies. The points will go to the next team on the rankings.”","“What? Why?!” Chaoge couldn’t believe it.","“To protect the students, I guess?” Zi Ling didn’t know the answer either, but rules were rules.","“Fine.” Chaoge rolled her eyes at Mu Qianqian. “Let the White Lion Elephants chase you, and I’ll kill them.”","Mu Qianqian was exhausted. She wanted to lie down, but she knew that if she did so, Chaoge would let the White Lion Elephants trample her.","She let the White Lion Elephants chase her until Chaoge killed them all.","She was so tired that she passed out as soon as she lay on the ground.","Meanwhile, Sun Jingyu was also being chased by White Lion Elephants. There were ten beasts in total.","She couldn’t outrun them forever.","And she wasn’t capable enough to fight them.","She couldn’t run for much longer.","She couldn’t understand why she had to run away after using the explosive ball.","They were on the same team, but Feng Wu could sit there and cultivate as if she wasn’t affected at all.","Sun Jingyu wouldn’t let that happen.","At that thought, she also did a U-turn.","She decided that if she had to die, she would bring Feng Wu down with her.","When she returned, she was surprised to find all the White Lion Elephants dead on the ground.","All their heads had been smashed in, and the crystal cores had been gouged out.","It had to be Duan Chaoge’s doing.","Sun Jingyu was so frustrated.","Why did this even happen?!","She glared at Chaoge. “Come here and help me!”","Chaoge was sitting on a big rock with her legs crossed. She was chewing on a blade of grass and looked quite at ease.","She only glanced at Sun Jingyu when she heard her. Then, she began to hum a tune.","Sun Jingyu was furious.","She bellowed at Chaoge, “Duan Chaoge, I’m ordering you as the president of Class E! Get down here and help me!”","Chaoge ignored her.","She even turned around and pretended not to see Sun Jingyu.","Sun Jingyu couldn’t believe it.","She looked over her shoulder as she ran.","Why wouldn’t the beasts go after the others? She wasn’t the only human here.","For some reason, she felt that the White Lion Elephants hated her even more.","“Mu Qianqian, help me!” she shouted.","Mu Qianqian had woken up already.","But when she heard Sun Jingyu, she pretended that she was still unconscious.","Sun Jingyu was speechless.","She could tell that the girl was awake.","Her eyeballs were moving behind her eyelids!","“Mu Qianqian, you’ll pay for this!” Sun Jingyu thought resentfully.","She tried to figure out a way to escape."]},{"number":2552,"title":"Chapter 2552 - Please (2)","paragraphs":["She tried her best to lure the White Lion Elephants toward Feng Wu, but to no avail.","The White Lion Elephants wouldn’t go anywhere near Feng Wu.","That was so strange!","Roarrr!","The White Lion Elephants roared and charged at Sun Jingyu.","Her patron had paid her generously, but she valued her life even more.","She decided that she could humiliate Feng Wu after she killed all the White Lion Elephants on her own.","At that thought, she took out the last explosive ball and threw it at the White Lion Elephants.","It exploded right away.","Boom!?","Over half a dozen White Lion Elephants were severely injured and fell to the ground. Only two were still standing.","Both of them chased Sun Jingyu.","She was confident that she could kill two White Lion Elephants.","While Sun Jingyu was fighting the two beasts, Chaoge jumped into the air.","The next second, she landed next to the severely injured White Lion Elephants and killed them all. She then dug out all the crystal cores.","As a result, Sun Jingyu had used up her expensive explosive balls and only obtained two crystal cores in the end. She was furious when she saw what Chaoge was doing.","“What are you doing?!” she shouted at her.","“I’m helping you. Didn’t you just ask me for help?” Chaoge said innocently.","Sun Jingyu didn’t know what to say.","She did do that, but that was before she used the explosive balls. She didn’t need any help now!","Chaoge said, “I killed all those White Lion Elephants for you. Shouldn’t you be thanking me?”","Sun Jingyu said, “Give me the crystal cores!”","Chaoge said, “You’re not only scolding me, but you’re also trying to rob my crystal cores!”","Sun Jingyu thought she was going to explode.","She gave Chaoge a stern look before she looked at Feng Wu. Filled with rage, she shouted at Feng Wu.","“What’s the matter with you? You’ve been sitting there since we arrived! Who could do such a thing? That’s out of line!”","Chaoge frowned. She could stand it when Sun Jingyu yelled at her, but she wouldn’t let anyone talk to Xiao Wu that way.","Sun Jingyu lashed out at Feng Wu. “Do you really think you’re a bigshot? You’re just sitting there while the White Lion Elephants chase us around! Are you going to depend on Duan Chaoge like that from now on? She’s not good enough to protect you!”","Feng Wu was at a critical moment in her cultivation and had closed all her senses to the outside world.","Chaoge was angry.","She shoved Sun Jingyu. “What’s that supposed to mean? Xiao Wu doesn’t depend on anyone!”","Sun Jingyu just smirked.","She didn’t think that Feng Wu would be a problem, but she wasn’t sure if she could handle Chaoge because the girl was getting stronger as the hunt continued.","“Jingyu, you’re amazing!”","Seeing that Sun Jingyu was safe, Mu Qianqian rose to her feet and ran to her side.","Sun Jingyu didn’t respond.","Mu Qianqian went on, “You’re the best member in our team! If it hadn’t been for you, the 30 White Lion Elephants would charge us all at once, and we would all be killed!”","She then held Sun Jingyu’s arm and smiled obsequiously. “Thank you for saving my life.”","Sun Jingyu rolled her eyes at Mu Qianqian but accepted the flattery."]},{"number":2553,"title":"Chapter 2553 - Feng Wu Is So Capable","paragraphs":["?","Seeing that Sun Jingyu liked those words, Mu Qianqian was relieved.","She still had to rely on Sun Jingyu in Class E and couldn’t afford to offend her.","Sun Jingyu looked arrogantly at Feng Wu. There was contempt in her eyes.","She actually thinks that she’s cultivating. How ridiculous!","Mu Qianqian also gave Feng Wu an arrogant glance.","She murmured, “Chaoge has some skills, but Feng Wu is completely useless. She’s been sitting there since we got here and hasn’t lifted a finger.”","Sun Jingyu’s face darkened.","Was she going to let Feng Wu go?","Of course not!","She gave Mu Qianqian a warning look. Mu Qianqian was scared, but she didn’t dare defy Sun Jingyu, and gave her a nod.","Mu Qianqian walked away, and Sun Jingyu gave Feng Wu a taunting look.","She had used all her cards. If she still couldn’t kill Feng Wu, there was nothing she could do.","Before long, there was a rumbling noise.","The ground shook.","Chaoge frowned. “What’s that noise?”","Sun Jingyu knew the answer.","She had asked Mu Qianqian to lure all the White Lion Elephants toward them.","The entire pack.","Sun Jingyu had used up her points to buy a potion that could drive the White Lion Elephants into a frenzied state.","How many White Lion Elephants were there?","100?","200?","No, there were at least 1,000 of them!","The sound was so loud and it made one tremble!","Gosh!","That was crazy!","Sun Jingyu beamed at Feng Wu.","She had poured a bottle of adhesive down the slope when she had mocked Feng Wu.","By now, it should have reached where Feng Wu was sitting and stuck her to the rock.","Sun Jingyu wanted to laugh.","She couldn’t wait to see how Feng Wu was going to fight all the White Lion Elephants.","She then ran in the other direction.","Chaoge noticed her abnormal behavior. “Why are you running? Stop!”","She ran after her.","Sun Jingyu was the president of Class E and was at least as capable as Chaoge.","Therefore, Chaoge couldn’t catch up with Sun Jingyu.","“Damn it!” Chaoge was frustrated. “I’ll settle the score with you when we get back!”","But she chuckled.","Sun Jingyu had thought that she could get away, but White Lion Elephants were coming her way as well.","She almost ran into one of them.","“Shit!” Sun Jingyu was a little flustered, but she reacted in time and turned around to run in a different direction.","But she only managed to take a few steps.","Chaoge didn’t know if she should laugh or cry.","She wanted to laugh because Sun Jingyu’s way was blocked by White Lion Elephants again.","She wanted to cry because White Lion Elephants were coming at them in all directions.","Sun Jingyu screamed.","How could this have happened?!","Why was she surrounded by White Lion Elephants?","Was it Mu Qianqian’s doing?","Sun Jingyu couldn’t think straight anymore. She didn’t know who had set her up, and was on the verge of having a nervous breakdown.","She couldn’t handle ten White Lion Elephants, let alone 1,000 of them.","1,000!","“I’m going to die...”","Sun Jingyu cried and regretted her decision."]},{"number":2554,"title":"Chapter 2554 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Why did she accept this mission?","She was going to get herself killed!","Sun Jingyu had never regretted her decision so much.","“Help!”","She panicked and started running around.","But she had nowhere to go.","White Lion Elephants ran toward her like an unstoppable tidal wave.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Sun Jingyu was surrounded and severely injured.","She couldn’t last past three seconds.","Thump!","She was knocked away and fell to the ground,","Chaoge and Zi Ling weren’t doing much better.","They kept falling back and couldn’t hold on much longer.","Feng Wu finally opened her eyes.","She sensed that she had completed 5% of her breakthrough.","She didn’t know if other people could feel it, but she could. It was a strange feeling.","Feng Wu moved.","“Fallen Star Swordplay!”","She activated the Fallen Star Swordplay and struck down.","Her energy poured out like a wall of waves.","Whoosh!","The White Lion Elephant’s heads were severed from their bodies when they made contact with the energy.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","The heads fell to the ground.","Gosh!","Chaoge wasn’t surprised by the scene.","Because Zi Ling had seen how Feng Wu had defeated Ye Han, she wasn’t shocked either.","Sun Jingyu was the astonished one.","She was dumbfounded.","One, two, three...","Ten, twenty, thirty...","The energy spread out from Feng Wu at the center.","All White Lion Elephants within reach had their heads chopped off.","Holy crap!","Sun Jingyu looked at Feng Wu and felt as if she had been slapped.","It hurt...","But she grew excited.","She was going to live!","She wasn’t going to die!","Seeing that Chaoge and Zi Ling were running toward Feng Wu, Sun Jingyu followed suit. She ran toward Feng Wu as well.","She didn’t care about her dignity. She wanted to live.","Chaoge frowned at Sun Jingyu. “Didn’t you just call Xiao Wu useless? Why are you running to her side?”","Sun Jingyu ignored her and stood close to Feng Wu.","Chaoge said, “You’re shameless!”","Sun Jingyu still wouldn’t reply.","The White Lion Elephants were shocked by Feng Wu’s first strike.","Seeing that Feng Wu didn’t move, they charged at her again.","Boom!?","Although Feng Wu had killed dozens of White Lion Elephants, there were still a lot of them left.","It was a terrifying scene.","Sun Jingyu said in a shaky voice, “We should run!","“We can’t fight a thousand White Lion Elephants!","“We should retreat while Feng Wu still has strength left. That way, we may survive this!”","Sun Jingyu spoke anxiously to Feng Wu.","Zi Ling was anxious as well.","There were so many White Lion Elephants...","Normally, she would have to work with a teammate just to kill one of them..."]},{"number":2555,"title":"Chapter 2555 - Feng Wu the God (1)","paragraphs":["Both Sun Jingyu and Zi Ling gave Feng Wu pleading looks, but Feng Wu only looked straight ahead.","The White Lion Elephants were rushing toward them.","Sun Jingyu and Zi Ling turned pale.","Feng Wu struck out.","“Fallen Star Swordplay, second stance!”","This time, she released even more energy.","Whoosh!","It spread out over 300 meters.","This strike was three times more powerful than the first one.","More White Lion Elephant heads fell to the ground.","“Oh my god!” Sun Jingyu was astonished.","Because it was such a terrifying scene.","Feng Wu had killed dozens of White Lion Elephants with one strike earlier, which was beyond Sun Jingyu’s imagination.","Had she just killed 100 beasts with one strike?","Updates by","Sun Jingyu did a count.","Feng Wu had killed 123 White Lion Elephants with this strike!","Sun Jingyu wanted to kneel on the ground.","She turned around and looked at Feng Wu in disbelief.","She couldn’t believe that she had tried to kill Feng Wu. She wanted to dig a hole in the ground and hide inside.","That was such incredible power.","What on earth was Feng Wu’s cultivation level?","The blow was so hard that Sun Jingyu didn’t want to speak.","She wondered why she had turned Feng Wu into her enemy. She didn’t have a death wish.","She took a few deep breaths to force herself to calm down.","The White Lion Elephants were dumbfounded as well.","Human teenagers came here to fight them all the time, but they had never been defeated like this, so the White Lion Elephants continued to live in this area.","But this human girl was so terrifying!","They decided that it was time to run.","All the White Lion Elephants switched directions.","“You’re my points! Where do you think you’re going?”","Chaoge wouldn’t let them run.","“With Gu Xingyuan in this competition, we may not be the top team.” Chaoge sounded concerned.","Feng Wu nodded and struck out again.","“Ground Control!”","With that, the running White Lion Elephants were all frozen on the spot.","“Fallen Star Swordplay, third stance!”","The sword shot up into the air and turned into a dragon.","Roar!","The dragon’s roar resonated in the air.","Whoosh!","Nearly a thousand White Lion Elephants were still standing.","But they were all frozen on the spot when the dragon appeared.","Whoosh!","Heads fell on the ground and exploded one after another.","Sun Jingyu couldn’t see anything but sparks.","She was so shocked that she swayed and almost passed out.","She was filled with fear and reverence.","She knew she had underestimated Feng Wu, but she didn’t know that Feng Wu could be so incredibly powerful.","How talented was she?!","She was probably good enough to graduate and even become a teacher in the academy, but she joined Class E instead.","Not only that, she also concealed her true power.","Moreover, she didn’t react when other people provoked her.","Sun Jingyu buried her face in her hands when she recalled what she had said to Feng Wu before, as well as her pathetic attempt to assassinate her.","“Feng Wu, I...” Sun Jingyu didn’t know what to say."]},{"number":2556,"title":"Chapter 2556 - Feng Wu the God (2)","paragraphs":["“Feng Wu, I...” Sun Jingyu was so ashamed that she blushed and stuttered.","Feng Wu only glanced at her.","She didn’t care about Sun Jingyu’s attitude toward her.","Chaoge was the smart one. She called for Zi Ling when she saw all the dead White Lion Elephants. “Come here and help me collect the crystal cores!”","Zi Ling was also dumbfounded.","She stared at Feng Wu and forgot how to blink.","She had thought that Feng Wu wouldn’t be much more powerful than Ye Han, but reality had slapped her in the face.","Not much more powerful than Ye Han?","Feng Wu was even better than students of Class A!","“Zi Ling!”","Chaoge called for Zi Ling again while the latter was still feeling dazed.","“Right! Sure!” Only then did Zi Ling rush to her side to help her with the crystal cores.","Picking them up was all she needed to do.","Just pick them off the ground.","Before, Zi Ling and her teammates had to risk their lives to kill one White Lion Elephant, but now, she could just pick up the crystal cores.","She was both excited and bewildered.","Sun Jingyu was a little embarrassed. Seeing that Feng Wu wouldn’t talk to her, she said, “I’ll help them.”","There were crystal cores all over the ground.","They almost didn’t have enough time to pick up all of them.","Comparisons could be so odious.","Wait.","Feng Wu raised her eyebrows. She felt that she could obtain energy from the crystal cores.","She held one in her hand, and the crystal core crumbled after its energy was drained.","She could sense that the energy in her dantian had increased a little.","It wasn’t enough to raise the percentage to 6%, but it was an increase.","Feng Wu looked at the others. “Can the crystal cores be used directly for cultivation?”","She directed the question at Sun Jingyu.","Being the class president, she obviously knew better than the other students.","Sun Jingyu shook her head. “No, they can’t. We can only use the crystal cores after the academy takes them away and refines them in a special way. The potions created can be used for cultivation.”","Really? Feng Wu was bewildered because she could use them directly.","What she didn’t know was that such a thing could only be done by people who had the phoenix bloodline.","They put all the crystal cores in a bag and brought them to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked Sun Jingyu, “Usually, how many crystal cores do you need to be first?”","Sun Jingyu was the class president and had participated in events like these many times.","“100 should have been enough,” said Sun Jingyu, “but Gu Xingyuan is here now, and to be honest, I assumed that he would be first. I see now that it’ll be you.”","Feng Wu nodded and only said, “Let’s go back.”","They walked in the direction they had come from.","Sun Jingyu had led the team on their way here. She had been so confident that she would be the top student in Class E.","But now, she stayed an arm’s length behind Feng Wu and didn’t dare say a word.","She even walked behind Chaoge and next to Zi Ling.","For them, the event was over, but for the other students...","It had probably ended for them as well; it was just that they didn’t know it yet.","Mu Qianqian found a team after she ran away to get help.","It was Gu Xingyuan’s team."]},{"number":2557,"title":"Chapter 2557 - Was Feng Wu Second?","paragraphs":["Gu Xingyuan’s team had some very capable members.","The team leader was Pei Si, one of the top students of Class E and Sun Jingyu’s top rival.","Chu Junying went everywhere with Gu Xingyuan, so of course, she was in the team.","The other one was Pei Si’s friend.","Those were the five members of Team 2.","Mu Qianqian ran into them, and Pei Si killed the two White Lion Elephants chasing her without difficulty.","“Mu Qianqian?” Pei Si stopped her. “Why are you here? Where’s your team?”","Mu Qianqian counted the dead White Lion Elephants on the ground and saw that there were a few dozen.","She then saw the sack hanging on Pei Si’s belt, and felt her heart sink. There were at least a couple of hundred of crystal cores in it.","“Where’s Sun Jingyu? Why isn’t she with you? Where’s your team?” Pei Si asked.","“There were so many White Lion Elephants! I barely managed to get away! I need to find a teacher! We need help!” Mu Qianqian pointed in the direction she had come from.","Pei Si frowned. “What happened?”","Mu Qianqian panicked. She couldn’t afford the consequences if all four teammates died, especially if Sun Jingyu was one of them, since the latter’s family was both rich and influential.","At that thought, she burst into tears.","“I saw many White Lion Elephants, and everyone panicked, so I ran. I ran as fast as I could.”","Pei Si’s eyes widened a little. “Many White Lion Elephants? Did your teammates get away?”","Sun Jingyu was her rival who had the most capability.","“I don’t know. I think they did. It was so chaotic that we couldn’t care about anyone else.”","Mu Qianqian tried her best to make herself sound innocent.","Gu Xingyuan wasn’t interested.","Pei Si suddenly asked, “If I remember correctly, there’s a new student in your team, right?”","Mu Qianqian was frustrated at the thought of Feng Wu.","“Yes! We have two, actually. One is Feng Wu and the other is Duan Chaoge. I don’t know where to begin... Wait!” Mu Qianqian suddenly came up with an idea to shift the blame. “It was Feng Wu! She overestimated herself and lured in too many White Lion Elephants! She’s to be blamed if anything happens to Jingyu!”","Feng Wu?","Gu Xingyuan was intrigued.","The Gu family held a grudge against Feng Wu, and he wanted her dead.","“Is Feng Wu dead?” Gu Xingyuan stared at Mu Qianqian.","Mu Qianqian said, “I don’t know. I don’t know what happened after I left. I need to find Mr. Luo, our assistant tutor.”","Several tutors were patrolling the outer region of the forest to keep the students safe.","Mr. Luo arrived at that moment.","Mu Qianqian was thrilled. She ran to his side and complained about Feng Wu.","She said that Feng Wu was an ignorant new student who had lured in too many White Lion Elephants. Sun Jingyu, their class president, might have been killed for it.","Dead?!","The news soon spread.","Another team was with Mr. Luo.","It was the one that Lu Xiao and Zhen Ya were in.","Zhen Ya had always held a grudge against Zi Ling and had been paying special attention to her after the latter paired up with Sun Jingyu."]},{"number":2558,"title":"Chapter 2558 - Feng Wu’s Fault","paragraphs":["Before Zhen Ya could ask anything, Mr. Luo set out to look for the team.","Pei Si felt that with the tutor here, they would be safe.","“I don’t know why, but there are much fewer White Lion Elephants now. Shall we look around?”","Pei Si looked at Gu Xingyuan.","Gu Xingyuan nodded and marched out.","Pei Si was the team leader, but Gu Xingyuan was a Level 6 Spiritual Lord. After he demonstrated his ability, he became the key member of the team.","After Pei Si’s team followed Mr. Luo, Lu Xiao wanted to leave with them as well.","Zhen Ya didn’t want to go and kept tugging at him.","Lu Xiao said coldly, “You can’t stop me. I have to go!”","He quickly followed the others.","“It’s because of Zi Ling, isn’t it? You like her!” Zhen Ya had tears in her eyes.","Lu Xiao ignored her.","Zhen Ya was frustrated, but she was worried that something would happen between Lu Xiao and Zi Ling, so she stomped her foot and followed him.","She knew that a man would always be soft-hearted toward an injured woman.","She had used a lot of tricks to win Lu Xiao’s heart, and she wasn’t going to let Zi Ling win him back.","Mr. Luo was surprised when he saw Sun Jingyu.","Because all four girls looked completely fine.","There wasn’t a scratch on them, and even their faces were clean.","He asked Sun Jingyu, “Are you alright?”","Sun Jingyu was perplexed. “Yes, we’re fine. Sir, why are you here?”","Mu Qianqian arrived at that moment, and she couldn’t believe her eyes when she saw that Sun Jingyu was still alive.","Feng Wu and the others were alive as well, and none of them seemed injured.","Mu Qianqian said, “Didn’t the White Lion Elephants surround you? How...”","Pei Si and her team were surprised to see them as well.","She said, “You’re not dead!”","Sun Jingyu smirked. “Does that disappoint you?”","Pei Si chuckled awkwardly. “Jingyu, of course not. We’re not that sort of people.”","Sun Jingyu smirked and thought, “Who are you trying to fool?”","She then turned to Mr. Luo. “We ran into some White Lion Elephants, but we’re no longer in danger. Please don’t worry.”","Pei Si asked Mu Qianqian, “Didn’t you say...”","Mu Qianqian realized what she was asking.","She ran to Sun Jingyu’s side and said loudly, “Jingyu, it was Feng Wu’s fault! She lured in all the White Lion Elephants! Otherwise, you wouldn’t have been in danger!”","Sun Jingyu wanted to roll her eyes.","Mu Qianqian didn’t know what she was thinking, and even winked at her.","Chu Junying jumped at the opportunity. “Did you say that Feng Wu lured in too many White Lion Elephants?”","Mu Qianqian said, “Yes! There were so many of them! If it wasn’t for her, we would never have...”","Sun Jingyu glared at her. “Shut up!”","Mu Qianqian knew perfectly well who had lured in the White Lion Elephants, but she still tried to blame it on Feng Wu.","She had no idea how capable Feng Wu was.","Sun Jingyu recalled how Feng Wu had killed so many White Lion Elephants with a single strike..."]},{"number":2559,"title":"Chapter 2559 - Terrifying Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Sun Jingyu gave Mu Qianqian a stern look.","Mu Qianqian was confused.","She knew that Sun Jingyu wanted to kill Feng Wu, and now was a great opportunity. Why was Sun Jingyu giving her that look?","Mu Qianqian couldn’t figure it out.","Chu Junying still tried to circle back to Feng Wu, so she said, “I’m sure Jingyu turned things around and saved you all from the White Lion Elephants. That’s the good thing about teaming up with the class president. Feng Wu, you’re so lucky.”","All the other new students gave Feng Wu envious looks.","Sun Jingyu wanted to explain, but she knew doing so might reveal some secrets, so she glanced at Feng Wu.","Seeing that Feng Wu wasn’t going to explain, Sun Jingyu remained silent as well.","The others took her attitude for tacit acknowledgement.","Mr. Luo said, “If everything’s fine, let’s get back to the hunt.”","He walked away after that.","Pei Si smiled at Sun Jingyu. “Jingyu, I have an idea. Would you like to hear it?”","Sun Jingyu didn’t like Pei Si, but she had to show her some respect while everyone was watching, so she said indifferently, “Go ahead.”","Pei Si said, “Since we have three teams here, why don’t we form an alliance and hunt a pack of White Lion Elephants together?”","A pack? Sun Jingyu found the suggestion idiotic. She wondered how Pei Si would react if she knew that Feng Wu had killed the entire herd. She smiled inwardly.","However, she pretended that she didn’t know anything. “A pack? Well...”","Pei Si said, “Didn’t you run into a pack earlier? All we need to do is lure them here. I’m sure our three teams will be more than enough to handle a dozen beasts.”","“A dozen, you say?” Sun Jingyu asked deliberately.","Pei Si said, “If you think that’s too much, we can do fewer than ten, just to be safe.”","Sun Jingyu smiled at her.","Pei Si asked, “Do you have a different opinion?”","Sun Jingyu said, “My opinion has nothing to do with it. It’s just...” She wanted to say that Feng Wu had destroyed the White Lion Elephants’ habitat, and there were no beasts left in the outer ring of the forest.","But she knew that the tutors would be furious if she said that.","The White Lion Elephants were there to help the students train their fighting skills, and the academy had invested in resources for raising them, but now...","Pei Si looked around and asked, “Have you noticed something?”","Chu Junying asked, “What is it?”","Pei Si said, “Why do I feel that the White Lion Elephants have disappeared? Usually, we should see individual beasts along the road, but I haven’t seen a single one of them since we arrived.”","Sun Jingyu glanced at Pei Si with a sense of superiority.","Chun Junying said, “We didn’t find many White Lion Elephants either. Did we kill them all?”","“Don’t be ridiculous.” Pei Si didn’t agree. “There are thousands of them, and they multiply very fast. We can kill as many of them as we want, and there will always be more.”","Just then, they heard someone cry out.","It was Mingjie, Pei Si’s friend.","Mingjie shouted, “Guys, come here!”","Pei Si frowned. “Let’s have a look.”","She led her team to Mingjie."]},{"number":2560,"title":"Chapter 2560 - Who Did It?","paragraphs":["Lu Xiao kept his gaze on Zi Ling.","His reaction made Zhen Ya nervous. She tugged at him and said, “Let’s go have a look!”","Lu Xiao was noticeably reluctant to do so because he wanted to stay with Zi Ling and see if she had been hurt.","Zi Ling glanced at him and turned to Feng Wu. “Let’s go back.”","Feng Wu could see that something was going on between Zi Ling and Lu Xiao.","She could also see that something was going on between him and Zhen Ya.","But since Zi Ling wanted to leave...","Pei Si came over before Feng Wu could say anything and told them, “You better come with me. Mr. Luo wants to see you.”","Feng Wu knew that they had found out about the White Lion Elephants.","To save herself from future trouble, she knew she had to offer an explanation, so she nodded and followed Pei Si.","Her team followed her.","Despite her conflicted feelings, Sun Jingyu followed her.","Mr. Luo’s face was livid, and the students couldn’t believe their eyes.","Sun Jingyu knew what had happened, but Feng Wu had told her to keep it to herself, so she pretended that she didn’t know anything.","Pei Si asked her, “Jingyu, what happened?”","Sun Jingyu gave her a strange look. “What do you mean? You don’t think that I killed all those White Lion Elephants, do you?”","Pei Si rolled her eyes at her. “Dream on!”","Mr. Luo said, “There are over a thousand White Lion Elephants here, and their heads have all exploded. Even I couldn’t do it, let alone you.”","Sun Jingyu asked, “Mr. Luo, even you couldn’t do it?”","Mr. Luo nodded. “I don’t think even Mr. Zhu could do it.”","Class E had one chief tutor and numerous assistant tutors.","Mr. Zhu was the chief tutor, and Mr. Luo was one of the assistants.","Sun Jingyu couldn’t help but glance at Feng Wu.","She thought very highly of Feng Wu now, but as it turned out, she still had no idea of her full potential.","By the sound of it, she was even more capable than the chief tutor.","Sun Jingyu wondered if Chief Qingluan, who had been hostile toward Feng Wu since day one, knew Feng Wu’s real ability.","“Jingyu? Jingyu!” Mu Qianqian tugged at Sun Jingyu’s sleeve and woke her up from her reverie.","“Mr. Luo is talking to you!” she whispered.","She wondered what Sun Jingyu was thinking.","Sun Jingyu looked at Mr. Luo in bewilderment.","He had just asked her if she knew what happened.","Not only did she know, she had also experienced it for herself. However, Feng Wu wouldn’t let her talk about it.","Sun Jingyu could only smile bitterly. “I was too busy running for my life to notice anything else. Maybe you could ask Feng Wu.” That was the person that could give the final answer.","Mr. Luo narrowed his eyes.","He could have asked Feng Wu, but he didn’t.","In fact, he hadn’t glanced at Feng Wu since he arrived.","He had deliberately ignored her.","Therefore, he waved Sun Jingyu off. “I’m sure some tutor saw that you were in danger, so they gave you a hand and walked off after that.”","Sun Jingyu remembered the rumor about the academy deliberately raising White Lion Elephants."]},{"number":2561,"title":"Chapter 2561 - Feng Wu’s Fault (1)","paragraphs":["Sun Jingyu thought, “Didn’t the academy raise the White Lion Elephants so that the students could use them to train their fighting skills? Why would a tutor kill them all? That doesn’t make sense.”","But since Mr. Luo had said so, the others believed him.","Pei Si said to Sun Jingyu, “Be grateful to that tutor, or all of you would have been in great trouble.”","Sun Jingyu was speechless.","Gu Xingyuan glanced at Feng Wu.","He had his doubts and wondered if Feng Wu had killed the beasts. However, there were over a thousand of them, so he decided that it couldn’t have been her. She wasn’t powerful enough.","Pei Si sounded sorry when she said, “The White Lion Elephants have been wiped out, so the event has to end here. By the way, how many crystal cores do you have?”","She looked curiously at Sun Jingyu.","Sun Jingyu glanced at her. “How many do you have?”","Pei Si chuckled. “We’ve collected 150 already. How about you?”","Sun Jingyu shrugged. “I’m not in charge of the crystal cores.” By that, she meant that she had no idea how many crystal cores Feng Wu had collected.","Pei Si thought that Sun Jingyu was being pretentious and became displeased.","She looked at the dead White Lion Elephants.","If the mysterious tutor killed them, the crystal cores should still be there.","Excited, she ran to the beasts to check their heads.","However, the crystal cores were all gone.","“Where are the crystal cores?” She stared at Sun Jingyu.","Chaoge said mockingly, “Where do you think?”","Pei Si asked, “You didn’t take them all, did you?”","Chaoge crossed her arms. “It’s none of your business.”","Pei Si was furious and said sarcastically, “You’re just a new student, so behave like one. Jingyu, aren’t you going to do something about it?”","Do something about it? Sun Jingyu thought, “I’m the second weakest person in this team. Who am I to discipline Duan Chaoge? She’ll probably discipline me first.”","In the end, they went back to the academy because there were no more White Lion Elephants around.","Everyone was talking about it when they got back.","This was the first time that students had to come back early because they didn’t have anything to hunt.","The students of Class E were avidly discussing it in the square.","“I heard that some mysterious tutor gave them a hand and killed all the White Lion Elephants.”","“You mean Jingyu’s team? They’re all experienced students. Why would they be in such danger?”","“Jingyu and Mu Qianqian wouldn’t have put themselves in danger, but have you forgotten who else is in that team?”","“Do you mean Feng Wu? The one that Chief Qingluan tried to pick?”","“That’s right! She’s useless, but she’s so arrogant. Someone like that is bound to create trouble!”","“According to Mu Qianqian, Feng Wu was the one who lured in the White Lion Elephants.”","“Feng Wu is so pretty, and I almost became her fan. I didn’t know she was that type of person!”","“If it wasn’t for her, the mission wouldn’t have ended earlier than expected!”","“That’s right! I was going to make great use of this opportunity. I even bought some potions for this event. Now that has all gone to waste!”","...","Many students of Class E held a grudge.","They needed an outlet, and Feng Wu became their target."]},{"number":2562,"title":"Chapter 2562 - Feng Wu’s Fault (2)","paragraphs":["Sun Jingyu didn’t know what to say when she heard all the discussion.","How idiotic were they?","Did they really believe that Feng Wu was useless and that she had lured in the White Lion Elephants?","If they knew that Feng Wu had killed a thousand White Lion Elephants with one strike, they would be shivering inside out, just like her.","However, Sun Jingyu felt excited at the same time because she was the only one who knew how capable Feng Wu was. Her classmates were all idiots!","Chaoge nearly lost control, but the thought of Feng Wu calmed her down.","She looked around and remembered every person who said bad things about Feng Wu.","Mr. Luo arrived shortly after that.","He had asked around, but no tutor in the academy acknowledged that they had done such a thing, which perplexed him. However, he stuck to his conclusion when he talked to the students.","A tutor did it.","After that, the students were ranked by performance and were rewarded with points.","All they needed to do was hand in the crystal cores.","As for the best member in each team...","Every student’s armband was scanned, and the system would decide who the best team member was. Even the tutors didn’t have access to the data.","The rankings of the teams were announced in reverse order.","The 300th team was awarded first, and the 1st team last.","Feng Wu was in Team 1.","Gu Xingyuan was in Team 2.","Zhen Ya and Lu Xiao’s team was Team 50.","The team leader handed in their crystal cores, and the rankings were displayed on the big screen.","Whoosh –","The 1st team was Team 1, and the team leader was Sun Jingyu.","The 2nd team was Team 2, and the team leader was Pei Si.","...","The 100th team was Team 50, and the team leader was Lu Xiao.","...","The students were shocked. “Team 1 is the top team! Weren’t they in grave danger? How did they earn so many points?!”","“Jingyu is amazing! She and Mu Qianqian made that possible despite having three unhelpful teammates!”","“You don’t say! They would never have earned so many points if they didn’t have Jingyu with them! I wish I had her in my team!”","“I heard that they were very lucky. The tutor left without taking the crystal cores, so they picked up everything.”","“Gosh! How can anyone be so lucky? I’m so envious!”","“I thought Pei Si’s team would be the best one. After all, they have Pei Si, the second-best student in our class, and there’s Gu Xingyuan as well. I heard that he’s already a Level 6 Spiritual Lord!”","“Seriously? Most of the students in our class are Level 3 Spiritual Lords.”","“That’s so impressive. I think he’ll be the next top student in our class.”","...","They were still discussing the possibilities, when the names of the best team members were displayed next to their teams.","“Team 1: Feng Wu.”","The students were all dumbfounded.","“Feng Wu? How’s that possible? How can it be her?!”","“Why isn’t it Sun Jingyu?”","“Didn’t you say that Jingyu and Mu Qianqian saved the team together? Why is Feng Wu the best team member?”"]},{"number":2563,"title":"Chapter 2563 - Black Crow","paragraphs":["“That’s right. Didn’t Feng Wu put the team in danger? I thought she was useless. Why is she the best teammate?”","Wasn’t that self-contradictory?","The others looked at one another and were confused.","That didn’t make any sense.","“Mr. Luo, is there something wrong with the system?” Pei Si asked.","Everyone nodded and looked at him expectantly.","Something had to be wrong. It couldn’t be Feng Wu!","Mr. Luo wished that was the case. However...","“There’s nothing wrong with the system,” Mr. Luo said calmly.","If that was the case, that meant that Feng Wu had received that title because she deserved the reward.","Zhen Ya suddenly asked, “Is it because Feng Wu picked up the most crystal cores?”","Could that be the case? Everyone’s eyes lit up.","Pei Si raised her hand. “Sir, does the system rank us based on how many crystal cores are handed in?”","No one knew what the standards were.","Mr. Luo said, “There’s no question about the accuracy of the rankings.”","The students weren’t satisfied with the answer, but they found ways to convince themselves.","“That must be the case. Feng Wu picked up the most crystal cores and became the best team member. She’s shameless!”","“I agree with you! She was the one who lured in all the White Lion Elephants, but after the tutor saved them, the first thing she did was to gather the crystal cores. I can’t believe it.”","“I feel so sorry for Jingyu. She was the leader of the team, but Feng Wu became the best team member. That’s outright betrayal!”","Sun Jingyu couldn’t stand them anymore. She glared at them and shouted, “You don’t know what you’re talking about! Feng Wu deserves to have all the crystal cores! “Search our n?wno?el.?rg”No one is more qualified than she is!”","All the students were surprised. They never expected their class president to be on Feng Wu’s side.","They gave Feng Wu strange looks.","Zhen Ya mumbled, “Jingyu is such a nice person. She was robbed of the honor, but she’s trying to defend Feng Wu. She’s the best class president.”","The others agreed with her and admired Sun Jingyu for what she said. They only despised Feng Wu even more.","Sun Jingyu wanted to cry. She wished these people would stop talking.","“Shut up, all of you! That’s the end of the discussion! If anyone says anything, they’ll be banned from our next event!” Sun Jingyu had to shut them up.","As the class president, she had the right to ban her classmates from attending the events.","But –","She couldn’t stop them from discussing it. What she did only made the rumor spread further.","The students scattered after the points were distributed, and they gathered in twos and threes as everyone talked about today’s events in low voices.","They even gave Feng Wu a nickname: black crow.","The name indicated how much misfortune Feng Wu represented.","Chaoge was furious.","But nothing she did could stop these people from talking.","In Room 2001.","Chaoge grabbed a cleaver. “I’m so mad! I can’t stand them!”"]},{"number":2564,"title":"Chapter 2564 - I Don’t Want to Talk to You","paragraphs":["Chaoge said, “Xiao Wu, let go of me! I’m gonna kill them! They’re so vicious! Are they majoring in professional quarreling?”","Feng Wu chuckled.","Chaoge stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “How can you laugh? They’re slandering you! They’re calling you ‘black crow’!”","Zi Ling also found Feng Wu incredible. How tough did her mind have to be for her to remain unaffected?","Feng Wu laughed. “Black crow? I kinda like it.”","Chaoge didn’t understand how anyone could like such a name and didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu shrugged. “Someone once told me that I should be able to withstand as much slander as the praise I receive. Plus, that can hardly be called slandering.”","Chaoge still couldn’t understand her.","She had been criticized all her life. She would lose her temper when other people said bad things about her and would rejoice when they complimented her. Feng Wu, on the other hand, seemed to be able to anticipate everything and could take criticism much better.","Feng Wu said, “There, there. I’ll teach them a lesson next time. Happy?”","Chaoge asked, “Are you training me in patience now?”","Feng Wu shrugged. It seemed that Chaoge had guessed the answer this time.","Something occurred to Chaoge. “You didn’t tell Sun Jingyu to tell the truth. You stopped her on purpose. You wanted those people to think that you have no talent because you want to use this chance to make me more patient, is that it?”","Feng Wu smiled at her.","Chaoge said grumpily, “You... I don’t want to talk to you anymore!”","She walked away to sulk in a corner.","Meanwhile, Sun Jingyu was in her room. After she calmed down, she couldn’t stop thinking about how Feng Wu had killed a thousand White Lion Elephants with one strike.","That was amazing!","She was lost in thought. It had never occurred to her that she would genuinely admire Feng Wu for her talent. She almost wished that she could become Feng Wu’s minion.","Mu Qianqian and Sun Jingyu lived in the same dormitory, and the former wouldn’t stop talking.","“Feng Wu is so annoying! I didn’t expect her to become the best team member. Apart from the honor, she also earned 100 points.","“JIngyu, what are we going to do about Feng Wu?","“You spoke up for her, which was such a brilliant move! Everyone finds you such a generous person now. That was so clever.","“Jingyu?” Seeing that Sun Jingyu was deep in thought, Mu Qianqian gave her a nudge.","Sun Jingyu said, “What? What did you say?”","Mu Qianqian repeated what she said.","Sun Jingyu gave her a contemptuous look.","It made Mu Qianqian uneasy. She wondered if she had said something wrong.","Sun Jingyu pointed at her. “You’re such an idiot!”","Mu Qianqian said, “What?”","Sun Jingyu was interrupted by a knock at the door. Mu Qianqian went to answer it.","It was Wang Junwen, a student of Class D. She didn’t like Feng Wu either.","She didn’t ask Mu Qianqian to leave and questioned Sun Jingyu straight away. “Did you forget your task? Didn’t you promise me that you would finish off Feng Wu? What the hell?”"]},{"number":2565,"title":"Chapter 2565 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Wang Junwen glared at Sun Jingyu.","Yes, she was the one who had given Sun Jingyu the mission to kill Feng Wu, and Sun Jingyu had failed.","Sun Jingyu shrugged. “I couldn’t do it.”","Wang Junwen didn’t expect her to be so straightforward. She frowned. “I can understand that you failed once, but you can always try again...”","Of course, Sun Jingyu didn’t dare try again.","She raised her voice. “I’m not doing it!”","Wang Junwen gave Sun Jingyu a strange look. “What’s that supposed to mean?”","Mu Qianqian was surprised as well.","Sun Jingyu had spent a lot to kill Feng Wu, including on all the explosive balls. Didn’t she want to make it worth her while?","Sun Jingyu looked alarmed and said solemnly, “Junwen, I hope you can understand something.”","Wang Junwen said, “Go ahead.”","Sun Jingyu said, “I can’t reveal too much, but I have to remind you: Feng Wu isn’t someone we can touch. You better give up that idea.”","Wang Junwen didn’t think much of her warning and only gave her a cold glance. “You’ve made up your mind, then.”","Sun Jingyu nodded. “Yes, and I hope you’ll keep your promise. This stays between us.”","Wang Junwen frowned. She wasn’t ready to give up. “What if I double the reward?”","Sun Jingyu said, “I don’t have a death wish.”","She didn’t have a death wish! Wang Junwen smirked. “Fine. Sun Jingyu, that’s your final answer, then.“Please reading on N?WN0V?L.0?G” You know, plenty of people out there will jump at the opportunity!”","She then stormed off.","“Junwen, Junwen?” Mu Qianqian ran after Wang Junwen, but the latter soon disappeared down the corridor.","Mu Qianqian came back and said to Sun Jingyu in resignation, “Jingyu, you shouldn’t have offended Junwen. She’s from Class D.”","The five classes were of five different levels.","To students of Class D, students of Class E were so weak that they could bully them however they wanted.","To Class E, students of Class D were too powerful for them to mess with.","Sun Jingyu stared at Mu Qianqian. “Do you know who killed those White Lion Elephants?”","Mu Qianqian asked, “Who?”","Sun Jingyu glanced at her. “Who do you think?”","Mu Qianqian was perplexed. “Wasn’t it a mysterious tutor?”","Sun Jingyu smiled.","Mu Qianqian tilted her head. “Could it be Duan Chaoge? No, she’s only slightly better than me. She couldn’t have done it. It couldn’t have been Zi Ling either. So...","“OMG!” Mu Qianqian covered her mouth. “No, it couldn’t have been her! Feng Wu? Was it really her?”","“Yes.” Sun Jingyu was pleased to see the astonished look on Mu Qianqian’s face. Unlike Mu Qianqian, she had seen it with her own eyes!","Mu Qianqian said, “How’s that possible? There were over a thousand White Lion Elephants! Are you sure...”","Sun Jingyu grabbed her bucket to get some water and said casually before she left, “I saw it with my own eyes.”","Mu Qianqian looked like she had been struck by lightning.","Was Feng Wu even human?"]},{"number":2566,"title":"Chapter 2566 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Mu Qianqian had hung out with Sun Jingyu long enough to know her well. There was no need for Sun Jingyu to lie about it. Moreover, she had turned down Wang Junwen so decisively.","“What about Junwen...”","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was calculating her points.","Before the event, she had just 10 points left. Their team won first place, so each team member was given 100 points. Being the MVP, she earned an extra 100 points.","Therefore, she had 210 points.","Chaoge had 110 points.","Feng Wu took Chaoge and Zi Ling to the school canteen.","According to Zi Ling, all the ingredients used in the dishes in the canteen came from magical beasts of the Thousand Night Forest. Having a meal there increased one’s spiritual essence a little, and was beneficial to one’s cultivation.","The canteen was divided into two sections: ready-to-eat and stir-fry.","Ready-to-eat dishes were already cooked, and one only had to line up to put the food on their tray.","However, it was common knowledge that these types of dishes weren’t the best in terms of quality.","Stir-fry dishes were different because one could order them with specific ingredients. Such dishes ensured that the spiritual essence in the ingredients could be retained at the highest level.","Zi Ling led Feng Wu and Chaoge to the queue and suggested, “Shall we have four dishes? We came in first. We must celebrate.”","Four dishes were considered a celebration? Chaoge asked curiously, “What do you usually eat, then?”","Zi Ling said, “Vegetables poured over rice. It’s quite tasty.”","Chaoge was speechless.","She went to the front of the line to take a look at the ready-to-eat dishes, and when she came back, she said, “They don’t look that tasty to me. Plus, they’ve been sitting there for so long that there’s hardly any spiritual essence left.”","Zi Ling said, “But it’s good enough for us. We can’t afford the stir-fry dishes...”","Chaoge said, “I see that with the ready-to-eat dishes, meat dishes cost 5 points, vegetable dishes 3 points, and rice one point.”","Zi Ling nodded. “It’s so expensive, and many of us can’t afford them. We can only order one portion of rice and wash it down with the free soup. That’s the only way we can sustain ourselves.”","Chaoge asked, “Why are you so broke? Xiao Wu and I only just got here, and we already have over 100 points.”","Zi Ling looked at her in resignation. “That’s because our team was first, and only the top team can earn 100 points. The lower the ranking, the fewer points a team will earn. Teams ranked below 200 can’t earn any points at all. That’s how difficult it is to earn points. I’m the lucky one. I joined your team and earned the extra points.”","“You guys stay in the line. I’ll get us some soup,” Zi Ling was going to fetch the free soup.","“Isn’t it Zi Ling? What a coincidence. Are you here for the free soup again?” It was Zhen Ya’s voice.","Zhen Ya was Lu Xiao’s current girlfriend, and she had never tried to hide her resentment toward Zi Ling.","Zi Ling’s cheeks flushed with anger. She turned around and ignored Zhen Ya.","But Zhen Ya didn’t walk away. She was the type of girl who always clung to her boyfriend.","She looked at Zi Ling, Feng Wu, and Chaoge with contempt.","Lu Xiao had always felt guilty about leaving Zi Ling, so he lowered his voice and asked, “Zi Ling, why don’t you join us?”","Hearing that, Zhen Ya glared at Zi Ling.","Zi Ling had an indescribable look in her eyes when she shook her head at him. “That won’t be necessary. Please leave.”"]},{"number":2567,"title":"Chapter 2567 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Zi Ling went back to her team and wouldn’t look at Lu Xiao again.","Zhen Ya let Lu Xiao go back to their table first. After he left, she went to Zi Ling’s side with a smirk on her face and raised her hand.","Thump!","She slapped Zi Ling in the face.","The sound attracted much attention.","Feng Wu and Chaoge looked at each other, and both were infuriated.","Zhen Ya had no idea that she had offended Feng Wu. She only stared at Zi Ling and said harshly, “Zi Ling, I’m warning you! Lu Xiao is my boyfriend now! If you seduce him again, you’ll get more than a slap to the face!”","She was ready to leave after that.","But Chaoge stopped her.","Zhen Ya glared at her. “Be a good dog and get out of my way!”","“Right. A good dog shouldn’t get in the way. That makes you a bad dog!” Chaoge then slapped Zhen Ya with much force.","Smack!","It was such a crisp sound.","Chaoge had used much more force than when Zhen Ya slapped Zi Ling. As a result, Zhen Ya flew backward.","Both her feet left the ground.","Zhen Ya stared at Chaoge in disbelief.","Chaoge had hit her.","She was the daughter of the famous Zhen family, and that girl had slapped her! Zhen Ya was dumbfounded.","All eyes were on Chaoge.","The new student was bold enough to mess with the daughter of the Zhen family!","Wait. A new student? Chaoge was a new student, and she was capable of striking Zhen Ya so hard that she was sent flying. Did that mean that she was more capable than Zhen Ya?","Just then, Lu Xiao ran back from their table. He squeezed through the crowd and rushed to his girlfriend’s side. “Zhen Ya, are you alright?”","Zhen Ya burst into tears when she saw Lu Xiao, as if she had suffered the greatest injustice.","“Zi Ling told her friend to hit me!” ‘*’Zhen Ya’s tears won her a lot of sympathy, and the mark on her face also proved that she had been hit hard.","Lu Xiao glared at Zi Ling with eyes burning with fury.","He shouted, “Zi Ling, if you hate me, do whatever you want to me! Why did you hurt Zhen Ya? I’m so disappointed in you!”","He picked Zhen Ya up and carried her toward the infirmary.","“If anything happens to Zhen Ya, I’ll make you pay!”","That was all Lu Xiao said.","Feng Wu could see that Zi Ling was so angry that her legs almost gave out. She had clenched her fists and gritted her teeth.","Feng Wu also saw that Zi Ling was clutching her hands so tightly that her nails dug into her palms. Blood oozed out.","What kind of hatred was that? Had someone threatened her, forcing her to endure this humiliation?","Feng Wu shook her head. “Let’s go back.”","They went back to Room 2001.","Ye Han hadn’t shown her face ever since Feng Wu defeated her. As a result, there were only three people in the dormitory.","Chaoge closed the door and asked Zi Ling, “What on earth was that about?”","Zi Ling bit her lower lip, trying to force back her tears.","Chaoge grew impatient. “What’s going on? Why is that Zhen Ya targeting you, and what’s that Lu Xiao’s problem? Why did he blame you? Just tell me!”","Feng Wu frowned.","She could roughly guess what had happened, but it concerned Zi Ling’s privacy; if she didn’t want to say anything, Feng Wu didn’t want to force her either.","She only patted Zi Ling on the shoulder. “It’s okay to feel wronged. What’s worse is when you’re wronged and can’t vent your frustration.”"]},{"number":2568,"title":"Chapter 2568 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Without an outlet, you won’t have any motivation and can only go with the flow.","“With it, you can work from there and achieve something one day.","“Injustice isn’t always a bad thing, but if you choose to remain silent afterward, that’s the true tragedy.”","Feng Wu looked Zi Ling in the eye and said solemnly, “I hope you can remember that indignation, but if you choose to look away, that’s fine, too.” Feng Wu knew that she wouldn’t think too highly of the girl if she chose to run away.","Zi Ling closed her eyes.","She had no idea that she was at a crossroad in her life.","Nor did she know how her choice would change her life forever.","She wiped her tears, took a deep breath, and met Feng Wu’s gaze. “I’ll tell you what happened.”","She chose not to be a silent victim.","Her choice was appreciated.","The story was straightforward.","Lu Xiao and Zi Ling grew up together. Both came from families of scholars that were equal in social status. Therefore, they were betrothed to each other at a very young age and were going to get married as soon as they were old enough.","They went to school and cultivated together. Later, they entered Imperial College together, slowly making their way from Year 1 to Year 4.","Zhen Ya showed up when they entered the War Academy. She was in love with Lu Xiao and courted him frantically.","It was a messy process.","Zi Ling said, “Zhen Ya knew what she was doing. She slowly made friends with Lu Xiao. At first, she acted like a fangirl who was infatuated with him. She would ask him questions about schoolwork all the time, and Lu Xiao enjoyed it.","“I was angry when I found out about her and demanded that Lu Xiao keep his distance, but Lu Xiao didn’t understand it. He said that Zhen Ya was only a friend and that I was being stingy.","“Gradually, Zhen Ya joined our team, and all my team members were on her side. I became an outcast. I tried to talk to Lu Xiao, but he said that his teammates found me too grumpy and too hard to please.”","Zi Ling grew angrier as she talked. “I forced Lu Xiao to make a choice between me and her. It was one way or another. Lu Xiao chose me in the end and stopped seeing her. I was very happy, but...”","There was despair in her voice now. “Three days later, I ran into them in Zhen Ya’s room. They were lying naked in her bed.”","Zi Ling smiled bitterly. “After that, Lu Xiao announced in front of everyone that our marriage arrangement was canceled, and Zhen Ya became his girlfriend.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Chaoge said, “How could Zhen Ya say that you seduced Lu Xiao?!”","Zi Ling said, “I’ve been avoiding them since that incident. Zhen Ya is from an influential family. Her father is a tutor of Class E. You know that our chief tutor is Mr. Zhu, right?”","Chaoge nodded.","Zi Ling said, “Zhen Ya took her mother’s family name. Her father is Mr. Zhu.”","Chaoge said, “What?”","Zi Ling smiled bitterly. “Because of that, all the students in Class E fear her, including Sun Jingyu. It’s only natural that the other students joined hands to isolate me.”","Chaoge said, “That’s outrageous! Didn’t Mr. Zhu say anything?”","Zi Ling gave her a strange look.","Chaoge said, “Did I say something wrong?”","Zi Ling smirked. “Well, Mr. Zhu is...”"]},{"number":2569,"title":"Chapter 2569 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Zi Ling smirked. “I went to see Mr. Zhu about it, but he told me there was nothing he could do and sent me away.”","Chaoge said, “I can’t believe it! What happened after that?”","Zi Ling smiled bitterly. “Zhen Ya has been mocking me whenever she sees me and targets me every chance she gets. She becomes alarmed when she thinks I’m too close to Lu Xiao. That’s why I’ve been trying to avoid them, but I can’t stay unnoticed sometimes because Lu Xiao greets me all the time.”","She snorted. “I wish he’d never talk to me again since it always brings me trouble.”","Zi Ling turned to Chaoge and said apologetically, “I wouldn’t have reacted like this if I were on my own, but I dragged the two of you into it. I really don’t know what to do.”","Chaoge didn’t feel that she should feel bad about hitting Zhen Ya, but she had indeed caused Feng Wu trouble again.","“Xiao Wu...” Chaoge went to Feng Wu’s side, lowered her head, and asked gingerly, “I shouldn’t have done that, right? Have I caused you trouble again?”","Feng Wu said sternly, “Are you only aware of that now?”","Chaoge was lost for words.","Feng Wu said, “If you could choose, would you do it again?”","Chaoge gritted her teeth and hesitated, but she still gave an honest answer.","She nodded. “Although it’s not right, given the choice, I would do it again. Xiao Wu, I’m sorry, but I can’t become the good student you want me to be.”","She burst into tears in the end.","She had a feeling that Feng Wu would give up on her.","Feng Wu chuckled.","Chaoge was confused.","Feng Wu said in resignation, “You did the right thing.”","Chaoge was shocked.","“What?”","Feng Wu said, “I said, you did the right thing.","“Do you really take me for a coward? Am I someone who would compromise?”","Chaoge said, “What do you mean?”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll tell you the same thing that I told Zi Ling.”","Chaoge tried to recall what Feng Wu said earlier.","Feng Wu said, “We all need to preserve our will and spirit. Without them, we’re no different from fish.","“If someone insults you, insult them with worse things.","“If they hit you, hit them back right away. If you can’t beat them, run away. Get stronger and then fight them again.","“Who told you that you have to swallow your grievances?","“Do you not understand why I scolded you before?”","Chaoge said, “Xiao Wu, I...”","Feng Wu waved her off. “You need to figure it out on your own. Until then, don’t come to see me again.”","Chaoge was almost in tears and turned to Zi Ling for help.","Zi Ling was as dumbfounded as she was.","Feng Wu left the dormitory and walked around the academy. She spent some points and listened to a few classes.","After attending a lesson on cultivation theory, she worked out the average level of the other students here.","She had learned under her beautiful master, and was good enough to be a teacher here. She didn’t need the theory class anymore.","She enjoyed the course about surviving in the Thousand Night Forest.","She hadn’t handed in all the crystal cores.","She only handed in 165 and had kept the rest for later use."]},{"number":2570,"title":"Chapter 2570 - Untitled","paragraphs":["She then went to the cultivation rooms.","It was an interesting place.","The five types of cultivation rooms each corresponded to metal, wood, water, fire, and earth. There were also rooms for auxiliary elements such as ice, frost, and thunder.","Feng Wu made some inquiries and was told that students of Class E could only use Grade E rooms.","She then chose the Grade E fire room.","She entered it and used the crystal cores for her cultivation.","She noticed in surprise that her cultivation had doubled.","When she used all the crystal cores that she had brought with her, the percentage rose to 8%.","She needed 100% to become a real Spiritual King.","When she left the room, she was told that she had spent a small fortune.","“100 points?” She looked at the teacher in surprise.","It was a middle-aged female teacher. Her face was expressionless, and her eyes were cold. She didn’t look very friendly.","She glanced at Feng Wu and said lightly, “10 points an hour. You’ve used 10 hours.”","Feng Wu frowned. She felt that the teacher was targeting her.","She didn’t think that she had met the teacher before.","“If you can’t afford it, don’t come again.” The teacher glanced at Feng Wu and said to the student behind her, “Next.”","There was a line behind Feng Wu, and the students were all whispering.","Zuo Qingluan had targeted Feng Wu from the very beginning. As a result, other students didn’t fear Feng Wu either.","They even dared to discuss her in front of her.","“Who’s she? Ms. Zhen is usually very nice.”","“That’s Feng Wu, the one Chief Qingluan tried to pick in front of everyone.”","“I see. That’s Feng Wu. By the looks of it, she’s offended Ms. Zhen.”","“Then she’ll have a very hard time ahead of her. Cultivation rooms are the places we need most.”","Ms. Zhen glanced at Feng Wu. “Why are you still here?”","Feng Wu smiled. “I’ll use another 10 hours.”","Ms. Zhen was surprised. “Are you going to use up your points?”","Feng Wu asked, “Do you know me? Why do you know how many points I have?”","Ms. Zhen didn’t answer and only stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, “Can’t I do that?”","Ms. Zhen smirked. “Get back in line.”","She wanted to give Feng Wu trouble.","Feng Wu glanced at her and walked toward the cultivation room.","“Stop right there!” Ms. Zhen felt humiliated and glared at Feng Wu. “Do you think you can go in just like that? Get back in line!”","Feng Wu ignored her again.","“Stop!” Infuriated, Ms. Zhen tried to grab Feng Wu’s shoulder.","The moment her fingers touched Feng Wu, Feng Wu grabbed her arm and threw her over her shoulder.","Thump!","There was a loud noise.","Everyone was shocked.","They had never imagined that they would witness such a thing one day.","A mere student had thrown a teacher over her shoulder.","The teacher was Ms. Zhen, Mr. Zhu’s wife.","“That’s Ms. Zhen!”","“She’s Zhen Ya’s mother!”"]},{"number":2571,"title":"Chapter 2571 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“How dare Feng Wu do such a thing!”","“But we all know how capable Ms. Zhen is. Why was Feng Wu able to throw her over her shoulder?”","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Wasn’t Feng Wu supposed to be useless? How could she injure Ms. Zhen?","Ms. Zhen was at a loss as well.","It had never occurred to her that she would be humiliated this way.","She had been defeated by a student.","Driven by shame, she jumped up, bent her fingers so that her hands looked like claws, and aimed at Feng Wu’s eyes.","Feng Wu grabbed one of her hands. With a crack, she crushed Ms. Zhen’s hand in her palm.","“Ah!!!” Ms. Zhen screamed in pain.","The students watched in astonishment.","They thought that they had seen enough shocking things, but they were wrong.","“Feng Wu is...”","“Oh my god...”","“Ms. Zhen is...”","Ms. Zhen stared at Feng Wu with eyes that burned with hatred.","Feng Wu said, ” Get out of my way.”","Ms. Zhen hated Feng Wu, but she didn’t dare offend her again.","Because Feng Wu could crush her like she was stomping on an ant.","She wasn’t Feng Wu’s match at all.","Overwhelmed by the humiliation, Ms. Zhen moved aside, and Feng Wu marched into the fire room while everyone watched.","The students were shocked once more.","There were around a dozen students, and they all sucked in their breaths in unison.","Zhen Ya’s friends had slipped away to look for her.","They couldn’t find her, but they found Mr. Zhu instead.","Feng Wu was cultivating when Mr. Zhu arrived.","She realized that when she didn’t have any crystal cores, her cultivation speed was greatly reduced.","It seemed that she needed to earn more crystal cores and points.","Just then, she heard footsteps outside.","The students turned around and saw that it was Mr. Zhu.","Their first thought was that Feng Wu was going to die.","Holding her right arm, Ms. Zhen greeted him. There was pain in her voice, but her eyes spat fire.","“Husband!” Ms. Zhen gritted her teeth.","Apparently, Mr. Zhu had been informed of what happened. He examined Ms. Zhen’s wound and was slightly relieved when he saw that it wasn’t too serious.","“Where’s that student?” His face was livid.","“She’s cultivating inside.” Ms. Zhen pointed at the cultivation room. She was so furious that her eyes looked like they were spitting fire.","The injury hurt, but she was more furious because she had been beaten by a student in front of other students. The humiliation almost drove her crazy.","Mr. Zhu nodded and headed for the cultivation room.","At that moment, four people arrived.","They were Zhen Ya, Lu Xiao, Sun Jingyu and Mu Qianqian.","They all heard the conversation between the couple.","Zhen Ya held her mother and shook with rage. Lu Xiao tried to comfort her.","The students all murmured to one another and expressed how sorry they felt for Zhen Ya. They were convinced that Feng Wu was going to die.","Was she? Sun Jingyu didn’t think so.","Mu Qianqian tugged at Sun Jingyu’s sleeve and whispered, “Are we on the wrong side?”","Sun Jingyu only rolled her eyes at Mu Qianqian."]},{"number":2572,"title":"Chapter 2572 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Mu Qianqian anxiously dropped her voice so that no one else could hear her. “Jingyu, I’m not joking. Feng Wu attacked Ms. Zhen. What do you think Mr. Zhu will do to her? Listen. They all think that she’s going to die.”","Sun Jingyu glanced at Ms. Zhen’s right hand and said casually, “Just because they all think that way doesn’t mean that they’re right. They’re only repeating each other’s words.”","Mu Qianqian stomped her foot. “But Mr. Zhu is the most capable tutor of our class.”","Sun Jingyu thought, “So what? I bet he can’t kill a thousand White Lion Elephants with one strike.”","Her legs still trembled whenever she recalled that scene. It chilled her to the bone.","Mu Qianqian was trying to figure out how not to be incriminated by Feng Wu.","Meanwhile, Mr. Zhu had arrived outside the fire room.","He tried to push the door open.","But it wasn’t as easy as he expected.","The door wouldn’t open.","He frowned, stepped back, and checked the sign in the top right corner of the door.","Grade E, Fire Cultivation Room 1.","It was the right place.","He grabbed the door handle and pushed harder.","He used 80% of his maximum strength and was confident that the door would open without resistance.","He was wrong. The door still wouldn’t budge.","Mr. Zhu was concerned now.","When he exerted his full power, he realized in surprise that he still couldn’t open the door.","He was astonished.","He knew that this was a competition between his and Feng Wu’s cultivation levels.","What kind of student could keep him out?","Dozens of students had gathered around, and they looked expectantly at Mr. Zhu.","Thump!","Infuriated, Mr. Zhu raised a leg.","He kicked the door open with a loud thump.","This time, he finally could enter the room.","“How do you think Mr. Zhu will punish Feng Wu?”","“She disrespected her teachers. They’ll expel her, won’t they?”","Zhen Ya smirked. “My dad is going to kill her!”","Ms. Zhen gave her a stern look. What a stupid girl! She couldn’t say such things out loud!","While everyone else believed that Feng Wu was going to be punished, Sun Jingyu shook her head.","From what she knew of Feng Wu, she believed that things wouldn’t turn out the way these people expected.","Feng Wu would prove them all wrong.","Chaoge and Zi Ling got wind of the news and arrived at that moment.","Zhen Ya was furious when she saw Zi Ling.","Ms. Zhen stopped her and said coldly, “Don’t create more trouble now.”","Zhen Ya had to fight back her rage.","In the fire room.","Feng Wu sat cross-legged on the floor, and Mr. Zhu was kneeling in front of her.","She said, “Get out of my sight now.”","Mr. Zhu scrambled to his feet. All his wounds were hidden by his clothes, and other people couldn’t tell that he had been hurt.","He wanted to leave the room.","Feng Wu said sarcastically, “You’ll have to leave something behind.”","Mr. Zhu glared at her before he looked down at his hands.","Which hand should he chop off?","Feng Wu chuckled. “The right one, then. It’s more valuable.”","Mr. Zhu glared at her.","He had never imagined that something like this would happen to him."]},{"number":2573,"title":"Chapter 2573 - An Incredible Student (1)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu smiled at Mr. Zhu.","Mr. Zhu glared at her in frustration. It had never occurred to him that there would be such an incredible student in his class.","He had been confident when he came in, thinking that he would teach the student a good lesson.","He had never imagined that it was possible he would lose.","Not only that, he also realized in astonishment that he couldn’t withstand a single strike.","Not a single one.","He was the class tutor, but he was easily defeated by one of his students.","For an instant, he wished that the ground could open up so that he could hide inside.","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Have you decided?”","Mr. Zhu was a decisive man who kept his word. He grabbed his sword and struck down at his right arm.","Before he could make contact, he was struck by an invisible force.","The sword flew out of his hand and landed in the wall behind him.","It was buried all the way to the hilt.","Mr. Zhu’s face paled.","The walls of the cultivation room were made of a special material. Ordinary people couldn’t leave any mark on it, let alone stick a sword into it.","Even he couldn’t do it.","Feng Wu had only entered the academy for two days, and she could already plunge a sword into the wall.","Exactly how capable was she?","“Why?” Mr. Zhu stared at Feng Wu. “Why did you stop me?”","Feng Wu smiled. “I don’t think it’s worth the trouble.”","Mr. Zhu said, “What?”","Feng Wu said, “Why do I need your right hand? I can’t eat it.”","Mr. Zhu was speechless.","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Why don’t you name a price? How much do you think your right arm is worth? Convert it into points and give them to me.”","Mr. Zhu was astonished. “Are you sure you don’t want me to...”","He was so agitated that he couldn’t finish his sentence.","Feng Wu waved him off and got straight to the point. “I think you know that being a new student, I’m always in need of more points.”","Mr. Zhu asked, “Aren’t you afraid that I won’t keep my promise?”","Feng Wu smiled a little and glanced at his right arm. She said teasingly, “I can take that hand whenever I want.”","That was an outright threat.","Mr. Zhu didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. She was such a unique student.","He realized that a genius like Feng Wu couldn’t stay in Class E for long. She would soon rise in glory.","“How many points do you need?” he asked in resignation.","Feng Wu said, “I want to have unlimited access to the cultivation room. How about that?”","Mr. Zhu shook his head. “That’s not possible.”","Feng Wu asked him why.","Mr. Zhu smiled bitterly. “My authority only applies to Class E.”","Feng Wu said, “In that case, give me unlimited access to this cultivation room while I’m in Class E.”","Mr. Zhu shook his head again. “I can’t do that.”","Feng Wu frowned. She felt that she had made enough compromises.","Mr. Zhu shook his head. “I’m not as powerful as you think. Even I have to pay with my points to use the cultivation room.”","Feng Wu asked, “Seriously?”","Mr. Zhu nodded. “The school has various rules to prevent the devaluation of points. This is one of them.”"]},{"number":2574,"title":"Chapter 2574 - An Incredible Student (2)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu said, “If that’s the case, Mr. Zhu, I think I’m gonna take that right arm now.”","Mr. Zhu was alarmed. The girl might seem harmless, but she was anything but.","“There are ways to get around that,” Mr. Zhu said hurriedly. “The maximum amount of points a Class E student can get in a transaction is 1,000 points, and that’s what I’ll give you.”","Feng Wu frowned and shook her head. “That’s too little.”","Mr. Zhu felt the same, but that was the school rule. What else could he do?","“The maximum transaction amount really is 1,000, regardless of whether it’s between students or students and teachers. Also, it can only be done for the same person once a month,” Mr. Zhu said solemnly. It seemed he was telling the truth.","Feng Wu said, “I want 3,000 points.”","Compared with 3,000 points, Mr. Zhu obviously valued his arm more.","Mr. Zhu didn’t hesitate to nod. “Of course.”","Feng Wu said, “Would you please call Chaoge and Zi Ling in, then?”","Mr. Zhu looked at her in resignation.","He wondered why she wouldn’t trust him. She had to make sure that he transferred the points right now.","However, he wasn’t in a position to make requests, so he opened the door and said, “Duan Chaoge, Zi Ling, please come in for a moment.”","The students outside had no idea what was happening in the room.","They jumped when Mr. Zhu called out the names.","But they soon saw what was going on.","“Duan Chaoge and Zi Ling are both Feng Wu’s friends!”","“Why does Mr. Zhu want them to go in?”","“Oh my god. Did Mr. Zhu kill Feng Wu? Does he need them to collect the body?!”","Despite their astonishment, they all discussed the matter with flickering eyes.","Zhen Ya was pleased.","She and her mother looked at each other, and both smiled in satisfaction.","Mu Qianqian grew anxious. She grabbed Sun Jingyu’s hand and said agitatedly, “Jingyu!”","She also believed that Mr. Zhu had beaten Feng Wu to death.","Sun Jingyu’s face remained emotionless, but she grew doubtful as well.","Had she made the wrong choice?","She wondered if she really had seen Feng Wu’s formidable strike.","Chaoge and Zi Ling were both concerned about Feng Wu. When they heard Mr. Zhu, they ran into the room as fast as they could.","They heard all the discussion around them.","Was Feng Wu really dead?","Gosh!","They were shocked by what they saw.","Feng Wu sat calmly on the floor with her legs crossed, and there was a cheerful look in her bright eyes.","She seemed to be in control of the situation.","Mr. Zhu was standing next to her, bowing slightly like a servant.","He didn’t dare to show any disrespect.","Chaoge was speechless.","Zi Ling didn’t know what to say.","What was going on?","“Switch on your armbands.” Feng Wu smiled at them.","Both Chaoge and Zi Ling were dumbfounded.","Chaoge was used to following Feng Wu’s orders, so she switched on her armband without asking questions.","“1,000 points transferred,” a robotic female voice announced.","1,000 points?","Chaoge couldn’t believe her ears. She looked at Feng Wu in pleasant surprise. “Xiao Wu, what’s going on?”"]},{"number":2575,"title":"Chapter 2575 - An Incredible Student (3)","paragraphs":["Chaoge was indescribably excited.","Feng Wu didn’t answer her and only looked at Zi Ling.","Zi Ling wasn’t blind. She saw Chaoge receive 1,000 points.","She switched on her armband without further prompting.","“1,000 points transferred.”","The same robotic female voice rang out again.","Zi Ling was grateful and said to Mr. Zhu, “Thank you so much!”","She bowed as she spoke.","Mr. Zhu’s face was livid. He looked at Feng Wu instead of Zi Ling.","Feng Wu nodded. “You can go now.”","Mr. Zhu left without looking back.","Zi Ling and Chaoge opened their eyes wide in disbelief as they watched Mr. Zhu leave.","What was going on?","Why did it feel like Feng Wu was ordering Mr. Zhu around?","Were they mistaken?","Chaoge and Zi Ling turned around and looked at Feng Wu in unison, both filled with wonder.","Feng Wu said, “Let’s go.”","Chaoge wanted to ask something, but there were too many people around them, so she followed Feng Wu without saying a word.","Mr. Zhu quickly left the cultivation room.","Many students were waiting outside.","There had only been over a dozen of them at first, but when news got around, more students flooded in.","Looking around, Mr. Zhu saw that the place was packed.","There were at least hundreds of people.","Mr. Zhu’s face turned livid.","Just then, Zhen Ya, his daughter, ran excitedly toward him.","She blinked, unable to contain her excitement.","“Father, did you teach Feng Wu a lesson? I’ll drag her out now.”","Mr. Zhu’s face darkened even more.","Drag her out?","Why did she even think she could do that?","Fearing that his ignorant daughter would offend Feng Wu again, he immediately said, “Stop right there!”","He had never spoken so harshly before.","Zhen Ya was dumbfounded.","Mr. Zhu glared at her. “Come with me! Now!”","He grabbed her arm and led her away from the crowd.","But Zhen Ya wouldn’t let him.","She threw off his hand. “I still have things to do! I’m not leaving!”","However, Mr. Zhu was worried that his daughter would upset Feng Wu, so he picked her up without hesitation and dragged her away.","Ms. Zhen knew him well and was suspicious of his reaction.","She felt that something wasn’t right.","But she had no idea what.","The students had no idea what happened.","They believed Zhen Ya and thought that Mr. Zhu had taught Feng Wu a lesson.","They expected to see Feng Wu lying on the floor, covered in blood.","Mr. Zhu must have called Chaoge and Zi Ling inside so that they could carry Feng Wu out.","“Why haven’t they carried Feng Wu out yet?”","“Is she too severely injured? Could she have died at the scene?”","“I don’t think so. Mr. Zhu would have to take responsibility if that happens. I think she’s badly wounded, that’s all.”","Just then, the door to the cultivation room opened.","There we go!","The students outside couldn’t wait to see who would come out.","They were already displeased when Feng Wu turned down the opportunity to become Zuo Qingluan’s friend.","And then..."]},{"number":2576,"title":"Chapter 2576 - An Incredible Student (4)","paragraphs":["Then, they believed that Feng Wu became the best team member because she was lucky enough to join Sun Jingyu’s team, which gave her 200 points.","Everyone was jealous of her.","Of course they wouldn’t like Feng Wu.","They were looking forward to seeing what happened to her.","However, they were shocked when they saw Feng Wu come out.","She didn’t look injured at all. She didn’t even have a scratch on her.","She was as pretty as ever. Her skin was as smooth as porcelain, and there were no wrinkles in her dress.","It was obvious that she hadn’t been beaten up.","Mr. Zhu looked more like he was the one who had been beaten up.","“You...”","Everyone watched in surprise as Feng Wu walked out of the room with Zi Ling and Chaoge by her side.","They left the room together.","Ms. Zhen was so furious that her nails dug into her palms.","Her eyes spat fire.","She left without saying a word.","She wasn’t going to stop Feng Wu. Instead, she was going to ask Mr. Zhu what was going on.","In Room 2001.","Chaoge and Zi Ling stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Zi Ling couldn’t believe her ears.","Chaoge found it much easier to believe Feng Wu. After all, she had been Feng Wu’s friend long enough to know that such things could happen.","She cut to the chase. “Xiao Wu, you didn’t beat up Mr. Zhu, did you?”","Zi Ling rolled her eyes at Chaoge. “No, that’s just ridiculous. Be reasonable. Feng Wu beat up Mr. Zhu? How could that happen?”","Feng Wu said, “I did.”","Zi Ling’s mouth fell open.","Feng Wu said, “I did just now.”","Zi Ling said, “What did you do?”","Feng Wu said, “He attacked me without saying a word. I parried his blow, and sent him flying. That was it.”","She shrugged innocently. “I didn’t actually hit him.”","Chaoge was speechless.","Zi Ling didn’t know what to say.","In the tutors’ living quarters.","The students could only live in the dormitories, whereas the teachers lived in villas.","Mr. Zhu was the tutor of Class E and could only live in the outermost region.","In the villa of the Zhus.","Zhen Ya was yelling at her father. “Why did you bring me home?! Dad, do you know how important that was to me?","“Duan Chaoge and Zi Ling were going to carry Feng Wu out! You don’t get to see that every day!","“Feng Wu has been so outrageous! She’s only a new student, but she thinks of herself as some big deal! If one didn’t know better, they would think that she’s a Class D student already!","“I have to see Feng Wu at her worst! I’ll be able to mock her for it from now on! Dad, you don’t know anything!”","She threw off Mr. Zhu’s hand and headed for the door.","“Stop right there!” Mr. Zhu had never sounded so angry before.","It frightened Zhen Ya.","Her father had never spoken to her that way before.","Mr. Zhu stared at Zhen Ya and stressed each word. “I’ll disown you if you offend Feng Wu again!”","He meant it.","Intimidated, Zhen Ya cringed. When she realized what her father had said, she burst into tears.","Her father had always doted on her, and she had never been treated this way before.","“Why are you saying that?” Zhen Ya cried.","“I’d like to know the answer as well!” someone said angrily from the doorway."]},{"number":2577,"title":"Chapter 2577 - Genius Student (1)","paragraphs":["“I’d like to know the answer as well!” someone said angrily from the doorway.","Mr. Zhu turned around and saw his wife charging into the room, her eyes shining brightly with fury.","He closed his eyes and took a deep breath.","Ms. Zhen walked up to her husband and looked him in the eye.","“Tell me why! Now!” She glared at Mr. Zhu.","Mr. Zhu looked from his wife to his daughter.","He took a deep breath and slowly said, “With everything that has happened, can’t you see it?","“Feng Wu isn’t useless by any standard! She’s a genius!”","Zhen Ya smirked. “Father, don’t be ridiculous. Feng Wu is a genius? She might have been a genius once, but she lost her ability five years ago; everyone knows that. She’s completely crippled.”","Mr. Zhu said tauntingly, “Are you saying that your father was defeated by a cripple?”","Zhen Ya and Ms. Zhen’s pupils contracted.","They couldn’t believe their ears.","“Father!”","“Husband?!”","Mr. Zhu took another deep breath. He breathed out, paused, and said, “You heard me correctly. Feng Wu defeated me.”","Zhen Ya didn’t know what to say.","Mr. Zhu was speechless.","The room was completely silent.","It was as if the air had frozen.","Mr. Zhu stared at Ms. Zhen. “Avoid Feng Wu as much as you can when she goes to the cultivation room. If you can’t avoid her, avoid any confrontation.”","Ms. Zhen wanted to say something, but Mr. Zhu cut her off.","“Don’t treat her like a common student! She’s a genius! The most brilliant kind!","“And you!” Mr. Zhu turned to his daughter. “Don’t offend Feng Wu ever again. Remember, she’s a genius, and she has every right to be arrogant. If you don’t get in her way, she won’t do anything to you either.","“But if you don’t listen to my advice and you offend her, you’ll be responsible for the consequences. I won’t have anything to do with it!”","He left after giving that warning.","Ms. Zhen and Zhen Ya were completely at a loss.","What was wrong with this world?","How could Feng Wu be a genius?","Meanwhile, in Room 2001.","Zi Ling would check her 1,000 points from time to time and be as happy as a little mouse.","Chaoge said, “Zi Ling, stop giggling. You look silly.”","Zi Ling said, “You have no idea how hard it is to earn points! I’ve never had more than 100 points, but now, I have 1,000! I want to show off to the entire school!”","Chaoge said, “Try to keep a low profile.”","Zi Ling said, “But it’s so hard! Xiao Wu is obviously a genius, but they’re calling her useless! It makes me so mad!”","Chaoge shrugged. Xiao Wu was humble that way, and there was nothing they could do.","Zi Ling asked, “By the way, another event is coming up. Can I join your team again?”","Chaoge said, “Of course you can.”"]},{"number":2578,"title":"Chapter 2578 - Genius Student (2)","paragraphs":["The students gathered in the same square for the next event.","Sun Jingyu knew how capable Feng Wu was now, so she went straight to her.","When she arrived, she saw that someone had beaten her to it.","Zhen Ya and Lu Xiao were there already, and Zhen Ya spoke in a condescending tone. “Feng Wu, we’re on your team this time!”","Her father had given her a warning.","Therefore, she wanted to check if Feng Wu really was the genius that she was said to be. However, she shouldn’t have brought Lu Xiao with her, nor should she be using that condescending tone.","Feng Wu ignored her, and Chaoge simply said, “No, you’re not.”","Zhen Ya was furious.","She was the princess of Class E, but they turned her down.","She stared at Zi Ling. “What do you say?”","Her father had warned her not to offend Feng Wu, and she revered him. Because of that, she only dared to confront Chaoge and Zhen Ya.","Having talked to Feng Wu, Zi Ling had let go a little. After learning that Mr. Zhu was weaker than Feng Wu, she didn’t fear Mr. Zhu as much. As a result, she had become much more confident.","She glanced at Zhen Ya before turning away, showing no intention to talk to the girl.","Zhen Ya was infuriated.","“Zhen Ya, don’t be upset. It’s just a team.” Pei Si arrived with her friends. She smiled at Feng Wu and asked, “Feng Wu, would you like to form a team with us?”","Behind her were Gu Xingyuan and Chu Junying.","Sun Jingyu was about to approach Feng Wu, when Mu Qianqian grabbed her hand and whispered, “JIngyu, Wang Junwen sent us a warning: she’s forbidding us from joining Feng Wu’s team this time.”","Sun Jingyu gave her a suspicious look.","Mu Qianqian smiled bitterly. “JIngyu, Wang Junwen is from Class D; you know how well-connected she is.”","Sun Jingyu took a deep breath.","Without any background, one wouldn’t have a voice even if they were the top student of Class E.","They decided that they should stay out of it.","However...","Sun Jingyu glanced at Pei Si and Zhen Ya and smirked. Did Pei Si think she could kill Feng Wu? How naive.","Feng Wu glanced at Pei Si. “We don’t need so many people.”","Pei Si smiled at Zhen Ya. “How about Zhen Ya and I join your team?”","Feng Wu didn’t say no.","Hence, a new team was created.","The team consisted of Feng Wu, Chaoge, Zi Ling, Pei Si, and Zhen Ya.","Sun Jingyu quickly formed a team as well. It was Mu Qianqian and herself at first, then Yuan Yu and Gu Xingyuan volunteered to join as well. As a result, Chu Junying joined them as well.","The other students teamed up as well.","Mr. Luo was still the one giving out the task.","He glanced at Feng Wu as he spoke, and the look in his eyes was cold and merciless.","Feng Wu was a little perplexed. She didn’t think she had offended Mr. Luo. Why the attitude?","Zi Ling leaned over and whispered in Feng Wu’s ear, “I heard that Mr. Luo used to have a crush on Ms. Zhen, and you offended Ms. Zhen yesterday. So...”","Feng Wu was speechless. Even the husband had given up; why would Mr. Luo try to pick on her? Interesting."]},{"number":2579,"title":"Chapter 2579 - Genius Student (3)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu glanced at Zhen Ya, and Zhen Ya looked back at her, seemingly pleased with herself.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Why was she so pleased?","Zhen Ya smirked inwardly. She had gone to Mr. Luo’s house and complained to him in tears, making it sound like her mom had been through hell.","She decided that if her father wouldn’t do anything to Feng Wu, someone else would.","The event was still taking place in Thousand Night Forest, and they were still going to hunt some magical beasts.","Usually, these events were all about hunting White Lion Elephants, which had been annihilated by Feng Wu. After an emergency meeting, the tutors decided that the students would hunt Nether Wolf Tigers this time.","It was a magical beast with the head of a wolf and the body of a tiger.","They were as powerful as tigers but as cunning as wolves, which made them very difficult to hunt.","The points the students would receive stayed the same.","So did the rules.","Pei Si walked at the very front. She turned around and smiled at Feng Wu. “Feng Wu, I heard that you were the one who killed all those White Lion Elephants last time.”","Chaoge had let it slip when the others pushed her too hard.","Feng Wu didn’t stop her from telling others, nor was she deliberately hiding her capability. People just didn’t believe her.","Zhen Ya smirked. It seemed that Pei Si, the second-best student in Class E, didn’t like Feng Wu either. What great news.","Pei Si pondered.","Wang Junwen had given her a mission with a reward of 500 points.","It was rather straightforward. She needed to injure Feng Wu to the point that she needed to stay in bed for at least three months.","Pei Si didn’t find the task difficult.","After all, she was the second-best student in Class E and should be able to overpower Feng Wu, the new student.","The problem was how to make it look like an accident.","After some consideration, Pei Si decided to use the Nether Wolf Tigers.","What she didn’t know was that Sun Jingyu had tried something similar once and had failed miserably.","Pei Si’s ignorance gave her confidence.","She smiled at Feng Wu when the first Nether Wolf Tiger appeared. “Feng Wu, would you like to give it a go?”","Feng Wu glanced at her and struck out without hesitation.","She used her bare hands.","With a thump, the Nether Wolf Tiger was sent flying and made a muffled sound when its giant body hit the ground.","Pei Si’s eyes widened, and she stared at Feng Wu.","That was fast...","Chaoge and Zi Ling approached the Nether Wolf Tiger when Feng Wu was done.","They knew what to do.","One opened the Nether Wolf Tiger’s head and removed the crystal core.","The other skinned the beast.","The whole process took less than three seconds.","Pei Si was speechless.","She tried to convince herself that she couldn’t trust her eyes.","Either that, or the Nether Wolf Tiger was too weak.","Magical beasts were divided into different levels as well, and this one had to be one of the weaker ones.","Sun Jingyu and her team were shadowing Feng Wu’s team without getting too close.","Through the gaps between branches, they saw how Feng Wu killed the Nether Wolf Tiger with one strike. Sun Jingyu said to her teammates, “See? I told you Feng Wu was good.”","Gu Xingyuan’s face darkened.","It was just one beast."]},{"number":2580,"title":"Chapter 2580 - Genius Student (4)","paragraphs":["Gu Xingyuan smirked inwardly.","It was just one Nether Wolf Tiger. Why were they so excited?","Gu Xingyuan couldn’t stand the way Sun Jingyu worshiped Feng Wu, so he said coldly, “We’ll go in a different direction.”","But Sun Jingyu wouldn’t have it.","Becoming the MVP of this event wasn’t her aim.","With Feng Wu around, she couldn’t be the MVP even if she wanted to.","Sun Jingyu was here to see how Feng Wu defeated Pei Si.","Therefore, she immediately turned down Gu Xingyuan’s suggestion.","“Why should we? I think following Feng Wu’s team is a great idea.”","Gu Xingyuan said coldly, “Don’t you want to be first?”","Sun Jingyu found the question idiotic. “Me? First?”","Chu Junying asked, “What’s wrong with that?”","Didn’t everyone want to be first?","Sun Jingyu responded with a sneer, “With Feng Wu here, who else can be first?”","Gu Xingyuan’s face turned even darker.","He walked away without saying a word.","Chu Junying threw a dirty look at Sun Jingyu and followed Gu Xingyuan.","Mu Qianqian tugged at Sun Jingyu’s sleeve and sounded concerned. “Jingyu, I heard that Gu Xingyuan is frighteningly capable!”","Sun Jingyu was speechless. “He can’t be more frightening than Feng Wu. Don’t worry. He’ll never be Feng Wu’s match.”","Mu Qianqian stomped her foot. “Jingyu! Gu Xingyuan is on our team! Don’t you want to be first?”","Sun Jingyu gave her a strange look. “Wanting it is very far from getting it.”","Before Mu Qianqian could say anything, Sun Jingyu said, “You won’t be disappointed if you don’t have any expectations. You’d better give up that idea because you’re bound to be disappointed.”","The memory of Feng Wu killing the White Lion Elephants was still fresh in her mind.","That scene would probably stick with her forever.","Mu Qianqian wasn’t convinced. She turned around and watched Feng Wu’s team through the gaps in the branches.","She wanted to see exactly how capable Feng Wu was.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu’s team ran into some Nether Wolf Tigers again.","There were two of them.","Zhen Ya was about to attack, when Pei Si stopped her. She shook her head at Zhen Ya and gestured in Feng Wu’s direction.","Zhen Ya took the hint.","The two girls smiled at each other with vicious looks in their eyes.","Pei Si spoke again. “Feng Wu, since you’re so capable, why don’t you take care of these two as well?”","Feng Wu didn’t give her so much as a glance before she raised her fists.","Thump!","There were two loud thumps.","The two Nether Wolf Tigers were sent flying and fell to the ground.","It only took her one strike...","Pei Si was speechless.","Zhen Ya didn’t know what to say.","They looked at each other and couldn’t believe their eyes.","No, Feng Wu couldn’t be that powerful. Something had to be wrong.","According to Mr. Luo, Nether Wolf Tigers were as fierce as White Lion Elephants. How could she kill them so easily?","These two beasts had to be the weakest ones!","That was Pei Si’s thought.","Wang Junwen had told her where she could find large packs of Nether Wolf Tigers. She didn’t think she would need them, but now..."]},{"number":2581,"title":"Chapter 2581 - Let’s Begin (1)","paragraphs":["They ran into five more Nether Wolf Tigers as they marched on, and Feng Wu took care of all of them.","She never needed more than one strike.","Pei Si and Zhen Ya grew uneasy.","They looked at each other more and more often.","Zhen Ya wouldn’t accept reality. She slipped away and found a Nether Wolf Tiger herself.","She wanted to know if they were as weak as she assumed.","She learned the answer the hard way.","They were anything but weak.","She had to give all she had just to hold off the Nether Wolf Tiger, and it ran away in the end.","It was such a powerful beast!","Zhen Ya saw Feng Wu in a different light when she returned.","As usual, Feng Wu killed Nether Wolf Tigers, and Chaoge and Zi Ling took care of the crystal cores and the skinning of the beasts. While they were away, Zhen Ya led Pei Si to the side.","“Pei Si, tell me the truth. Are you going after Feng Wu?”","Pei Si looked at Zhen Ya suspiciously.","Zhen Ya gritted her teeth. “Not only did Feng Wu injure my mom, she humiliated her as well. I must have my revenge!”","Pei Si suddenly smiled. “Is that so? I don’t have anything against Feng Wu, though.”","She was very careful.","Although the enemy of an enemy was a friend, she still didn’t reveal the task which Wang Junwen had given to her.","Zhen Ya smirked and believed that they had a tacit understanding.","“You should stay away from the place we’re about to go next,” Pei Si hinted to Zhen Ya.","Given Zhen Ya’s background, things would become complicated if Mr. Zhu learned what happened. Therefore, Pei Si tried to send Zhen Ya away.","She thought she would need to do some convincing, but to her surprise, Zhen Ya agreed at once.","Pei Si gave Feng Wu a taunting look after Zhen Ya left.","I was going to put you in bed for three months, but since you won’t cooperate, I won’t be so civil anymore.","At that thought, Pei Si smiled at Feng Wu. “Feng Wu, you’re amazing! I’m sure we’ll become the top team! You’re absolutely fantastic!”","She clapped her hands in excitement.","Feng Wu watched her in silence.","Chaoge shook her head.","Zi Ling didn’t say a word either.","Pei Si couldn’t smile anymore. Somehow, she felt foolish.","She cleared her throat to cover her embarrassment and led the way.","She thought,? That mysterious tutor helped you kill all those White Lion Elephants, and you took advantage of that.","That stupid Duan Chaoge told the others that you killed thousands of White Lion Elephants on your own.","Ha!","Pei Si smirked inwardly. She was going to lead the others to a pack of Nether Wolf Tigers.","No tutor will come to save you this time!","You can’t be lucky all the time!","Pei Si thought that she had hidden her intention well, but she didn’t know that this was the second time that Feng Wu had experienced such a thing. She could figure it out without any difficulty.","While Pei Si was leading the way, the others exchanged looks.","Chaoge wondered how stupid Pei Si could be.","Zi Ling didn’t know what to say.","Before, she had always revered Sun Jingyu and Pei Si, the top two students in her class.","However, she was disillusioned when she saw the other side of Sun Jingyu. Now, it was Pei Si’s turn.","Maybe Pei Si wasn’t as foolish as she seemed? Zi Ling wouldn’t give up hope yet.","However..."]},{"number":2582,"title":"Chapter 2582 - Let’s Begin (2)","paragraphs":["However, Pei Si soon proved that Zi Ling shouldn’t have had any faith in her.","She led the team to a pack of Nether Wolf Tigers.","There were a hundred of them.","Pei Si smiled at Feng Wu. “Since you’re so amazing, why don’t you take care of them all?”","She backed away after that.","She expected that Chaoge would scold her.","After all, she was trying to get Feng Wu killed.","To her surprise, Chaoge didn’t say anything, nor did Zi Ling.","Feng Wu didn’t even look in her direction.","She had done such a horrible thing, but no one said anything.","Pei Si was still wondering what was happening, when Feng Wu struck out.","This time, she finally drew out her sword.","Fallen Star Sword, first stance!","And it was all she needed.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","The heads of all one hundred Nether Wolf Tigers exploded.","Pei Si was astonished.","But Chaoge wasn’t.","She took out a large sack and told Zi Ling to hold the other end of the opening.","They made sure that the sack stayed wide open.","Whoosh!","The crystal cores flew out of the exploded heads and into the sack.","Soon, the sack was filled with crystal cores.","Pei Si was astonished.","She stood there frozen. She looked like she had been struck by lightning.","She couldn’t think straight.","That was too hard to believe.","She opened her mouth but no sound would come out.","How was that possible?","Wasn’t Feng Wu supposed to be useless?","Didn’t Feng Wu get into the War Academy because she was well-connected?","What...","What was going on?","It only took her one strike to blow up a hundred heads!","How did the crystal cores fly out?","And it wasn’t just that.","How did they fly accurately into that sack?","Pei Si didn’t know if she was crazy or blind.","She was befuddled.","Hence...","“So, those 1,000... 1,000 beasts...” Pei Si felt like crying. “It was you, wasn’t it?”","Feng Wu remained perfectly calm. She couldn’t understand why Pei Si was so agitated.","Chaoge smiled at Pei Si.","“That’s right. It was Xiao Wu. Didn’t I tell you so?”","Pei Si was astonished.","Yes, Chaoge had, but Pei Si hadn’t believed her.","No one had.","Pei Si wasn’t the only one who was astonished.","Sun Jingyu looked at Mu Qianqian smugly.","“See? I told you! Feng Wu is a genius! There’s no one like her!”","Mu Qianqian was completely dumbfounded.","“Oh my god...”","She covered her mouth and couldn’t believe her eyes.","She pointed at Feng Wu. “She...”","Sun Jingyu was pleased. “You saw correctly. The world hasn’t fallen apart. Feng Wu is that capable.” She knew that Feng Wu was even more capable than she looked.","Sun Jingyu smiled inwardly as she studied the look on Mu Qianqian’s face.","Just then!"]},{"number":2583,"title":"Chapter 2583 - Let’s Begin (3)","paragraphs":["Just then...","A shadow jumped at Feng Wu.","The energy he exerted was like a tidal wave. It was terrifying.","Sun Jingyu was astonished and froze on the spot.","She wasn’t alone. Even Pei Si, who was more capable than she was, forgot to react. She just stood there.","The speed was terrifying. Who was this man in black?","The man ignored everyone else. Feng Wu was his only target.","A short distance away, Zhen Ya hid behind an old tree with a smirk on her face.","Feng Wu, you’re going to die!","I bet you didn’t see that coming, being killed by Mr. Luo!","Yes, Zhen Ya had gone to Mr. Luo for help.","He had always liked Ms. Zhen, and had been furious when he heard Zhen Ya’s story.","But as a teacher, he couldn’t openly assassinate a student.","Therefore, he put on the black costume and covered his face with a black scarf before he attacked Feng Wu.","He believed that Feng Wu was a weakling and that he could finish her off without breaking a sweat.","But he was surprised by how capable Feng Wu was.","Feng Wu took action before Mr. Luo could lay a finger on her.","No one saw how she did it.","They only saw her reach out with her sword.","Whoosh!","The man’s throat was cut open, and blood gushed out.","The man opened his eyes in disbelief. He couldn’t believe that he was going to die like this.","“Ahhh!!!”","Zhen Ya screamed at the top of her lungs.","That was Mr. Luo.","She had invited him to take part in this mission.","And he was...","Was Feng Wu even human?","That was so frightening.","Scared out of her wits, Zhen Ya turned around and sprang off, fearing that she might become the next target. She stumbled and fell, but she immediately got up and kept running down the mountain.","Feng Wu frowned at the man.","She had recognized the person as soon as he showed up.","She could have killed Mr. Luo instantly, but she chose not to.","Doing that would create too much trouble.","It wasn’t something she couldn’t resolve, but it would take more time.","Compared with that, she would rather have Mr. Luo suffer and wish that he was dead.","“Who’s he? Who’s this man?” Pei Si finally came to her senses.","Blood was still gushing out of the man’s neck when she ripped the black scarf off his face.","She was dumbfounded when she saw his face.","OMG!","How could it be...","Mr. Luo covered the wound on his neck, gave Feng Wu a dirty look, and walked away after glancing in Pei Si’s direction.","Pei Si said, “He... I...”","She couldn’t form a coherent sentence.","It took her a long while to calm down. She stared at Feng Wu and asked, “Was that really Mr. Luo?”","Feng Wu glanced at her. “You’re mistaken.”","Pei Si said, “No, I’m not. That was obviously...”","Feng Wu said, “We only have a Mr. Luo who resigned. We don’t have a Mr. Luo who attempted to kill his student.”"]},{"number":2584,"title":"Chapter 2584 - Let’s Begin (4)","paragraphs":["Pei Si was smart and immediately took the hint.","If she hadn’t removed the black scarf and exposed Mr. Luo...","Maybe he could...","Pei Si was frustrated. She felt that it was all her fault.","Feng Wu looked at her and said casually, “If you hadn’t done that, he would have died.”","Pei Si didn’t understand at first.","But she soon realized what Feng Wu meant.","Because of that, her pupils contracted.","Feng Wu had made it very clear.","She had wanted to kill Mr. Luo, but she decided to expose him instead, which was worse than death.","“How did you know that I would remove his...” Pei Si was bewildered.","Feng Wu said in resignation, “You’re not the only person here.”","Pei Si realized that all her frustration was for nothing.","Something struck Pei Si, and she stared at Feng Wu again. “Wait... You defeated Mr. Luo with one strike. What level are you now?”","She felt uneasy.","Feng Wu looked at her and shook her head.","Pei Si immediately turned from a proud princess to a fangirl. She caught up with Feng Wu and asked, “Hey, tell me. What level are you now?”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “Go away.”","Pei Si seemed wounded.","Chaoge was speechless. Pei Si was the one who had tried to kill Xiao Wu, but why was she behaving like someone who had been mistreated?","Sun Jingyu saw Pei Si flitting around with her head lowered.","A person’s enemy was usually the person who understood them the best.","Sun Jingyu had been competing with Pei Si long enough to know her well.","She realized that Pei Si was trying to jump onto Feng Wu’s wagon.","That wouldn’t do!","“Jingyu, what are you doing?” Mu Qianqian grabbed her arm when she saw that Sun Jingyu was walking toward Feng Wu.","“I need to befriend Feng Wu! I can’t let Pei Si beat me to it!”","Sun Jingyu pushed her away and ran faster.","Pei Si was alarmed when she saw her archenemy running toward her.","Sun Jingyu pointed at Pei Si and said loudly, “Feng Wu, Pei Si is trying to kill you!”","Pei Si stared at Sun Jingyu in disbelief. She had betrayed her!","She glared at Sun Jingyu and said in a warning tone, “That’s outright slander!”","Sun Jingyu smirked. “Are you saying that you didn’t accept the mission to kill Feng Wu? If that’s not the case, you wouldn’t have teamed up with her! Can you swear that you’re completely innocent?”","Pei Si was astonished.","Sun Jingyu!","She decided that she would reciprocate.","“Sun Jingyu, don’t talk like you didn’t try it before! You’re not innocent either!”","Pei Si didn’t see it coming.","“That’s right. I did accept that mission once, but I told Feng Wu about it already. What about you? If I hadn’t exposed you, were you going to try again?”","Pei Si thought,? How am I supposed to do that?","Had they not seen what happened to Mr. Luo? She only wanted more points, not death!","After Mr. Luo ran away, Pei Si gave up the idea completely. Right now, she was only trying to fawn on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu, Chaoge and Zi Ling sat on the ground and watched how Sun Jingyu and Pei Si aired each other’s dirty laundry."]},{"number":2585,"title":"Chapter 2585 - Feng Wu on the Move (1)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu, Chaoge and Zi Ling sat on the ground and watched how Sun Jingyu and Pei Si aired each other’s dirty laundry.","It was like they were enjoying a show.","Feng Wu then heard the name Wang Junwen.","“Hold on.” Feng Wu cut them off. “Who’s Wang Junwen?”","Sun Jingyu and Pei Si gave each other astonished looks.","They had revealed the identity of their employer when they were shouting at each other.","That was against the rule. It was supposed to be a secret.","Sun Jingyu and Pei Si looked at each other again and saw what the other person was thinking.","They both knew that if they didn’t come clean, the other person would do so just to please Feng Wu.","Therefore —","They said in unison, “That’s Wang Junwen of Class D!”","Feng Wu rose to her feet.","Chaoge did the same.","Sun Jingyu and Pei Si were perplexed. Where was Feng Wu going?","Sun Jingyu tugged at Zi Ling. “What’s Feng Wu...”","Zi Ling lifted her dress so that the hem didn’t touch the ground. “I have no idea, but we’ll know if we follow her.”","She ran after Feng Wu.","Sun Jingyu and Pei Si exchanged looks. Because of the grudges they held against each other, they snorted, but still sprang off toward Feng Wu.","“Xiao Wu, where are you going? Let me show you the way.” Sun Jingyu pushed Zi Ling away and ran next to Feng Wu.","Pei Si wouldn’t be left behind. She also caught up with Feng Wu and pushed Chaoge out of the way. “Xiao Wu, I know the school grounds well. If you’re looking for someone, I know where to find them.”","Feng Wu smiled mockingly. “Take me to Wang Junwen.”","What?","Both Pei Si and Sun Jingyu stopped when they heard that.","Wang Junwen?","Th- this...","Pei Si didn’t dare say another word, nor did she dare follow Feng Wu. She quietly left the team.","Sun Jingyu smiled awkwardly. “Xiao Wu, I don’t think I should go with you either...”","Feng Wu gave her a knowing look.","Sun Jingyu blushed. “I apologize for what I did to you before. That was so ignorant of me. I’m sorry... I won’t bother you again...”","She wanted to leave after that.","Feng Wu smiled at her. “Did I say that you could leave?”","Sun Jingyu stared at her.","Feng Wu chuckled. “You can only leave when I tell you so. Do you think you can leave just because you want to?”","Sun Jingyu wanted to retort, but she thought about Feng Wu’s capability and decided that she shouldn’t say anything.","“And you, Pei Si,” Feng Wu said quietly before Pei Si ran out of sight. “You can leave. That’s okay. As long as you don’t regret it in the future...”","Pei Si froze on the spot.","What did Feng Wu mean by that? She was obviously threatening her!","Pei Si didn’t want to give in, but she recalled the way Feng Wu had killed all the Nether Wolf Tigers and the fact that Mr. Luo had been defeated in a single strike... She was scared.","She walked back to Feng Wu with her head lowered and said gingerly, “I can go with you, but don’t make me confront Wang Junwen.”","Feng Wu glanced at her but didn’t say anything. She kept on walking with no expression on her face.","Sun Jingyu and Pei Si followed her, both looking depressed."]},{"number":2586,"title":"Chapter 2586 - Feng Wu on the Move (2)","paragraphs":["Chaoge was excited about going to see Wang Junwen.","Zi Ling was excited as well, but she felt uneasy at the same time.","Class D.","They were having seminars in groups of 100 students.","Feng Wu asked around, and when she learned that Wang Junwen was in the fire element class, she headed straight for the classroom.","Seeing that Feng Wu was going to charge into the classroom, Zi Ling stopped her. “Xiao Wu, what are you doing?”","Feng Wu said, “I’m looking for someone.”","Zi Ling said, “If you’re looking for Wang Junwen, why don’t we wait until the class is over? I don’t think we should make a scene, right?”","Feng Wu smirked. The louder the noise, the better.","However, it seemed luck was on Wang Junwen’s side. The bell rang at that moment, and the class was over.","The tutor left with books under his arm, and students came out one by one.","There were over ten classes, each containing over 100 students.","Wang Junwen came out, chatting merrily with her classmates.","She smiled at Ding Yi. “Don’t worry. The person you hate, you’ll never see her again.”","Ding Yi was surprised. “You’re not talking about...”","Wang Junwen raised her chin. “You know who it is, but don’t say the name out loud.”","Ding Yi grabbed Wang Junwen’s hand excitedly. “Did you send someone to do the job?”","Wang Junwen said proudly, “Of course I did.”","Ding Yi was pleasantly surprised. “It must have cost you a fortune! Who did you send?”","Wang Junwen said, “Who else could it be? The problem belongs to Class E, so someone from Class E should solve it. Did you think I would do it myself? They’re too petty to be worth my attention.”","Ding Yi said, “You really are a girl of action. I almost feel sorry for Feng Wu. After this, Miss Qingluan will think so highly of you. She still doesn’t have a disciple yet, and you...”","Ding Yi felt sorry for herself now. “If I had known, I would have done it myself!”","Wang Junwen feigned a modest tone. “I just don’t like her. It has nothing to do with Miss Qingluan. I didn’t do it to become her disciple.”","Ding Yi smirked inwardly and thought,? You liar. You would never try so hard otherwise.","Three male students were with them as well.","The five of them usually worked as a team, so they came to classes together as well.","The three boys were Yu Hong, Tang Ziqiu, and Sikong Wenming.","Yu Hong was secretly in love with Wang Junwen, but he didn’t dare express his feelings, so he only hovered around Wang Junwen all the time.","Tang Ziqiu and Sikong Wenming were Yu Hong’s good friends, so they were happy to hang out with the group.","They listened to Wang Junwen and Ding Yi’s conversation.","Although the girls didn’t make it very explicit, the boys could roughly figure out what the two girls were talking about.","Yu Hong frowned at Wang Junwen. “Did you hire someone to go after Feng Wu?”","Wang Junwen knew about his secret crush on her, but she pretended that she didn’t know. However, she kept using Yu Hong’s affections for her.","She glanced at Yu Hong. “Tell me, are you on my side? Will you support me no matter what?”","Yu Hong said, “Of course. You don’t need to ask that question.”","Wang Junwen glanced at Ding Yi. She was pleased with what she had achieved.","Ding Yi gritted her teeth in frustration."]},{"number":2587,"title":"Chapter 2587 - Feng Wu on the Move (3)","paragraphs":["Wang Junwen was better-looking than she was, and the guys all liked her! It was as if nothing bad could happen to her!","Ding Yi angrily cursed Wang Junwen in her head.","Then, they heard a voice.","“Wang Junwen, come out!”","That voice!","The class had just ended, and hundreds of students were still in the courtyard. They all looked in the direction of the front gate.","There was no one there.","The students were amazed.","Who was it?","Wang Junwen frowned, startled by the voice.","It sounded like a thunderclap in her ears and made her jump.","She let out a breath of relief when she didn’t find anyone at the front gate.","The next second, a person dressed all in red appeared at the entrance.","Everyone cried out when they saw who it was.","“Isn’t that Feng Wu?”","Because of what Zuo Qingluan had done on the first day of school, almost every student in the War Academy knew what Feng Wu looked like.","If it were anyone else, they probably would have forgotten her face right away.","But Feng Wu was different.","She was too beautiful to forget.","“It’s you!” Wang Junwen stared at Feng Wu, her face darkening.","Feng Wu looked past Wang Junwen and spoke to the crowd behind her. “Wang Junwen, come out!”","Wang Junwen’s face went pale with fury.","She was standing right in front of Feng Wu, but the latter acted as if she wasn’t there. She was even looking at the other students.","Wang Junwen believed that Feng Wu was ignoring her on purpose.","She stepped out and glared at Feng Wu. “I’m Wang Junwen.”","As soon as she said that, Feng Wu charged at her like a gust of wind.","Smack!","She slapped Wang Junwen in the face.","Wang Junwen was stunned for a moment, along with everyone else.","Realizing what had happened, she shouted at Feng Wu, “I’m going to kill you!”","She jumped at Feng Wu.","There was a sharp sword in her hand, and she aimed at Feng Wu’s forehead. It was her most lethal move.","Her classmates gave Feng Wu sympathetic looks.","They believed that Feng Wu really was going to die.","When a student of Class E came to provoke a student of Class D, she had it coming when she got killed.","Yu Hong and the others watched as Wang Junwen charged at Feng Wu.","The tip of Wang Junwen’s sword was only a centimeter away from Feng Wu.","Feng Wu turned around and kicked the hilt of the sword.","The sword spun around in mid-air, and the blade landed on Wang Junwen’s neck.","There was the sound of metal cutting flesh.","Whoosh!","Blood gushed out.","Everyone sucked in their breaths.","OMG!","They stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","They couldn’t believe their eyes.","One stance.","That was all Feng Wu needed.","She was a new student!","And she was from Class E!","Yu Hong immediately ran to Wang Junwen and caught her before she fell to the ground.","“Junwen! Junwen!”","Yu Hong cried out.","Everyone looked at Wang Junwen. Blood was gushing out of the wound in her neck.","She wouldn’t stop bleeding.","Was Wang Junwen going to die?","Did Feng Wu just kill Wang Junwen with a single strike?"]},{"number":2588,"title":"Chapter 2588 - Feng Wu on the Move (4)","paragraphs":["Yu Hong stared at Feng Wu with a murderous look in his eyes. “You killed her! I’m gonna kill you!”","He let go of Wang Junwen and charged at Feng Wu like an angry beast.","Something happened when he was half a meter away from Feng Wu.","There was a loud thump.","Feng Wu kicked him away.","Everyone was speechless.","When Feng Wu defeated Wang Junwen, some students thought that it was dumb luck.","However, they couldn’t say that when she defeated Yu Hong with a single strike again.","Feng Wu had formidable power and had used it to defeat Wang Junwen and Yu Hong.","The students of Class D wondered what was going on.","They all felt humiliated.","In their vocabulary, Class E was synonymous with weaklings.","Lu Yi was the student in charge of the students taking part in this particular seminar.","She frowned at Feng Wu.","She didn’t take action because she didn’t know if she could defeat Feng Wu.","“Why?”","Lu Yi’s face was livid. “Why did you attack Wang Junwen?”","Feng Wu only glanced at her before walking away.","Just like that.","All the students of Class D watched in disbelief.","How could she leave like that?","Sun Jingyu and Pei Si exchanged looks, both feeling lucky to have escaped death.","They thought that Feng Wu had brought them here to prove that Wang Junwen had hired someone to kill her. To their surprise, Feng Wu didn’t say a word before she left without hesitation.","They went back to Class E.","By then, everyone had come back to hand in their crystal cores.","Sun Jingyu smacked her forehead.","How could she have forgotten about the task?","She turned around to look at the enigmatic Feng Wu. She made a mental note that she should never offend Feng Wu.","Gu Xingyuan came back, followed by Chu Junying.","Gu Xingyuan gave Sun Jingyu an arrogant glance when he walked past her.","Chu Junying showed off the bag of crystal cores in front of Sun Jingyu because Sun Jingyu had said that with Feng Wu around, no one else could become the MVP.","To Chu Junying and Gu Xingyuan’s disappointment, Sun Jingyu paid no attention to their bag of crystal cores. Her head was lowered, and her mind was elsewhere.","Feng Wu’s team was nearby, so Chu Junying tried to strike up a conversation.","They had been on the same team before, so Chu Junying knew Pei Si relatively well.","She asked deliberately, “Why are you back so early? I bet Feng Wu found a lot of crystal cores for you.”","Only then did Pei Si remember that they were supposed to collect crystal cores. She scratched her head and smiled awkwardly. “Well...”","Chu Junying thought she was embarrassed because they hadn’t found many crystal cores, so she said, “I heard that Feng Wu killed over a thousand White Lion Elephants all by herself last time. That was amazing! Did she do that again?”","Pei Si thought, “I don’t know exactly what level Feng Wu is, but...","“She struck down Wang Junwen, who’s much better than I am, with a single blow. It’ll take her even less effort to deal with me...”","The idea made Pei Si even more depressed, and she looked crestfallen.","Chu Junying was secretly elated when she saw this, but she didn’t let her face betray her.","She went back to Gu Xingyuan and whispered, “We’re definitely going to win this time.”","Gu Xingyuan snorted."]},{"number":2589,"title":"Chapter 2589 - Feng Wu on the Move (5)","paragraphs":["Gu Xingyuan snorted.","He believed that Feng Wu was nowhere close to his level.","Once the process of handing in the crystal cores started, everyone was curious as to who the top student would be.","Many students believed that since Sun Jingyu and Gu Xingyuan were both in Team 1, it was only natural that their team would come in first.","Some people didn’t agree because they heard that Feng Wu had killed 1,000 White Lion Elephants in one go.","Some of them were stubborn enough to believe that Feng Wu could still be the MVP.","They were still arguing when the results came out.","Team 1 really became the top team, and Gu Xingyuan was the best team member.","“I was right! Jingyu’s team is the best!”","“I told you Gu Xingyuan is good, but you wouldn’t listen! Who’s the joke now?!”","“I can’t believe that people expected Feng Wu to be first. How ridiculous.”","“The hilarious part is that someone actually believed that she killed 1,000 White Lion Elephants!”","“I can’t believe that Feng Wu! The mysterious tutor killed the White Lion Elephants, but she tried to take the credit?”","...","Everyone was discussing it actively.","Sun Jingyu was awfully quiet, and Chu Junying glanced at their class president and team leader, displeased.","Why is she like that?","She took advantage of us!","Xingyuan was the one who killed all the Nether Wolf Tigers; she has no idea how much work he had to do!","Chu Junying grumpily jabbed Sun Jingyu in the arm. “Hey, you should collect the points now!”","“Right. Right...” Sun Jingyu woke up from her reverie and sighed heavily.","Chu Junying couldn’t believe it.","Did she have some problem with Gu Xingyuan becoming the best team member?","Chu Junying looked at Pei Si in regret, wishing that she had teamed up with her instead.","However, when she looked at Pei Si, she realized in surprise that the latter was lost in thought, just like Sun Jingyu. She seemed so defeated that one would think her world had collapsed.","The strangest thing was that Mr. Luo wasn’t there.","Instead, Mr. Zhu, who seldom dealt with students, came out to distribute the points.","The way he looked at Feng Wu was rather strange as well...","Chu Junying was speechless.","Did she miss something? She couldn’t understand the situation.","Soon, she would know why Sun Jingyu and Pei Si reacted so strangely.","Meanwhile, a large group of students from Class D was on their way to Class E; there were at least a few hundred of them.","Yu Hong was in the lead, followed by Tang Ziqiu and Sikong Wenming.","Next to them was a person who was about two meters tall.","“Students of Class D?”","“The guy in the middle in the front – isn’t that Lei Bao, one of the best students of Class D?”","“That’s right! It really is him! He’s ranked 300th in Class D, right?”","“No, he’s not! That was a long time ago! According to the latest assessment results, he’s in the top 100 now!”","“Lei Bao is such a genius! Just a while ago, he was one of us, but now, he’s among the top 100 students of Class D! I envy him so much!”","“Look at his expression! He looks like he’s going to kill someone! I wouldn’t mess with him.”","“Hey, he’s coming our way! So are the other students of Class D!”","The students of Class E grew uneasy. They had no idea what was going on, but they were scared..."]},{"number":2590,"title":"Chapter 2590 - Feng Wu Makes a Name For Herself (1)","paragraphs":["Hundreds of students of Class D were coming their way.","Students of Class E were so frightened that their faces turned ghastly pale.","Seeing this, Mr. Zhu had to intervene.","However, Yu Hong cupped his hands at him before he could say anything. “Mr. Zhu, this is between students. We’d appreciate it if you could stay out of it.”","Mr. Zhu nodded. “Let’s do it by the book.”","Yu Hong nodded.","Mr. Zhu used to teach Yu Hong and trusted his former student, so he nodded and agreed not to get involved.","Yu Hong walked up to Feng Wu and stared at her with emotionless eyes.","The other students of Class D followed Yu Hong and kept their cold gazes on her as well.","Feng Wu?!","Students of Class E looked at one another in confusion.","What was going on?","Did Feng Wu offend someone in Class D?","Yu Hong gritted his teeth and said to Feng Wu, “You killed Wang Junwen!”","Everyone sucked in their breaths when they heard that.","Wang Junwen...","Many students in Class E knew Wang Junwen because she used to be in Class E as well.","Everyone was talking actively.","“Is Wang Junwen dead?”","“Did Feng Wu kill Wang Junwen?”","“That’s impossible! I’m not saying that Feng Wu is too good to do such a thing, but isn’t Feng Wu a cripple? How could she have the power to kill Wang Junwen?”","None of the students in Class E believed that accusation.","But students of Class D were filled with indignant rage.","Tang Ziqiu pointed at Feng Wu. “She came to Class D an hour ago and killed Wang Junwen in front of hundreds of students! We all saw it!”","“What? She killed her in public?”","“Then Feng Wu is...”","“Did we all underestimate her?”","...","Seeing that the Class E students only cared about Feng Wu’s capability, Tang Ziqiu was frustrated.","Mr. Zhu thought,? Of course, Feng Wu is capable enough to kill Wang Junwen.","She could kill ten Wang Junwens put together without breaking a sweat!","Mr. Zhu was confident in Feng Wu’s capability, but killing people in public was a different story.","He frowned at Feng Wu.","“Wang Junwen had it coming!”","Chaoge snorted.","Yu Hong glared at her.","“Is that so? Tell me, then. Why did my student deserve it?” someone asked in a mocking voice.","Mr. Zhu frowned.","He immediately recognized that voice. It was Mr. Wang, the tutor of Class D.","He looked up and saw that he was right. However, there was someone else next to Mr. Wang.","Mr. Wang respected the person so much that he was almost humble.","“Chief Qingluan?” Mr. Zhu frowned.","He still remembered the little episode on the first day of school.","After his defeat, Mr. Zhu had done some investigating.","Teachers could leave the academy every three days, so Mr. Zhu had made a little trip outside.","He had asked around in the imperial capital and managed to gather a lot of information.","He had many doubts as well.","Was Zuo Qingluan really His Royal Highness’s fiancee?","Did His Royal Highness really like her that much?","The information wasn’t all that convincing..."]},{"number":2591,"title":"Chapter 2591 - Feng Wu Makes a Name For Herself (2)","paragraphs":["From what he had heard, Feng Wu was the girl the crown prince was in love with, which confused Mr. Zhu.","Meanwhile!","Mr. Wang followed Zuo Qingluan to Feng Wu’s side.","He stared at Feng Wu so hard, as if he wanted to drill holes in her skin.","“You’re Feng Wu, then?” asked Mr. Wang.","Feng Wu frowned at him. She didn’t know who this man was.","Zi Ling whispered in her ear, “He’s Mr. Wang of Class D.”","They would all rise to Class D one day, so they couldn’t offend this teacher. Zi Ling tugged at Feng Wu’s sleeve, telling her to calm down.","Feng Wu remained calm, but one couldn’t say the same about Mr. Wang.","Wang Junwen was his niece. Her father was Mr. Wang’s brother, who had put Wang Junwen in Mr. Wang’s care.","Then, she was killed.","Mr. Wang would never forgive Feng Wu for that.","Their eyes met, and one could feel the tension in the air.","However, most people had their eyes on Zuo Qingluan.","“Chief Qingluan is here!”","“If I remember correctly, she’s not so fond of Feng Wu.”","“If Feng Wu has killed Wang Junwen, she’s going to die as well!”","“What are you talking about? Chief Qingluan is so noble and above worldly matters! She would never abuse her power for her own private revenge!” Zuo Qingluan’s supporters immediately tried to defend her.","The other students stopped talking, but they wondered whether Zuo Qingluan was as unambitious as she was said to be.","If that were the case, why had she insisted that Feng Wu should become her disciple before? That didn’t sound very unambitious at all.","Quarrels could reveal many things.","When people quarreled, they had to take a stance.","Mr. Wang stared at Feng Wu. “You killed Wang Junwen. Hundreds of students from Class D all witnessed it!”","The students immediately stepped out.","“I’m Yu Hong, and I can prove it!”","“I’m Tang Ziqiu, and I saw it with my own eyes!”","“I’m Sikong Wenming. I saw it, too...”","...","All the other students said similar things.","Students of Class E paled. They gradually lost all hope that Feng Wu would survive this.","She couldn’t, not when so many people wanted her dead.","Mr. Zhu frowned.","He felt that the girl was too smart to put herself in such a desperate situation.","There had to be a twist.","“Didn’t Miss Qingluan think highly of Feng Wu’s talent? Will she do something to help her?” Many students wondered.","But they were disappointed.","Zuo Qingluan said indifferently, “If she killed someone, she’ll have to pay with her own life. That’s the rule.” She gave Feng Wu a sympathetic look. “I appreciate your talent, but I can’t violate school rules, nor can I help you for personal reasons, since you’re a despicable person who doesn’t deserve to be saved.”","Some people agreed with her, but some people frowned.","Somehow, they felt that Chief Qingluan was being petty.","Zuo Qingluan shouldn’t have taken the students for fools.","They had managed to make their way to the War Academy; how foolish could they be?","Feng Wu smirked. “You just have to push me over the cliff, don’t you? Zuo Qingluan, are you really that jealous of me?”","Zuo Qingluan’s face darkened when she heard that.","Jealous? Why would Zuo Qingluan be jealous of Feng Wu? The others were perplexed."]},{"number":2592,"title":"Chapter 2592 - Feng Wu Strikes Back (1)","paragraphs":["“I’m jealous?” Zuo Qingluan glanced at Feng Wu. “Of you?”","She laughed.","Many people laughed with her.","Zuo Qingluan was better than Feng Wu in every aspect, from her capability to her family background, but Feng Wu claimed that Zuo Qingluan was jealous of her.","How ridiculous was that?","“Why should I be jealous of you?” Zuo Qingluan stared at Feng Wu and asked in a taunting voice.","Feng Wu chuckled. “You know what I mean.”","Zuo Qingluan’s face darkened a little. She knew what Feng Wu was referring to.","She was talking about the crown prince’s bias.","That only made Zuo Qingluan angrier.","She knew that the crown prince was more affectionate toward Feng Wu now, and things could get out of hand if she didn’t get rid of Feng Wu quickly enough.","Moreover, she couldn’t do it herself. It had to be someone else.","At that thought, Zuo Qingluan glanced at Mr. Wang, giving him a hint that it was time.","Mr. Wang stared at Feng Wu and announced, “Miss Qingluan is correct. A murderer should pay with their own life. Feng Wu, it’s time to die!”","He made a move before he finished talking.","“Hold on,” Chaoge intervened. “You all agree that a murder is punishable by death, right? Great!”","She smirked. “Wang Junwen deserved it!”","That statement surprised everyone.","Yu Hong’s expression changed.","Chaoge said, “Wang Junwen hired people to assassinate Xiao Wu, so Xiao Wu fought back. What’s wrong with that?”","Mr. Wang sneered at her. “I know Wang Junwen well. Now that she’s gone, you can slander her however you want!”","Chaoge waved at Sun Jingyu.","Sun Jingyu didn’t want to say anything, but she knew that Feng Wu would be very displeased if she remained silent.","However, if she testified, she would be working against Mr. Wang and Zuo Qingluan.","She couldn’t make up her mind.","Feng Wu glanced at her.","It made Sun Jingyu’s stomach lurch.","The look in Feng Wu’s eyes reminded her of the fallen White Lion Elephants.","She would only be telling the truth, so no one would do anything to her, probably.","“That’s right. Wang Junwen did indeed hire me to assassinate Feng Wu.”","Sun Jingyu was the class president of Class E, so everyone knew her face.","Her announcement silenced everyone.","Mr. Wang gave her a threatening look.","Sun Jingyu grew uneasy, but she went on, “Wang Junwen promised that she would give me 300 points after Feng Wu was killed.”","The other students didn’t know what to say.","Did Wang Junwen really do that?","If Sun Jingyu was telling the truth, Wang Junwen had it coming.","Mr. Wang stared at Sun Jingyu. “What proof do you have? Libel is as severe a crime as murder in the War Academy!”","Sun Jingyu had jumped onto Feng Wu’s wagon, so she couldn’t sit on the fence anymore.","She switched on her armband, and everyone recognized the voice that they heard.","Wang Junwen said, “Kill Feng Wu for me, and I’ll give you 300 points.”","Sun Jingyu asked, “Why do you want to kill Feng Wu?”","Wang Junwen said, “Do I need a reason to dislike someone?”","Sun Jingyu said, “No, you don’t, but you need a reason if you want to kill them.”"]},{"number":2593,"title":"Chapter 2593 - Feng Wu Strikes Back (2)","paragraphs":["Wang Junwen hesitated before answering, “If Feng Wu is dead, Miss Qingluan will be glad.”","Sun Jingyu asked, “How does Miss Qingluan have anything to do with it?”","Wang Junwen said, “Miss Qingluan doesn’t like Feng Wu. If I have Feng Wu killed, I think there’s a chance that Miss Qingluan will take me in as her disciple.”","Everyone looked at Zuo Qingluan when they heard those words.","Zuo Qingluan seemed unaffected, but she was secretly annoyed.","“That’s enough!” Fearing that Sun Jingyu would reveal even more secrets, Mr. Wang cut her off.","But things had already become somewhat awkward.","Since Wang Junwen was the one who started everything, it was understandable that Feng Wu would want to retaliate.","Mr. Wang glared at Sun Jingyu. “What if you made up the whole thing?”","Sun Jingyu was furious.","She stared at Mr. Wang. “I didn’t!”","Mr. Zhu backed her up since she was his student. “I trust Sun Jingyu.”","Mr. Wang snorted. “Wang Junwen is dead now, so you can slander her however you want.”","Chaoge laughed. “Slander? Maybe that’s the case if it’s one person; what if two people tell the same story?”","Two people? What was that supposed to mean?","Chaoge stared at Pei Si. “Pei Si, do you have something to add?”","Pei Si had tried to slip away because she didn’t want to get involved.","However, Chaoge picked her out before she could do that.","Chaoge smiled at Pei Si.","“You can choose not to tell the truth, but there will be consequences. Think about Mr. Luo.”","That was what Feng Wu had told Pei Si earlier.","Pei Si wanted to cry. It was time for her to take a side.","All eyes were on her.","What would she say?","Whose side would she be on? Feng Wu’s or Zuo Qingluan’s? Everyone was curious.","Pei Si took a deep breath and made up her mind.","She didn’t say anything. Instead, she switched on her armband, just like Sun Jingyu had.","Wang Junwen’s voice rang out. “Kill Feng Wu for me. You can name your terms.”","Pei Si said, “How about 500 points?”","Wang Junwen said, “That won’t be a problem, as long as you kill her.”","Everyone was speechless.","They all looked at Mr. Wang.","Wang Junwen had failed to have Feng Wu killed the first time, so she had tried again.","According to what she said earlier, she didn’t hold any grudge against Feng Wu, and was only trying to please Zuo Qingluan.","Mr. Wang’s face turned livid.","The other students had been skeptical when Sun Jingyu was the only one who had proof, but Pei Si’s recording made things much more convincing.","Wang Junwen had started the whole thing, so Mr. Wang couldn’t blame anyone for her death. She had it coming.","He had no excuse to kill Feng Wu now.","He glared at Feng Wu and suddenly struck out at her.","Feng Wu frowned and dodged the blow.","Mr. Wang was only trying to vent his rage. He didn’t try to kill Feng Wu.","He had no reason to.","However, everyone frowned and shook their heads.","That was out of line.","Just then, Ding Yi ran toward them, shouting, “Wang Junwen has woken up! She’s not dead! She’s awake!”","What?","Everyone was shocked. Mr. Wang stared at Ding Yi in disbelief. “What did you say?”"]},{"number":2594,"title":"Chapter 2594 - Feng Wu Strikes Back (3)","paragraphs":["Wang Junwen wasn’t dead?","She was alive!","If that was the case, what were they doing here? How embarrassing!","Mr. Wang had never been so humiliated before.","He left without looking at Zuo Qingluan.","From behind, he almost looked like he was fleeing.","With Mr. Wang gone, Zuo Qingluan couldn’t stay there either. She remained composed as she nodded at Mr. Zhu before she looked at Feng Wu.","She spoke to Feng Wu like a teacher disciplining a student. “You’re a good kid. You know when to stop in a fight. I’m pleased.”","She walked away at an unhurried pace.","The students watched in amazement.","“That’s what a fairy should look like. Feng Wu is just a wild kid.”","“But why do I feel that Feng Wu is much better-looking than Miss Qingluan?”","“Good looks don’t matter! It’s the overall feeling that counts!”","“But even by that standard, Feng Wu looks more like a fairy.”","“I don’t want to talk to you anymore!”","...","On their way back, Zi Ling asked excitedly, “Xiao Wu, why didn’t you kill Wang Junwen?”","Feng Wu smiled. “Didn’t you see Zuo Qingluan’s face when she heard that Wang Junwen was alive?”","Zi Ling said, “I saw it! I saw her face! She was so confident that she could nail you, but she seemed very disappointed when they told her that Wang Junwen had survived.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Zi Ling asked, “Did you keep her alive on purpose? You knew this was going to happen when you went to see her, didn’t you?’","Feng Wu said, “Earlier than that, actually.”","To be more precise, she had started planning this ever since she heard Wang Junwen’s name.","Zi Ling was astonished.","Gosh, how intelligent was Feng Wu?!","She had heard about people finding clues from the smallest hints and how someone could advance gradually and become embroiled with every step.","But this was her first time seeing it for herself.","Chaoge patted her on the shoulder. “Why are you so surprised? It’s completely normal for Xiao Wu.”","Zi Ling didn’t know what to say.","She wished that Duan Chaoge would stop saying such things.","“Wait!”","An idea struck Zi Ling, and she grew even more excited.","“The monthly test is coming up! We’re going to be ranked again!”","She looked at Feng Wu with sparkling eyes. “Your name will finally be on the list!”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything, but Chaoge was excited. “Xiao Wu! Your name will be on the billboard! Finally!”","Just like Zi Ling, Chaoge had been looking forward to this day.","Most of the students in Class E were as good as blind. They had no idea how capable Feng Wu was and kept calling her useless.","Feng Wu showed little interest in the news. She shook her head and said, “I don’t think I have to take the test.”","Chaoge said, “Of course you have to! You must take it!”","Zi Ling nodded as well.","As a member of Feng Wu’s team, she desperately wanted other people to know how fantastic Feng Wu was.","She would take pride in it as well.","Feng Wu said indifferently, “Fine, fine. I’ll take the test.”","Meanwhile, students of Class E were still talking about Feng Wu.","At first, only a handful of people liked her. After what happened earlier, most of the students’ attitude toward her had changed."]},{"number":2595,"title":"Chapter 2595 - Feng Wu Strikes Back (4)","paragraphs":["Students of Class E were divided into three groups.","About 500 people were persistent in trashing Feng Wu.","About 800 students remained neutral, finding Feng Wu neither too awful nor too lovely.","The remaining 300 students adored Feng Wu, finding her both beautiful and powerful. She had the courage to charge into Class D all by herself and had managed to get out safely. Not only that, she also defeated the class tutor.","The two opposing groups were arguing.","“What do you see in Feng Wu? Miss Qingluan is the Chosen One.”","“We’re not saying that Chief Qingluan isn’t as good, but it feels really nice to watch Feng Wu take action.”","“That was only dumb luck! Do you know what that means? It means that it only happens once!”","“I don’t buy it! If Feng Wu dared to go in and out of Class D on her own, she would need more than sheer luck!”","“If that’s the case, let’s have a bet! The billboard test is coming up, isn’t it? Let’s bet on her ranking!” One of Feng Wu’s anti-fans snorted.","Feng Wu’s fans were equally persistent. “Sure, let’s bet on it! You don’t scare me!”","Hence, most Class E students participated in the bet without Feng Wu’s knowing.","The neutral group stayed neutral, so the battle was between Feng Wu’s fans and anti-fans.","Lu Qi was the head of the anti-fans.","They needed some candidates to challenge Feng Wu.","It couldn’t be Zuo Qingluan because her status was too high.","Therefore, she went to Sun Jingyu instead.","Sun Jingyu found the suggestion ridiculous. Compete against Feng Wu? Was that a joke? She didn’t have a death wish.","She immediately shook her head. “No, definitely not! I’m not doing it!”","Lu Qi was frustrated and called Sun Jingyu an idiot in her head. She went to Pei Si instead.","Pei Si found the suggestion insane. Fight against Feng Wu? Lu Qi had to be out of her mind!","“No, no, no! Absolutely not! I can never do that!”","Pei Si shook her head and warned Lu Qi, “Do not put my name on the list of Feng Wu’s rivals, or you’ll have me to answer to!”","Lu Qi didn’t know what to say.","Had the top two students of her class lost their minds, or was there really something special about Feng Wu?","Lu Qi shook her head. She firmly believed that Feng Wu was a weakling, and would never believe that Feng Wu actually had any talent.","She then went to Gu Xingyuan.","Gu Xingyuan considered Feng Wu his archenemy, so he and Lu Qi reached an agreement right away.","It was finally the day of the test.","Lu Qi had successfully convinced most people that Feng Wu would fail miserably this time.","The test for the billboard was straightforward. There wasn’t much fighting involved.","Everyone only needed to switch on their armbands, which would then be scanned, and the overall data would determine their position on the billboard.","The actual data wouldn’t be announced, but the rankings were there for everyone to see.","The test started.","Each of the 1600 students of Class E had their armband scanned.","After they were all scanned, the ranking started.","The bottom name was shown first.","The 1600th.","The 1500th.","The 1000th...","Feng Wu’s name was still nowhere to be seen.","Not only couldn’t Feng Wu’s name be seen, Duan Chaoge’s name also didn’t show up either.","Lu Qi tried to convince herself that Feng Wu’s name would pop up any time now.","But she saw her name first.","She was 900th.","Her face paled a little, because it meant that Feng Wu was slightly better than her."]},{"number":2596,"title":"Chapter 2596 - What Is Feng Wu’s Placing? (1)","paragraphs":["Lu Qi was 900th.","Her face paled a little, because it meant that Feng Wu was slightly better than her.","Lu Qi thought that since Feng Wu dared to go to Class D on her own, she should have some talent. She could live with that.","She can’t be much better. I’m sure she’ll be in the 800s.","However...","She was disappointed.","Feng Wu’s name still didn’t show up after the 800th name was announced.","Lu Qi was astonished.","How did this happen?","Did she miss it?","Utterly confused, she grabbed a student next to her and asked, “Did you see Feng Wu’s name? THE Feng Wu?”","The people around her were also Feng Wu’s anti-fans, so they didn’t want Feng Wu to do well either.","“No, I didn’t!” The student sounded agitated.","“So, I didn’t miss anything. Her name hasn’t popped up yet.”","Lu Qi gritted her teeth and decided she would see Feng Wu’s name in the 700s.","However, by the time the 600th name was shown, Feng Wu’s name still hadn’t shown up.","Instead, Lu Qi saw Zi Ling’s name.","By the time they reached the 500s, Chaoge’s name was displayed.","But where was Feng Wu?","Lu Qi wasn’t the only person who was wondering.","Before, they didn’t care about their rankings much, but all their eyes were on the billboard now. They were all waiting to see Feng Wu’s name on the billboard, but it just wouldn’t pop up.","“Is there something wrong with the system?” someone murmured.","“That’s right. Where’s Feng Wu’s name?”","Feng Wu’s anti-fans grew agitated, the neutral ones remained unaffected, and Feng Wu’s fans...","They were surprised at first. Then, they became excited and looked forward to what would happen next.","Zhao Zhen was the head of Feng Wu’s fans. Right now, she was clenching her fists and shouting, “Xiao Wu! You’re the best!”","Zhao Zhen was the only one shouting at first, but soon, her friends joined in, and their voices grew louder and louder.","Lu Qi wouldn’t have it.","She raised an arm and shouted, “Stop Feng Wu! Stop Feng Wu!”","The two groups were scattered among the crowd at first, but after they started shouting, their positions changed as well.","Lu Qi led her team and stood on the left.","Zhao Zhen and her team stood on the right.","The neutral group stood in the middle. They didn’t like Feng Wu well enough to become fans, nor did they dislike her enough to trash her. They were only merry onlookers.","But they were equally curious.","“Who do you think will win the bet, Lu Qi or Zhao Zhen?”","“They’ve both placed huge bets, like 500 points.”","“Gosh! Did they have to do that? That’s a lot of points! It’s just one monthly test.”","“I don’t know where Zhao Zhen got the information from, but she thinks Feng Wu is amazing. On the other hand, Lu Qi hates Feng Wu for no reason. The winner of the bet depends on Feng Wu’s ranking now.”","“I think Feng Wu should be somewhere around the 400s. After all, she’s only a new student. No matter how talented she is, she still needs time to practice her skills.”","“I agree...”","The neutral group believed that Feng Wu wouldn’t go any higher than 400th place..."]},{"number":2597,"title":"Chapter 2597 - What Is Feng Wu’s Placing? (2)","paragraphs":["However, by the time they reached the 400th name, they still hadn’t seen Feng Wu’s name.","“Well... She must be in the 300s, then,” the students thought.","300th wasn’t that different from 400th.","However, Feng Wu’s name was nowhere to be found in the 300s.","Zhao Zhen’s mind was blown.","It had never occurred to her that Feng Wu could be so capable.","Lu Qi was terrified.","She murmured, “How is that possible? We only have 300 names left, but we still haven’t seen her name!”","Zhao Zhen and Lu Qi’s bet was on 250th place.","If Feng Wu was ranked lower than 250th, Lu Qi would win.","Otherwise, Zhao Zhen would win the bet.","290, 280, 270...","Still nothing.","Lu Qi opened her eyes so wide that her eyeballs almost popped out.","She couldn’t believe it.","Feng Wu was just a new student! Could she really be a genius?","Gu Xingyuan and Chu Junying weren’t all that surprised.","They had both seen what Feng Wu could do and believed that she was a Level 6 Spiritual Lord, which would make her one of the best students in Class E.","However, Gu Xingyuan believed he was more powerful than Feng Wu and should be the top student.","Most of the students in Class E hadn’t seen Feng Wu demonstrate her power before, and they were utterly shocked.","Lu Qi was as restless as an ant on a hot pan. She pressed her palms together and murmured, “Please let Feng Wu be the 250th. Don’t let her go up further...”","Her friends gave her sympathetic looks.","Lu Qi kept her eyes shut when she asked, “Where are we now? Can you see Feng Wu’s name?”","Her friends didn’t answer.","Lu Qi’s heart sank. She shouted, “Answer me!”","“There are 230 names left, and Feng Wu’s hasn’t come up yet...”","Lu Qi couldn’t believe her ears.","She thought she was going to faint.","She had lost the bet. How was that possible?","Lu Qi stared at the big screen and started searching the list from the 250th name down. She looked at each name but didn’t find Feng Wu’s name anywhere.","She wouldn’t give up and searched two more times. As expected, she still didn’t get the result she wanted.","So many people were looking for Feng Wu’s name. It was improbable that they had all missed it.","“180th! That’s Feng Wu!” Lu Qi shouted.","She shouted so loudly that her voice cracked.","Her friend tugged at her sleeve. “Calm down! That’s not Feng Wu! That’s Feng Mu!”","Lu Qi took another look and saw that her friend was right.","There were only 180 names left now, but Feng Wu’s still hadn’t shown up. Lu Qi began to lose hope.","Her entire group was crestfallen.","After all, they had already lost the bet to Feng Wu’s fans. They were only here because they wanted an answer. What would Feng Wu’s ranking be?","170, 160, 150...","Still no Feng Wu.","“That’s the 100th! Feng Wu is in the top 100!”","“Still no Feng Wu!”","“Feng Wu is definitely in the top 100 now!”","Feng Wu’s fans were thrilled. They had never thought they would get such a pleasant surprise.","The anti-fans looked defeated."]},{"number":2598,"title":"Chapter 2598 - What Is Feng Wu’s Placing? (3)","paragraphs":["The neutral group was curious about how many more surprises Feng Wu could give them.","90, 80, 70...","Still no Feng Wu.","“Still no?” Mu Qianqian was watching the big screen as well.","Sun Jingyu wanted to roll her eyes.","It then occurred to Mu Qianqian. “Right, she defeated Mr. L...”","Sun Jingyu gave her a dirty look.","Mu Qianqian immediately stopped talking, but she kept looking from side to side.","She looked at the students behind her and was smug when she saw how the others waited curiously for Feng Wu’s name to show up.","They were already excited now, but it wasn’t going to stop any time soon. Feng Wu could kill Mr. Luo with one strike!","Mu Qianqian felt so proud to have been on Feng Wu’s team.","Zhao Zhen grabbed her arm. “Qianqian, look! We only have 50 names left, and we’re still waiting for Feng Wu’s!”","Mu Qianqian feigned a calm tone. “Only 50? Don’t get excited just yet. Wait and see.”","That was all she would reveal. She then turned her head away, unable to conceal the satisfaction in her eyes.","Many people heard what Mu Qianqian said.","Both Zhao Zhen and Lu Qi heard her.","Their eyes widened in disbelief.","Seriously?!","50 names to go, and still no Feng Wu...","Lu Qi shook her head. No, it couldn’t be...","40, 30, 20...","Then the names stopped scrolling.","No one made a sound because that was the standard procedure.","When there were only 20 names left, they didn’t come out in groups of tens.","Only one name would pop out at a time now.","The more important thing was...","“We’re still waiting for Feng Wu’s name!”","The minds of the neutral group were already blown.","Feng Wu’s fans were thrilled.","The anti-fans began to waver.","They had been so confident at first that they could destroy Feng Wu’s reputation, but with everything that had happened, they weren’t so sure anymore.","This world valued power more than anything else, and everyone worshiped the most capable warriors.","They didn’t dislike Feng Wu because they held a grudge against her; it was mainly because she was considered useless. However, if they believed Feng Wu had been wronged, the guilt could quickly turn them into her fans.","A student in the last row quietly moved into the neutral group, where Lu Qi couldn’t see.","More followed, especially in the back where people couldn’t see.","Before long, nearly 100 people switched sides and joined the neutral group, while Lu Qi was having too much of a breakdown to notice.","The names were shown one by one.","20, 19, 18... all the way to the 10th.","Then, the screen paused.","“OMG!”","The anti-fans had stopped talking altogether, and it was the neutral group’s turn to be shocked.","“Am I seeing things? Feng Wu is unbelievable! We only have ten names left! Ten!”","“So, she’s in the top 10!”","Hearing the murmurs, Sun Jingyu and Pei Si looked at each other. Neither seemed surprised.","Top ten?","Maybe that meant a lot to other people."]},{"number":2599,"title":"Chapter 2599 - What Is Feng Wu’s Placing? (4)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu probably wouldn’t blink even if she were first. That was how outstanding she was.","The names of the last ten students appeared on the screen one after another.","4th was Pei Si.","WHAT?!","The students were astonished when Pei Si’s name showed up.","How...","That was Pei Si!","She used to be second on the billboard, but she had dropped two places!","That meant that Feng Wu was better than her!","Sun Jingyu was third.","“Ssss...”","Everyone drew in their breaths.","Sun Jingyu was the class president and had always been the most capable student of Class E. She was third now.","“That is to say, Feng Wu is one of the top two students!”","“She’s only been here for a few days, and she’s already surpassed last month’s best student!”","“Why did they call her useless?! Who said that? Fess up now!”","...","Many people became Feng Wu’s fans immediately after realizing that she outranked Sun Jingyu, who had originally been the class’s top student.","The naysayers kept moving away from their old group to join the neutral one.","100, 200, 300...","There had been 500 of them at first, but there were only 250 left now.","The neutral students were gradually joining the fans as well.","The number of fans grew to 500.","Feng Wu wasn’t aware of any of this.","She stood there with her hands behind her back as if none of this concerned her.","It didn’t.","She put all her effort into cultivating and improving her skills.","Even standing in the middle of the square with all eyes on her, she could still cultivate in her head.","Around her, everyone was busy making bets.","“Do you think Feng Wu will be first?”","“Not in a million years! We still have Gu Xingyuan!”","“That’s right. His team won first place, and he’s the best team member this time. Feng Wu can’t beat that!”","Zhao Zhen said, “That’s because Xiao Wu went to challenge Wang Junwen in Class D and didn’t have time to hunt!”","But many people ignored her.","In the end, almost everyone believed that Gu Xingyuan would be first.","Gu Xingyuan thought the same.","He smiled confidently and waited for his name to come out. He was going to crush Feng Wu.","The second last name came out while everyone watched the screen in excitement.","Gu Xingyuan.","No one could misread that name.","The moment he saw his name, Gu Xingyuan felt as if someone had punched him in the head, making him dizzy.","Second.","He was second.","How was that possible?","He had been too confident, and couldn’t accept the result.","Meanwhile...","Everyone remained perfectly silent.","They held their breaths.","Just like Gu Xingyuan, they found it hard to believe.","Sun Jingyu and Pei Si were about the only people who weren’t surprised.","Zhao Zhen covered her mouth and almost screamed.","“If Gu Xingyuan is second, that means that the top student is...”","The answer couldn’t be any more obvious."]},{"number":2600,"title":"Chapter 2600 - Provocation (1)","paragraphs":["It couldn’t be any more obvious.","Was it Feng Wu?","Was she really going to be first?","Although the students were reasonably certain of the answer, there could still be exceptions.","All three groups stared at the big screen, along with Sun Jingyu, Pei Si, Zi Ling and Chaoge.","Whoosh!","The last name appeared on the screen.","Feng Wu!","“It really is Feng Wu!”","“Oh my god!”","“Feng Wu is first. Seriously? Am I seeing things, or has this world gone insane?”","They didn’t want to believe it, but they had to.","All eyes were on the girl in the red dress.","She already had delicate features and was unbelievably beautiful. Right now, she was standing there as if no worldly matters could affect her. Moreover, she had been proven to be a genius, which only added to her appeal.","More people were leaving the anti-fans group.","The number of Feng Wu’s fans grew again.","“Lu Qi, Lu Qi!” Lu Qi’s friends tried to warn her. “People are leaving! What should we do?!”","Turning around, Lu Qi saw that there were less than 300 people left in her group, and she shouted in utter astonishment, “Everybody should stay where they are! Don’t go anywhere!”","However, her people had lost faith in her and wouldn’t listen.","Lu Qi shouted, “It has to be a misunderstanding! Feng Wu can’t be first! She just can’t!”","Just then, they heard approaching footsteps.","Everyone looked up involuntarily.","It was Wang Junwen.","Didn’t she almost die a short while ago? How had she recovered so fast? There were four other people with her.","Lei Bao and Yu Hong were both by her side.","The other two people were also top students of Class D.","They went up on the stage, and Wang Junwen pointed her sword at Feng Wu. “Feng Wu, I’m challenging you!”","Feng Wu, on the other hand...","She was still cultivating and was on her way to becoming a Spiritual King.","She had completed 10% of the process and was hoping that she could finish another 1% before the test was over.","She was busy cultivating when Wang Junwen challenged her.","She was too absorbed in her cultivation to hear Wang Junwen. However, many students frowned at Wang Junwen’s actions.","Sun Jingyu was the first to intervene. “Junwen, you...”","Wang Junwen silenced her with a dirty look. “Shut up, you traitor!”","Sun Jingyu was infuriated, but she was intimidated by the people Wang Junwen brought with her, so she didn’t say anything else.","Wang Junwen then pointed at Pei Si before she could open her mouth. “You better keep your mouth shut, too!”","Needless to say, Pei Si was furious at the public humiliation.","Wang Junwen stood on the stage and stared at Feng Wu with a taunting look on her face. She smirked. “What now? You’ve gained fame by using me, and you’re now too afraid to do anything, aren’t you? Guess what? You won last time because you ambushed me!”","Ambush?","Lu Qi’s eyes lit up.","Did Feng Wu defeat Wang Junwen because of an ambush?"]}]);
